npm run lint` are both clean.\n   - `vitest run` shows 3 failing files. They are the same 3 failures recorded before this ticket (`DataTable` MUI X exports, `lockout` next-auth import, `useToast` timer), and none of them touch SH-6 code.\n\n## Requirement Results\n\n| Requirement | Status | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| FR-1 | PASS | prisma/schema.prisma (`enum PeriodKind`, `model Period`); migration 20261105000000_timetable; used by tests/integration/timetable-concurrency.test.ts |\n| FR-2 | PASS | `model SchoolDay` + migration; integration \"FR-7/FR-40\" test upserts and reads it |\n| FR-3 | PASS | `model TimetableSlot` with `@@unique([courseId, dayOfWeek, periodId])` and `@@index([academicYearId, dayOfWeek, periodId])` in migration.sql; course FK `ON DELETE CASCADE` |\n| FR-4 | PASS | One additive migration with no ALTERs to existing tables except new FKs; back-relations on Course, Period and Room (schema lines 219/280/418/459); `prisma migrate status` reports it as up to date |\n| FR-5 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `src/app/(app)/admin/timetable/periods/page.tsx` and `BellScheduleEditor.tsx` are missing. Only the API exists. |\n| FR-6 | PASS | src/lib/validators/timetable.ts (`hhmm`, `periodSchema`); service `assertNoOverlap`; tests/unit/timetable-time.test.ts (periodsOverlap, periodSchema) |\n| FR-7 | FAIL | The backend works: `updateSchoolDays` cascade-deletes slots and returns the count (integration \"FR-7/FR-40\"). The ToggleButton editor and the confirmation dialog are missing. |\n| FR-8 | PASS | `deletePeriod` throws CONFLICT with `details.slotCount`; integration \"FR-8\" |\n| FR-9 | PASS | clash-rules.ts TEACHER rule; unit (main and co-teacher, both directions); integration \"FR-9/FR-10\" (exact message) and \"co-teacher clash\" |\n| FR-10 | PASS | ROOM rule; unit; integration exact message `Clash: QA6-R1 is used by QA6-MATH-7A on Monday, QA6-P1.` |\n| FR-11 | PASS | SECTION rule; unit; integration \"FR-11\" exact message |\n| FR-12 | PASS | `overlapByCourse` (ACTIVE only); integration \"FR-12\" (a DROPPED enrollment is excluded, count = 1) |\n| FR-13 | PASS | PERIOD_KIND / NON_TEACHING_DAY; unit; integration \"FR-13\" |\n| FR-14 | PASS | `validateSlot` returns every clash (integration gets TEACHER and ROOM together); PATCH excludes the moving slot (integration \"FR-14/FR-18\", unit \"excludes the moving slot\") |\n| FR-15 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `src/app/(app)/admin/timetable/page.tsx` and `TimetableEditor.tsx` are missing |\n| FR-16 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `src/components/TimetableGrid/` is missing |\n| FR-17 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | Editor is missing (POST /api/timetable/slots exists) |\n| FR-18 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The UI drag, Delete key and confirmation are missing. The PATCH/DELETE service is tested in integration. |\n| FR-19 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The red tint, icon and tooltip are missing. The availability API passes (see FR-36). |\n| FR-20 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The snap-back and toast are missing |\n| FR-21 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The room Popover is missing. `getFreeRooms` / GET /api/timetable/free-rooms is tested in integration \"FR-21\". |\n| FR-22 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The keyboard \"Place course\" dialog is missing |\n| FR-23 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `@dnd-kit/core` 6.3.1 is installed but imported nowhere in src/ |\n| FR-24 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `src/app/(app)/timetable/page.tsx` and `PersonalTimetable.tsx` are missing. The data API passes (FR-38). |\n| FR-25 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The child selector UI is missing. The server-side rule is tested (integration \"FR-38/FR-25\"). |\n| FR-26 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The Week/Today toggle is missing. The `nowAndNext` helper exists and is unit-tested. |\n| FR-27 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | src/config/student-tabs.ts has no Timetable entry; `students/[id]/timetable/page.tsx` is missing |\n| FR-28 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | src/config/course-tabs.ts has no Schedule entry; `courses/[courseId]/schedule/page.tsx` is missing |\n| FR-29 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `PrintButton.tsx` and `TimetablePrintStyles.tsx` are missing |\n| FR-30 | PASS | `getScheduleForDate`; integration \"FR-30/FR-31/FR-45\" (ordered entries for teacher and student; Saturday returns []) |\n| FR-31 | PASS | `getCurrentSlot`; same test (inside the period → slot; at the exclusive end → null) |\n| FR-32 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | src/config/navigation.ts has no Timetable, Timetable editor or Bell schedule entries |\n| FR-33 | PASS | src/app/api/periods/{route,[id]/route,reorder/route}.ts: GET uses `requireUser`, writes use `requireRole('ADMIN')`. Handler wiring was checked by reading the code; the service is tested in integration. |\n| FR-34 | PASS | src/app/api/school-days/route.ts (GET `requireUser`, PUT `requireRole('ADMIN')`); service tested in integration \"FR-7/FR-40\" |\n| FR-35 | PASS | `assertCanViewTimetable`; integration \"FR-35\" covers ADMIN any view, TEACHER own view and homeroom section, and 403 for another teacher, another section and a STUDENT. Note: TEACHER can also view sections they teach a course in (design decision D8), which is broader than \"homeroom only\". |\n| FR-36 | PASS | `getAvailability`; integration \"FR-36\" (key `4-<periodId>` holds the exact clash message; free cells are absent) |\n| FR-37 | PASS | slots routes are ADMIN-only; integration \"FR-37/FR-40\" (academicYearId comes from the course) and \"FR-9/FR-10\" (CONFLICT with `details.clashes[]` and 0 rows saved) |\n| FR-38 | PASS | `resolvePersonalTarget`; integration \"FR-38/FR-25\". Minor: a multi-child parent with no `studentId` gets 400 VALIDATION_ERROR rather than 403. That is reasonable, but it differs from the spec wording. |\n| FR-39 | PASS | src/lib/validators/timetable.ts holds every schema and is imported by all 10 handlers; unit \"periodSchema\" tests |\n| FR-40 | PASS | `audit()` calls in every write; integration checks the slot create, update and delete rows and `schoolDay.update` with `deletedSlotCount`. Period create, update, delete and reorder audits were checked by reading the code only. |\n| FR-41 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | prisma/seed.ts seeds no periods; `prisma/seed-timetable-week.ts` is missing |\n| FR-42 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No SchoolDay seed (the dev DB has 0 SchoolDay rows; the service defaults to Mon–Fri) |\n| FR-43 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No 7A/7B week seed |\n| FR-44 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No Tom, Sam or Pat fixtures, sections or courses; the dev DB has 0 users |\n| FR-45 | PASS (server) | `schoolNow` + `schoolTimezone()`; unit tests across UTC, Los Angeles and Kolkata, including the date line; integration runs with SchoolSettings.timezone = Asia/Kolkata. The UI consumers do not exist yet (see FR-24 and FR-26). |\n| NFR-1 | PASS | `createSlot`/`moveSlot` use a SERIALIZABLE transaction and retry on P2034; integration \"NFR-1/NFR-12\" (exactly 1 of 2 concurrent inserts succeeds; the retry path ran) |\n| NFR-2 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The editor does not exist, so the section-week load cannot be measured |\n| NFR-3 | PASS (indicative) | `getAvailability` runs a fixed number of queries. The whole 16-test integration suite, availability included, ran in about 400 ms on a small dataset. It was not measured at seed scale. |\n| NFR-4 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | There is no UI to check |\n| NFR-5 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No UI was written, so there is no mui-mcp lookup trail |\n| NFR-6 | PASS | The only new dependency is `@dnd-kit/core` pinned at 6.3.1; `next lint` (no-restricted-imports) is clean |\n| NFR-7 | PASS (API) | All 10 handlers call `requireUser` or `requireRole` before the service runs, and per-entity checks run on the server (`assertCanViewTimetable`, `resolvePersonalTarget`). There are no server pages yet. |\n| NFR-8 | PASS | Handlers follow `withHandler` → `parseBody`/`parseQuery` (Zod) → service → `ok()`; CONFLICT is used for clashes and for period delete-with-slots |\n| NFR-9 | PASS | Reuses `http.ts`, `audit()` and `logger`; service at src/server/timetable/timetable-service.ts; no renames |\n| NFR-10 | PASS | `tsc --noEmit` and `next lint` are clean. `vitest run`: 133 pass, 1 fail, in the same 3 files tha