NFR-12 | PASS | tests/integration/timetable-concurrency.test.ts (written by QA) |\n| NFR-13 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `tests/e2e/timetable.spec.ts` is missing, and there is no UI to drive |\n| NFR-14 | PASS | grep finds no `console.log` in any SH-6 file; the service uses `logger.warn` |\n| NFR-15 | PASS | No solver, multi-week cycle, substitute or holiday code; there is only a holiday hook comment in `getScheduleForDate` |\n| NFR-16 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | There is no UI or print output to check |\n\n## Tests written by QA\n\n- `tests/integration/timetable-concurrency.test.ts` has 16 tests running against real Postgres.\n- It skips without `TEST_DATABASE_URL`.\n- Its fixtures are tagged `QA6-` / `@qa-sh6.test` and removed afterwards. The SchoolDay table and the school timezone are snapshotted and restored.\n- It passed 4 runs in a row, and the dev DB was left unchanged.\n\n## Recommendation\n\nSend SH-6 back to Dev to finish TASK-9 to TASK-16, starting with the TimetableGrid, then the editor, then the seed (FR-41 to FR-44), because the e2e test needs the seed. Dev also needs to write a real SH-6 `dev-log.md` and `task-completion-markers.json`. The backend is ready for the UI and does not need rework.\n"}}}
