getByRole('alert')` locators were scoped with `.filter({ hasText: /\\S/ })`. Without that, once the page hydrates, they also match Next's empty `#__next-route-announcer__` (role=alert) and fail strict mode.\n\n## Not covered\n\n- **Code paths with no test:**\n  - The signIn-failure fallback in `TokenPasswordForm`, after an invite is accepted.\n  - The network-error branch of `postJson`.\n  - The `limit 3/email/hour` branch of forgot-password (`services/auth.ts:46`). It is code-reviewed only.\n- **Behaviour with no test:**\n  - Sign-out of other devices within 5 minutes (FR-10). Only the same-session re-issue is verified, by reloading after a password change.\n  - `auth.login.failure` audit rows (FR-8). The code is reviewed at `credentials.ts:43`, but no test asserts the row.\n- **Browsers:** Firefox, WebKit and Edge (NFR-15). Only Chromium was executed.\n- **Production:** behaviour under `next build`/`next start`. The build fails for a pre-existing reason (see qa-report.md).\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":60,"newStart":1,"newLines":48,"lines":["-# Coverage Report — SH-6 (PRD-06 Bell Schedule & Timetable)","+# Coverage Report — SH-1 (PRD-01 Authentication, Sessions & RBAC)"," ","-- ticketId: SH-6","-- timestamp: 2026-11-05T10:35:00Z","-- Tool: none. `@vitest/coverage-v8` is not installed, and QA did not add a dependency (NFR-6). The coverage below is mapped by hand, function by function, from the tests that ran.","+- ticketId: SH-1","+- timestamp: 2026-11-05T17:15:00Z","+- Method: behaviour-to-test mapping. No coverage provider is installed (`@vitest/coverage-v8` is absent), and QA did not add a dependency to get line percentages."," ","-## Test files covering SH-6 code","+## Scope: code changed by Dev for SH-1"," ","-| File | Author | Tests | Result |","-|---|---|---|---|","-| tests/unit/timetable-clash.test.ts | Dev | 11 | 11 pass |","-| tests/unit/timetable-time.test.ts | Dev | 10 | 10 pass |","-| tests/integration/timetable-concurrency.test.ts | *