 and reads FileObject; `prisma migrate status` reports the DB up to date | FileObject only; Module/Lesson/etc. untested |\n\n**Rough overall:** about 75% of the SH-8 server code that exists is exercised by tests. The route handlers have no tests.\n\n## Not covered because the code does not exist\n\nThese files are in `file-ownership-matrix.json` but missing on disk, so they have 0% coverage:\n\n- **Content service:** src/server/content/content-service.ts\n- **Content API routes:**\n  - /api/courses/[id]/modules\n  - /api/courses/[id]/content/reorder\n  - /api/modules/[id]\n  - /api/modules/[id]/lessons\n  - /api/lessons/[id]\n  - /api/lessons/[id]/progress\n  - /api/students/[id]/learning\n- **Shared components:** FileUpload, FileList, MarkdownView, content/StatusChip, content/VideoEmbed\n- **Pages:**\n  - Content tab\n  - lesson viewer and editor\n  - Learning tab\n  - /admin/settings/school\n- **Validators:** src/lib/validators/settings.ts\n- **Seed asset:** prisma/seed-assets/fractions-worksheet.pdf; the seed content in prisma/seed.ts is also absent\n- **Dev-owned tests:**\n  - tests/integration/files-content.test.ts\n  - tests/integration/file-purge.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/markdown-view.test.tsx\n  - tests/e2e/content.spec.ts\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":48,"newStart":1,"newLines":70,"lines":["-# Coverage Report — SH-7 (PRD-07 Attendance Tracking)","+# Coverage Report — SH-8 (PRD-08 File Storage & Course Content)"," ","-- ticketId: SH-7","-- timestamp: 2026-11-06T12:30:00Z","-- Tooling: **no line-coverage tool is installed** (`@vitest/coverage-v8` is missing, and adding a dependency is out of scope). The figures below come from mapping each test to the functions it exercises, not from instrumented line counts.","+Generated 2026-11-07 by the QA phase. This file replaces the stale SH-7 coverage report."," ","-## Test inventory (SH-7)","+## Method"," ","+- No coverage provider is installed (`@vitest/coverage-v8` is not in `node_modules`), so line 