eads FileObject; `prisma migrate status` reports the DB up to date | FileObject only; Module/Lesson/etc. untested |"," ","-## Rough totals","+**Rough overall:** about 75% of the SH-8 server code that exists is exercised by tests. The route handlers have no tests."," ","-- Server logic (rules, service, validators): about **85%** of functions, with every requirement-bearing path covered.","-- Client components: **1 of 8** covered (RegisterForm). Three of the other seven cannot render at all right now.","-- Route handlers: about **10%** directly. They are thin wrappers over the tested service, but the role gates in the handlers (`requireRole`) are not tested.","+## Not covered because the code does not exist"," ","-## Gaps worth closing","+These files are in `file-ownership-matrix.json` but missing on disk, so they have 0% coverage:"," ","-1. Route-level tests for `requireRole` gates, especially `PATCH /api/settings/school` (admin-only) and CSV `Content-Disposition`.","-2. `getToday` / `getOverview` / `getStudentAttendance` with `attendanceMode = DAILY_HOMEROOM | BOTH`.","-3. Component tests for StudentAttendanceClient, CourseAttendanceMatrix and AdminAttendanceClient once MUI X is realigned.","+- **Content service:** src/server/content/content-service.ts","+- **Content API routes:**","+  - /api/courses/[id]/modules","+  - /api/courses/[id]/content/reorder","+  - /api/modules/[id]","+  - /api/modules/[id]/lessons","+  - /api/lessons/[id]","+  - /api/lessons/[id]/progress","+  - /api/students/[id]/learning","+- **Shared components:** FileUpload, FileList, MarkdownView, content/StatusChip, content/VideoEmbed","+- **Pages:**","+  - Content tab","+  - lesson viewer and editor","+  - Learning tab","+  - /admin/settings/school","+- **Validators:** src/lib/validators/settings.ts","+- **Seed asset:** prisma/seed-assets/fractions-worksheet.pdf; the seed content in prisma/seed.ts is also absent","+- **Dev-owned tests:**","+  - tests/integration/files-content.test.ts","+  - tests/integration/file-purge.test.ts","+  - tests/unit/markdown-view.test.tsx","+  - tests/e2e/content.spec.ts"]}],"originalFile":"# Coverage Report — SH-7 (PRD-07 Attendance Tracking)\n\n- ticketId: SH-7\n- timestamp: 2026-11-06T12:30:00Z\n- Tooling: **no line-coverage tool is installed** (`@vitest/coverage-v8` is missing, and adding a dependency is out of scope). The figures below come from mapping each test to the functions it exercises, not from instrumented line counts.\n\n## Test inventory (SH-7)\n\n| File | Author | Tests | Result |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| tests/unit/attendance-rules.test.ts | Dev | 13 | 13 pass |\n| tests/integration/attendance-service.test.ts | Dev | 7 | 7 pass |\n| tests/unit/attendance-register-form.test.tsx | **QA (new)** | 8 | 8 pass |\n| tests/integration/attendance-qa.test.ts | **QA (new)** | 10 | 8 pass, **2 fail (real defects)** |\n| tests/e2e/attendance.spec.ts | Dev (re-run by QA, :3100, `bypassCSP`) | 2 | teacher test passes; parent test fails at the calendar step |\n\nIntegration tests run against the local migrated Postgres (`TEST_DATABASE_URL` = `.env` `DATABASE_URL`, :5433). Fixtures are tagged and cleaned up; 0 rows were left behind (checked with psql).\n\n## Per-module coverage\n\n| Module | Functions | Covered | Not covered |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| src/server/attendance/attendance-rules.ts | 10 | 10 (100%) | — |\n| src/server/attendance/attendance-service.ts (exports) | 10 | 9 (90%) | `getAttendanceSettings` (trivial read) |\n| attendance-service.ts (private branches) | — | most | `kindWhere` DAILY_HOMEROOM branch; the P2002 retry in `saveRegister` (ADR-3 race); the `getToday` daily-register branch (mode ≠ PER_PERIOD) |\n| src/lib/validators/attendance.ts | 9 schemas | registerPutBody, registerRecord, registerQuery, reportFilters, dateOnly (via unit + form tests) | `attendanceSettingsPatch`, `remindBody`, `overviewQuery` (only exercised by route handlers, which are untested) |\n| src/app/(app)/attendance/take/RegisterForm.tsx | 1 component | covered in jsdom: defaults, counters, mark-all, late/notes, EXCUSED gate, offline draft + restore, read-only, 44 px / sticky; also in the e2e | the server-error toast path |\n| src/app/(app)/attendance/take/page.tsx, DateNav.tsx, [courseId]/page.tsx | 3 | [courseId] page via the e2e | landing page UI and DateNav (no UI test; the rules behind them are unit-tested via `canOpen`) |\n| take/section/[sectionId]/page.tsx | 1 | 0 | no UI test (the service is covered) |\n| students/[id]/attendance/* | 2 | 0 working | e2e reaches it, but the page **does not compile** (DataGrid, see qa-report) |\n| courses/[courseId]/attendance/* | 2 | 0 | does not compile (DataGrid) |\n| admin/attendance/* | 3 | 0 | does not compile (ReportTab → DataGrid) |\n| src/app/api/** (9 SH-7 handlers + PATCH /api/settings/school) | 10 | indirect only: the e2e covers GET page + PUT /api/attendance/register | no handler-level tests; `PATCH /api/settings/school` is untested |\n| src/server/notifications/types.ts (4 new types) | data | used by the integration tests (absent, corrected, register_missing) | `attendance.late` email default is not asserted |\n| prisma/migrations/…_attendance (CHECK + 2 partial unique indexes) | — | covered (Dev integration test) | — |\n| prisma/seed.ts `seedAttendance` | 1 | 0 | code review only; this DB has no 7A/7B data |\n\n## Rough totals\n\n- Server logic (rules, service, validators): about **85%** of functions, with every requirement-bearing path covered.\n- Client components: **1 of 8** covered (RegisterForm). Three of the other seven cannot render at all right now.\n- Route handlers: about **10%** directly. They are thin wrappers over the tested service, but the role gates in the handlers (`requireRole`) are not tested.\n\n## Gaps worth closing\n\n1. Route-level tests for `requireRole` gates, especially `PATCH /api/settings/school` (admin-only) and CSV `Content-Disposition`.\n2. `getToday` / `getOverview` / `getStudentAttendance` with `attendanceMode = DAILY_HOMEROOM | BOTH`.\n3. Component tests for StudentAttendanceClient, CourseAttendanceMatrix and AdminAttendanceClient once MUI X is realigned.\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01DdLMr9diysaA7arVrLZXpd","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
