ntegration/files-qa.test.ts` | 10/10 pass |\n| `npx vitest run` (`npm test`) | fails to start (pre-existing config break) |\n\n## Tests added by QA\n\n- **tests/integration/files-qa.test.ts** (10 tests, real Postgres plus a temp UPLOAD_DIR). It covers:\n  - PNG upload with sha256, key format, server-side MIME and path under UPLOAD_DIR\n  - rejection of .exe, an ELF disguised as .txt, SVG outside logo, and oversize files\n  - txt and logo-SVG accepted\n  - owner/admin can download an unattached file; others and anonymous get NOT_FOUND\n  - an attached logo is public; a lesson file pointing at a missing lesson is denied\n  - attaching someone else's file is refused\n  - delete: owner OK (row and bytes), attached → CONFLICT, stranger → NOT_FOUND\n  - an admin delete writes an audit row\n  - 61st upload → RATE_LIMITED\n  - orphan purge: only unattached files older than 24 h, with their bytes\n- **tests/unit/content-validators.test.ts** (4 tests). It covers:\n  - FR-16 field limits\n  - link and video URL rules\n  - SCHEDULED must be in the future\n  - the reorder schema shape\n\n## Requirement Results\n\n| Requirement | Status | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| FR-1 | PASS | prisma/schema.prisma:564 FileObject (unique storageKey, @@index [context, contextId]); migration 20261108000000 applied; files-qa writes and reads rows |\n| FR-2 | PASS | src/server/storage.ts (saveFile/readFile/deleteFile, traversal guard); UPLOAD_DIR in env.ts and .env.example; `uploads/` in .gitignore; files-qa asserts the path is under UPLOAD_DIR |\n| FR-3 | PASS | src/app/api/files/route.ts → uploadFile; files-qa \"stores a valid PNG unattached\" (contextId null) |\n| FR-4 | PASS | files-service.ts mid-stream cap; files-qa asserts \"File exceeds 1 MB.\" (MAX_UPLOAD_MB=1) |\n| FR-5 | PASS | validate.ts ALLOWED + file-type sniff; file-validate.test.ts; files-qa \".exe is not allowed\" |\n| FR-6 | PASS | validate.ts sniff modes; file-validate.test.ts (OOXML-as-zip, txt with no signature); files-qa ELF