{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AeEMYph3pEY6qD7vLVdi8B","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/qa/qa-report.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e79742d4-00ef-4cc8-ab33-edc1cbedabaa","uuid":"c02addfe-5dd7-4da2-b5f2-ed353ff162ae","timestamp":"2026-11-07T03:49:15.433Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"update","filePath":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/qa/qa-report.md","content":"# QA Report — SH-8 (PRD-08 File Storage & Course Content)\n\n## QA Summary\n\n- ticketId: SH-8\n- timestamp: 2026-11-07T03:45:00Z\n- overallStatus: FAIL\n- requirementsChecked: 60\n- requirementsPassed: 21\n- requirementsFailed: 39\n\n> This file replaces the stale SH-7 QA report. Of the 39 failed requirements, 2 are FAIL and 37 are NOT-IMPLEMENTED.\n\n## Headline findings\n\n### 1. BLOCKER: the Dev phase for SH-8 is incomplete, and it left no report\n\n- `artifacts/dev/dev-log.md` and `artifacts/dev/task-completion-markers.json` are still the **SH-7** files. Dev never wrote SH-8 versions.\n- `dev-rerun-count.json` shows `count: 3, firstPassAccepted: false`.\n- `security-scan-report.json` (SH-8) scanned **0 files**.\n- QA therefore checked reality against `file-ownership-matrix.json` (SH-8) directly. **33 of the 66 owned paths are missing on disk.**\n\n### 2. What was built: the file storage backend (TASK-1 to TASK-8, roughly)\n\n- Built:\n  - dependencies, env vars and `.gitignore`\n  - the Prisma models and migration\n  - `storage.ts`\n  - upload validation\n  - the visibility rule and video parser\n  - the access registry and built-in contexts\n  - the files service\n  - the `/api/files` routes\n  - the orphan purge and its maintenance hook\n  - the content Zod validators\n- This code is real (no stubs or TODOs). It typechecks and lints clean, and it passes 40/40 tests, including the 14 QA added.\n\n### 3. What is missing: TASK-10 to TASK-21\n\n- **Server:** the content service, every content/lesson/module/progress/learning API route, and the settings validator.\n- **UI:** every UI component (FileUpload, FileList, MarkdownView, StatusChip, VideoEmbed) and every page (Content tab, lesson viewer and editor, Learning tab, `/admin/settings/school`).\n- **Seed:** the seed content and the seed PDF asset.\n- **Tests:** the Dev-owned integration, Markdown and e2e tests.\n- **Effect:** no course-content feature is usable by any role.\n\n### 4. Pre-existing: `npm test` does not start\n\n- `vitest.config.ts` imports `vitest/config.js` (MODULE_NOT_FOUND). This was carried over from SH-7 and is not caused by SH-8.\n- All runs used `vitest.tmp.config.ts`.\n\n### 5. Minor (not a defect)\n\n- If an uploaded filename contains a raw control character in the multipart header, busboy rejects it as \"Malformed multipart body\" before `sanitizeFilename` runs.\n- That is a safe failure. Browsers do not send raw control characters.\n- `sanitizeFilename` itself strips them (unit-tested).\n\n## Commands run\n\n| Command | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `npx tsc --noEmit` | exit 0 |\n| `npx eslint` on all SH-8 source and test files | exit 0 |\n| `npx prisma migrate status` | 9 migrations, DB up to date (the SH-8 migration is applied) |\n| `npx vitest run --config vitest.tmp.config.ts` on the 5 SH-8 unit tests | 30/30 pass |\n| `TEST_DATABASE_URL=… npx vitest run --config vitest.tmp.config.ts tests/integration/files-qa.test.ts` | 10/10 pass |\n| `npx vitest run` (`npm test`) | fails to start (pre-existing config break) |\n\n## Tests added by QA\n\n- **tests/integration/files-qa.test.ts** (10 tests, real Postgres plus a temp UPLOAD_DIR). It covers:\n  - PNG upload with sha256, key format, server-side MIME and path under UPLOAD_DIR\n  - rejection of .exe, an ELF disguised as .txt, SVG outside logo, and oversize files\n  - txt and logo-SVG accepted\n  - owner/admin can download an unattached file; others and anonymous get NOT_FOUND\n  - an attached logo is public; a lesson file pointing at a missing lesson is denied\n  - attaching someone else's file is refused\n  - delete: owner OK (row and bytes), attached → CONFLICT, stranger → NOT_FOUND\n  - an admin delete writes an audit row\n  - 61st upload → RATE_LIMITED\n  - orphan purge: only unattached files older than 24 h, with their bytes\n- **tests/unit/content-validators.test.ts** (4 tests). It covers:\n  - FR-16 field limits\n  - link and video URL rules\n  - SCHEDULED must be in the future\n  - the reorder schema shape\n\n## Requirement Results\n\n| Requirement | Status | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| FR-1 | PASS | prisma/schema.prisma:564 FileObject (unique storageKey, @@index [context, contextId]); migration 20261108000000 applied; files-qa writes and reads rows |\n| FR-2 | PASS | src/server/storage.ts (saveFile/readFile/deleteFile, traversal guard); UPLOAD_DIR in env.ts and .env.example; `uploads/` in .gitignore; files-qa asserts the path is under UPLOAD_DIR |\n| FR-3 | PASS | src/app/api/files/route.ts → uploadFile; files-qa \"stores a valid PNG unattached\" (contextId null) |\n| FR-4 | PASS | files-service.ts mid-stream cap; files-qa asserts \"File exceeds 1 MB.\" (MAX_UPLOAD_MB=1) |\n| FR-5 | PASS | validate.ts ALLOWED + file-type sniff; file-validate.test.ts; files-qa \".exe is not allowed\" |\n| FR-6 | PASS | validate.ts sniff modes; file-validate.test.ts (OOXML-as-zip, txt with no signature); files-qa ELF-as-.txt rejected |\n| FR-7 | PASS | validate.ts sanitizeFilename; file-validate.test.ts (separators, control chars, 150 cap); files-qa |\n| FR-8 | PASS | src/app/api/files/[id]/route.ts sets the stored MIME, nosniff, attachment, and inline only for image/pdf with ?inline=1 (code-reviewed; no route-level test, see coverage-report) |\n| FR-9 | PASS | src/server/files/access.ts; file-access.test.ts (dispatch, unknown context → owner/admin, resolver throw → deny); files-qa NOT_FOUND before streaming |\n| FR-10 | PASS | src/server/files/contexts.ts lesson + logo resolvers; files-qa: anonymous can fetch an attached logo, a lesson file for a missing lesson is denied |\n| FR-11 | PASS | files-service.ts deleteUnattachedFile; files-qa delete (row and bytes gone, attached → CONFLICT, stranger → NOT_FOUND) |\n| FR-12 | PASS | src/server/files/purge.ts; called in api/internal/email/dispatch/route.ts:38; files-qa purge test |\n| FR-13 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | src/components/FileUpload/FileUpload.tsx missing |\n| FR-14 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | src/components/FileList/FileList.tsx missing |\n| FR-15 | PASS | prisma/schema.prisma:581-650: ContentStatus, Module, Lesson, LessonAttachment, LessonLink, LessonProgress (cascades, @@id [lessonId, studentId]); `prisma migrate status` up to date |\n| FR-16 | PASS | src/lib/validators/content.ts; tests/unit/content-validators.test.ts |\n| FR-17 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The attachFiles helper works (files-qa), but no lesson flow calls it: the PATCH /api/lessons/:id route and content-service.ts are missing |\n| FR-18 | PASS | src/server/content/visibility.ts isLessonVisible (read-time, pure); visibility.test.ts. Also used by contexts.ts. The list/get consumers are missing (see FR-43/44) |\n| FR-19 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | canSeeDrafts exists, but the status badge (content/StatusChip.tsx) and the Content tab are missing |\n| FR-20 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | Content tab page/ContentOutline missing; no 'content' entry in src/config/course-tabs.ts |\n| FR-21 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No progress UI (ContentOutline missing) |\n| FR-22 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No teacher controls (ContentOutline missing) |\n| FR-23 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | reorderSchema exists, but api/courses/[id]/content/reorder/route.ts and the dnd UI are missing |\n| FR-24 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No module delete flow (UI and api/modules/[id] missing) |\n| FR-25 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | lessons/[lessonId]/edit/page.tsx and LessonEditor.tsx missing |\n| FR-26 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | LessonEditor.tsx missing |\n| FR-27 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | LessonEditor.tsx and api/lessons/[id] missing |\n| FR-28 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The schedule-in-future validator passes (content-validators.test.ts), but there are no status controls or picker (LessonEditor missing) |\n| FR-29 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No autosave (LessonEditor missing) |\n| FR-30 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The parser and embedUrl pass (video.test.ts), but the embed renderer content/VideoEmbed.tsx is missing |\n| FR-31 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | src/components/MarkdownView/MarkdownView.tsx missing |\n| FR-32 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | lessons/[lessonId]/page.tsx missing |\n| FR-33 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | api/lessons/[id]/progress/route.ts and LessonViewerActions.tsx missing |\n| FR-34 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | Progress route and Drawer missing |\n| FR-35 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | api/students/[id]/learning and students/[id]/learning/page.tsx missing; no tab in student-tabs.ts |\n| FR-36 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | Viewer missing |\n| FR-37 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | assertCanViewCourse is reused (contexts.ts), but there is no Content tab to gate |\n| FR-38 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The type is registered (notifications/types.ts:94), but there is no publish flow that calls notify() (content-service missing) |\n| FR-39 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No Schedule control or tooltip |\n| FR-40 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | SchoolSettingsForm.tsx and the logo FileUpload missing |\n| FR-41 | PASS | validate.ts allows SVG for logo only (file-validate.test.ts; files-qa rejects lesson SVG and accepts logo SVG); [id]/route.ts sets CSP `default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'` for image/svg+xml |\n| FR-42 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | src/app/(app)/admin/settings/school/page.tsx missing |\n| FR-43 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | api/courses/[id]/modules, api/modules/[id], api/modules/[id]/lessons and api/lessons/[id] all missing |\n| FR-44 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | api/lessons/[id]/route.ts missing |\n| FR-45 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The file logic is correctly in src/server/files/ with thin routes, but src/server/content/content-service.ts is missing |\n| FR-46 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | Audit for an admin deleting another user's file works (files-qa), but there are no content mutations to audit |\n| FR-47 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | prisma/seed.ts has no module/lesson seeding; prisma/seed-assets/fractions-worksheet.pdf missing |\n| FR-48 | FAIL | Unit tests for the sanitiser, video parser, visibility rule and registry exist and pass. The Dev-owned integration tests (files-content, file-purge) and tests/e2e/content.spec.ts are missing. QA's files-qa.test.ts covers upload/attach/download/purge, but no e2e exists |\n| NFR-1 | PASS | Bytes are stored under UPLOAD_DIR (not public/); the only read path is getFileForDownload → canAccessFile; files-qa access tests |\n| NFR-2 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | MarkdownView (rehype-sanitize) missing; nothing renders lesson Markdown yet |\n| NFR-3 | PASS | files-service.ts rateLimit(`upload:<id>`, 60, 1h); files-qa \"61st upload is RATE_LIMITED\"; route sets Retry-After |\n| NFR-4 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No Content tab or content queries to measure |\n| NFR-5 | PASS | storage.ts hashes and counts in a Transform during pipeline; files-service peeks only 4100 bytes and enforces the cap mid-stream; files-qa oversize rejection |\n| NFR-6 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No iframe, editor or reorder UI exists |\n| NFR-7 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No SH-8 UI was written, so there are no MUI imports or mui-mcp lookups to verify (no banned imports exist because there is no UI) |\n| NFR-8 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | File handlers enforce access server-side (files-qa), but the content handlers and pages do not exist |\n| NFR-9 | FAIL | New deps are limited to the allowed set (package.json); tsc and eslint pass; no re-scaffolding. But `npm run test` fails to start (pre-existing vitest.config.ts break, not caused by SH-8) |\n| NFR-10 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No date display or schedule picker exists |\n| NFR-11 | PASS | src/server/storage.ts is a single local-disk implementation with no S3 abstraction |\n| NFR-12 | PASS | grep finds no console.log in SH-8 files; purge.ts uses logger; .env.example:31-35 documents UPLOAD_DIR and MAX_UPLOAD_MB |\n\n## Recommendation\n\n1. Re-run the Dev phase for **TASK-9 onward**:\n   - the content service\n   - the content routes\n   - the components and pages\n   - the settings page\n   - seed and e2e\n2. Have Dev write SH-8 `dev-log.md` and `task-completion-markers.json`.\n3. Fix `vitest.config.ts` (`vitest/config.js` → `vitest/config`) so `npm test` runs.\n4. Re-run QA after that. The file storage layer is solid and can be built on as it stands.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":121,"newStart":1,"newLines":162,"lines":["-# QA Report — SH-7 (PRD-07 Attendance Tracking)","+# QA Report — SH-8 (PRD-08 File Storage & Course Content)"," "," ## QA Summary"," ","-- ticketId: SH-7","-- timestamp: 2026-11-06T12:35:00Z","+- ticketId: SH-8","+- timestamp: 2026-11-07T03:45:00Z"," - overallStatus: FAIL","-- requirementsChecked: 51","-- requirementsPassed: 38","-- requirementsFailed: 13","+- requirementsChecked: 60","+- requirementsPassed: 21","+- requirementsFailed: 39"," ","-> This file replaces the stale SH-1 QA report.","+> This file replaces the stale SH-7 QA report. Of the 39 failed requirements, 2 are FAIL and 37 are NOT-IMPLEMENTED."," "," ## Headline findings"," ","-1. **BLOCKER (dependency issue from before SH-7): every attendance page that uses DataGrid fails to compile, so 9 FRs don't work in the running app.**","-   - Root cause: `@mui/x-data-grid@9.5.0` imports `@mui/x-internals/useFirstRender`. The lockfile resolves `@mui/x-internals` to `9.15.0` (because x-data-grid allows `^9.1.0`), and 9.15.0 no longer exports that path.","-   - QA reproduced it two ways:","-     - `node -e \"import('@mui/x-data-grid')\"` fails with *\"Package subpath './useFirstRender' is not defined by exports\"*.","-     - `next dev` logs `⨯ ./node_modules/@mui/x-data-grid/DataGrid/useDataGridComponent.mjs`.","-   - Pages that fail:","-     - `/students/[id]/attendance` (StudentAttendanceClient → DataTable).","-     - `/courses/[id]/attendance` (CourseAttendanceMatrix).","-     - **all of** `/admin/attendance`, because AdminAttendanceClient imports ReportTab statically, and ReportTab imports DataGrid. That takes down the Settings, Today and Below-threshold tabs as well.","-   - The **service and API layer behind these pages is proven correct** by the integration tests below. Each FAIL verdict blocked by this issue says so.","-   - Fix (a dependency change, outside SH-7's file ownership): pin `@mui/x-internals` to a version that matches 9.5, or upgrade all `@mui/x-*` packages together.","-2. **FAIL FR-22: an absent → present → absent sequence sends a second absence notification for the same session.**","-   - `notificationsFor` only compares against the previous save. Re-saving with no change is handled correctly, but the PRD says *\"Do not send more than one absence notification per student per session.\"*","-   - Evidence: `tests/integration/attendance-qa.test.ts` › FR-22 (expected 1, got 2).","-   - Fix: inside the transaction, check for an existing `attendance.absent` notification for this student and session (or keep a per-record `absenceNotifiedAt`) before sending.","-3. **FAIL FR-19 (from the FR-10 check): once an admin marks any student EXCUSED, the teacher can no longer save that register.**","-   - `saveRegister` rejects any EXCUSED value in the body for non-admins (`attendance-service.ts:219`), even when the row is unchanged.","-   - The UI always sends the full roster, so a teacher's later correction to *another* student fails with 403. That breaks the teacher's 14-day edit right.","-   - Evidence: `tests/integration/attendance-qa.test.ts` › FR-10/FR-19 (got FORBIDDEN).","-   - Fix: reject only rows whose status is EXCUSED **and** differs from the saved value. Do the check on `diff` inside the transaction.","-4. **FAIL NFR-10: `npm run test` cannot start** (issue from before SH-7). `vitest.config.ts` imports `vitest/config.js`, which doesn't resolve. Every test in this report was run with `vitest.tmp.config.ts`, the same config with the `vitest/config` import.","-5. **Carried over: the CSP still blocks hydration** (`next.config.js` `script-src 'self'`). The e2e only works with `bypassCSP: true`. See SH-1 QA blocker 1.","+### 1. BLOCKER: the Dev phase for SH-8 is incomplete, and it left no report"," ","-## Test execution","+- `artifacts/dev/dev-log.md` and `artifacts/dev/task-completion-markers.json` are still the **SH-7** files. Dev never wrote SH-8 versions.","+- `dev-rerun-count.json` shows `count: 3, firstPassAccepted: false`.","+- `security-scan-report.json` (SH-8) scanned **0 files**.","+- QA therefore checked reality against `file-ownership-matrix.json` (SH-8) directly. **33 of the 66 owned paths are missing on disk.**"," ","-| Suite | Command | Result |","-|---|---|---|","-| Typecheck | `npx tsc --noEmit` | clean |","-| Lint | `npm run lint` | ✔ no warnings/errors |","-| `npm run test` | — | **does not start** (finding 4) |","-| Full vitest | `TEST_DATABASE_URL=… npx vitest run -c vitest.tmp.config.ts` | 225/229 pass. Failures: 2 QA SH-7 defect tests, plus 2 older failures (`auth-forms`, `useToast`). 2 older files fail to load (`DataTable`, `lockout`). |","-| SH-7 unit | attendance-rules (13) + attendance-register-form (8, new) | 21/21 pass |","-| SH-7 integration | attendance-service (7) + attendance-qa (10, new) | 15/17 pass (FR-22 and FR-19 fail) |","-| E2E | `APP_URL=http://localhost:3100 npx playwright test tests/e2e/attendance.spec.ts` (next dev :3100) | teacher test ✓. Parent test: notification ✓ (2nd, warm run); calendar ✘ (page fails to compile) |","-| NFR-1 timing (local) | attendance-qa › NFR-1 | 35-student save **39–101 ms** (<500). 1,200-record tab **45–50 ms** (<400). |","+### 2. What was built: the file storage backend (TASK-1 to TASK-8, roughly)"," ","-Static checks:","-- No banned or non-MUI UI libraries are imported in any SH-7 file. The only third-party imports are `@prisma/client`, `date-fns(-tz)`, `next/*`, `react` and `zod`, plus `@mui/*`.","-- No `console.*` calls in SH-7 `src/` files.","+- Built:","+  - dependencies, env vars and `.gitignore`","+  - the Prisma models and migration","+  - `storage.ts`","+  - upload validation","+  - the visibility rule and video parser","+  - the access registry and built-in contexts","+  - the files service","+  - the `/api/files` routes","+  - the orphan purge and its maintenance hook","+  - the content Zod validators","+- This code is real (no stubs or TODOs). It typechecks and lints clean, and it passes 40/40 tests, including the 14 QA added."," ","+### 3. What is missing: TASK-10 to TASK-21","+","+- **Server:** the content service, every content/lesson/module/progress/learning API route, and the settings validator.","+- **UI:** every UI component (FileUpload, FileList, MarkdownView, StatusChip, VideoEmbed) and every page (Content tab, lesson viewer and editor, Learning tab, `/admin/settings/school`).","+- **Seed:** the seed content and the seed PDF asset.","+- **Tests:** the Dev-owned integration, Markdown and e2e tests.","+- **Effect:** no course-content feature is usable by any role.","+","+### 4. Pre-existing: `npm test` does not start","+","+- `vitest.config.ts` imports `vitest/config.js` (MODULE_NOT_FOUND). This was carried over from SH-7 and is not caused by SH-8.","+- All runs used `vitest.tmp.config.ts`.","+","+### 5. Minor (not a defect)","+","+- If an uploaded filename contains a raw control character in the multipart header, busboy rejects it as \"Malformed multipart body\" before `sanitizeFilename` runs.","+- That is a safe failure. Browsers do not send raw control characters.","+- `sanitizeFilename` itself strips them (unit-tested).","+","+## Commands run","+","+| Command | Result |","+|---|---|","+| `npx tsc --noEmit` | exit 0 |","+| `npx eslint` on all SH-8 source and test files | exit 0 |","+| `npx prisma migrate status` | 9 migrations, DB up to date (the SH-8 migration is applied) |","+| `npx vitest run --config vitest.tmp.config.ts` on the 5 SH-8 unit tests | 30/30 pass |","+| `TEST_DATABASE_URL=… npx vitest run --config vitest.tmp.config.ts tests/integration/files-qa.test.ts` | 10/10 pass |","+| `npx vitest run` (`npm test`) | fails to start (pre-existing config break) |","+","+## Tests added by QA","+","+- **tests/integration/files-qa.test.ts** (10 tests, real Postgres plus a temp UPLOAD_DIR). It covers:","+  - PNG upload with sha256, key format, server-side MIME and path under UPLOAD_DIR","+  - rejection of .exe, an ELF disguised as .txt, SVG outside logo, and oversize files","+  - txt and logo-SVG accepted","+  - owner/admin can download an unattached file; others and anonymous get NOT_FOUND","+  - an attached logo is public; a lesson file pointing at a missing lesson is denied","+  - attaching someone else's file is refused","+  - delete: owner OK (row and bytes), attached → CONFLICT, stranger → NOT_FOUND","+  - an admin delete writes an audit row","+  - 61st upload → RATE_LIMITED","+  - orphan purge: only unattached files older than 24 h, with their bytes","+- **tests/unit/content-validators.test.ts** (4 tests). It covers:","+  - FR-16 field limits","+  - link and video URL rules","+  - SCHEDULED must be in the future","+  - the reorder schema shape","+"," ## Requirement Results"," "," | Requirement | Status | Evidence |"," |---|---|---|","-| FR-1 | PASS | prisma/schema.prisma; migrations/20261107000000_attendance/migration.sql:2,12-47 (enum, models, `sessionId_studentId` unique, `studentId_createdAt` index) |","-| FR-2 | PASS | migration.sql:73 CHECK; service builds course-xor-section keys (attendance-service.ts:247); attendance-service.test.ts › DB CHECK (both and neither rejected) |","-| FR-3 | PASS | migration.sql:77-78; attendance-service.test.ts › P2002 on both partial indexes |","-| FR-4 | PASS | migration.sql:8-9 (defaults PER_PERIOD / 90); attendance-qa.test.ts › FR-33 reads threshold 90 |","-| FR-5 | FAIL | `PATCH /api/settings/school` (src/app/api/settings/school/route.ts) and the Settings tab exist, but `/admin/attendance` doesn't compile (finding 1). The PATCH route also has no test. |","-| FR-6 | PASS | attendance-qa.test.ts › FR-6 (meeting listed, `taken:null`, `isCurrent`); take/page.tsx 'Taken HH:mm by' label + contained button for the current meeting |","-| FR-7 | PASS | attendance-service.ts:155-162 + take/page.tsx 'Daily register – <section>'. Code review only: no test, because the global mode is PER_PERIOD. |","-| FR-8 | PASS | attendance-rules.test.ts (14/15-day edges, future dates); attendance-service.test.ts › future → VALIDATION_ERROR, 15 days → FORBIDDEN, admin OK; DateNav.tsx disableFuture plus the same `canOpen` |","-| FR-9 | PASS | attendance-register-form.test.tsx › nothing selected by default, SR labels; attendance-service.test.ts › roster sorted by last name; e2e teacher test |","-| FR-10 | PASS | attendance-register-form.test.tsx › E disabled for a teacher, enabled for an admin; attendance-service.test.ts › teacher EXCUSED → FORBIDDEN. (The overly broad server check is reported under FR-19.) |","-| FR-11 | PASS | attendance-register-form.test.tsx › Mark all present keeps existing A |","-| FR-12 | PASS | attendance-register-form.test.tsx › L reveals minutes (default 5), 241 blocked, note behind icon, maxlength 500; validators.ts:40-48 |","-| FR-13 | PASS | attendance-register-form.test.tsx › live counters, Save disabled while unmarked; e2e |","-| FR-14 | PASS | attendance-service.test.ts › atomic save (no session row on failure), single session; register-form test + e2e › 'Last changed by' |","-| FR-15 | PASS | attendance-service.test.ts › homeroom teacher OK, other teacher FORBIDDEN; roster = sectionMember (service:97-99) |","-| FR-16 | PASS | src/app/(app)/attendance/take/section/[sectionId]/page.tsx reuses RegisterForm |","-| FR-17 | PASS | attendance-register-form.test.tsx › 44 px toggles and note button, sticky Paper; RegisterForm.tsx: