tion |","-| NFR-5 | PASS | attendance-qa.test.ts › in-app notification created synchronously after commit; EmailOutbox row queued for the parent |","-| NFR-6 | PASS | No banned imports (static scan above); tsc clean against @mui 9.5 types; dev-log lists the mui-mcp lookups (useMuiDocs 9.5.0, fetchDocs for ToggleButtonGroup/ToggleButton/Tabs/DateCalendar). Caveat: lookups aren't logged for every component used (Chip, Tooltip, DatePicker, DataGrid…). |","-| NFR-7 | PASS | attendance-qa.test.ts › unlinked parent and other student → NOT_FOUND (platform convention), linked parent OK; attendance-service.test.ts › non-owner/non-homeroom teacher FORBIDDEN |","-| NFR-8 | PASS | `@db.Date` DATE columns, cuid ids, `ok`/`paginated` envelopes, `parsePagination` (max 100), `audit()` on edits and reminders. Minor: prisma/seed.ts:205 uses `console.log` (seed script). |","-| NFR-9 | PASS | attendance-register-form.test.tsx › every toggle has an accessible name and is ≥44×44 px |","-| NFR-10 | FAIL | lint and typecheck are green; `npm run test` does not start (vitest.config.ts, from before SH-7). No PRD-14/15 scope was implemented. |","+| FR-1 | PASS | prisma/schema.prisma:564 FileObject (unique storageKey, @@index [context, contextId]); migration 20261108000000 applied; files-qa writes and reads rows |","+| FR-2 | PASS | src/server/storage.ts (saveFile/readFile/deleteFile, traversal guard); UPLOAD_DIR in env.ts and .env.example; `uploads/` in .gitignore; files-qa asserts the path is under UPLOAD_DIR |","+| FR-3 | PASS | src/app/api/files/route.ts → uploadFile; files-qa \"stores a valid PNG unattached\" (contextId null) |","+| FR-4 | PASS | files-service.ts mid-stream cap; files-qa asserts \"File exceeds 1 MB.\" (MAX_UPLOAD_MB=1) |","+| FR-5 | PASS | validate.ts ALLOWED + file-type sniff; file-validate.test.ts; files-qa \".exe is not allowed\" |","+| FR-6 | PASS | validate.ts sniff modes; file-validate.test.ts (OOXML-as-zip, txt with no signature); files-qa ELF-as-.txt rejected |","+| FR-7 | PASS | validate.ts sanitizeFilename; file-validate.test.ts (separators, control chars, 150 cap); files-qa |","+| FR-8 | PASS | src/app/api/files/[id]/route.ts sets the stored MIME, nosniff, attachment, and inline only for image/pdf with ?inline=1 (code-reviewed; no route-level test, see coverage-report) |","+| FR-9 | PASS | src/server/files/access.ts; file-access.test.ts (dispatch, unknown context → owner/admin, resolver throw → deny); files-qa NOT_FOUND before streaming |","+| FR-10 | PASS | src/server/files/contexts.ts lesson + logo resolvers; files-qa: anonymous can fetch an attached logo, a lesson file for a missing lesson is denied |","+| FR-11 | PASS | files-service.ts deleteUnattachedFile; files-qa delete (row and bytes gone, attached → CONFLICT, stranger → NOT_FOUND) |","+| FR-12 | PASS | src/server/files/purge.ts; called in api/internal/email/dispatch/route.ts:38; files-qa purge test |","+| FR-13 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | src/components/FileUpload/FileUpload.tsx missing |","+| FR-14 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | src/components/FileList/FileList.tsx missing |","+| FR-15 | PASS | prisma/schema.prisma:581-650: ContentStatus, Module, Lesson, LessonAttachment, LessonLink, LessonProgress (cascades, @@id [lessonId, studentId]); `prisma migrate status` up to date |","+| FR-16 | PASS | src/lib/validators/content.ts; tests/unit/content-validators.test.ts |","+| FR-17 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The attachFiles helper works (files-qa), but no lesson flow calls it: the PATCH /api/lessons/:id route and content-service.ts are missing |","+| FR-18 | PASS | src/server/content/visibility.ts isLessonVisible (read-time, pure); visibility.test.ts. Also used by contexts.ts. The list/get consumers are missing (see FR-43/44) |","+| FR-19 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | canSeeDrafts exists, but the status badge (content/StatusChip.tsx) and the Content tab are missing |","+| FR-20 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | Content tab page/ContentOutline missing; no 'content' entry in src/config/course-tabs.ts |","+| FR-21 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No progress UI (ContentOutline missing) |","+| FR-22 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No teacher controls (ContentOutline missing) |","+| FR-23 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | reorderSchema exists, but api/courses/[id]/content/reorder/route.ts and the dnd UI are missing |","+| FR-24 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No module delete flow (UI and api/modules/[id] missing) |","+| FR-25 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | lessons/[lessonId]/edit/page.tsx and LessonEditor.tsx missing |","+| FR-26 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | LessonEditor.tsx missing |","+| FR-27 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | LessonEditor.tsx and api/lessons/[id] missing |","+| FR-28 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The schedule-in-future validator passes (content-validators.test.ts), but there are no status controls or picker (LessonEditor missing) |","+| FR-29 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No autosave (LessonEditor missing) |","+| FR-30 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The parser and embedUrl pass (video.test.ts), but the embed renderer content/VideoEmbed.tsx is missing |","+| FR-31 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | src/components/MarkdownView/MarkdownView.tsx missing |","+| FR-32 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | lessons/[lessonId]/page.tsx missing |","+| FR-33 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | api/lessons/[id]/progress/route.ts and LessonViewerActions.tsx missing |","+| FR-34 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | Progress route and Drawer missing |","+| FR-35 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | api/students/[id]/learning and students/[id]/learning/page.tsx missing; no tab in student-tabs.ts |","+| FR-36 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | Viewer missing |","+| FR-37 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | assertCanViewCourse is reused (contexts.ts), but there is no Content tab to gate |","+| FR-38 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The type is registered (notifications/types.ts:94), but there is no publish flow that calls notify() (content-service missing) |","+| FR-39 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No Schedule control or tooltip |","+| FR-40 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | SchoolSettingsForm.tsx and the logo FileUpload missing |","+| FR-41 | PASS | validate.ts allows SVG for logo only (file-validate.test.ts; files-qa rejects lesson SVG and accepts logo SVG); [id]/route.ts sets CSP `default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'` for image/svg+xml |","+| FR-42 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | src/app/(app)/admin/settings/school/page.tsx missing |","+| FR-43 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | api/courses/[id]/modules, api/modules/[id], api/modules/[id]/lessons and api/lessons/[id] all missing |","+| FR-44 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | api/lessons/[id]/route.ts missing |","+| FR-45 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | The file logic is correctly in src/server/files/ with thin routes, but src/server/content/content-service.ts is missing |","+| FR-46 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | Audit for an admin deleting another user's file works (files-qa), but there are no content mutations to audit |","+| FR-47 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | prisma/seed.ts has no module/lesson seeding; prisma/seed-assets/fractions-worksheet.pdf missing |","+| FR-48 | FAIL | Unit tests for the sanitiser, video parser, visibility rule and registry exist and pass. The Dev-owned integration tests (files-content, file-purge) and tests/e2e/content.spec.ts are missing. QA's files-qa.test.ts covers upload/attach/download/purge, but no e2e exists |","+| NFR-1 | PASS | Bytes are stored under UPLOAD_DIR (not public/); the only read path is getFileForDownload → canAccessFile; files-qa access tests |","+| NFR-2 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | MarkdownView (rehype-sanitize) missing; nothing renders lesson Markdown yet |","+| NFR-3 | PASS | files-service.ts rateLimit(`upload:<id>`, 60, 1h); files-qa \"61st upload is RATE_LIMITED\"; route sets Retry-After |","+| NFR-4 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No Content tab or content queries to measure |","+| NFR-5 | PASS | storage.ts hashes and counts in a Transform during pipeline; files-service peeks only 4100 bytes and enforces the cap mid-stream; files-qa oversize rejection |","+| NFR-6 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No iframe, editor or reorder UI exists |","+| NFR-7 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No SH-8 UI was written, so there are no MUI imports or mui-mcp lookups to verify (no banned imports exist because there is no UI) |","+| NFR-8 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | File handlers enforce access server-side (files-qa), but the content handlers and pages do not exist |","+| NFR-9 | FAIL | New deps are limited to the allowed set (package.json); tsc and eslint pass; no re-scaffolding. But `npm run test` fails to start (pre-existing vitest.config.ts break, not caused by SH-8) |","+| NFR-10 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No date display or schedule picker exists |","+| NFR-11 | PASS | src/server/storage.ts is a single local-disk implementation with no S3 abstraction |","+| NFR-12 | PASS | grep finds no console.log in SH-8 files; purge.ts uses logger; .env.example:31-35 documents UPLOAD_DIR and MAX_UPLOAD_MB |"," ","-## Other observations (not failing)","+## Recommendation"," ","-- **NFR-2 restore.** \"Restore\" merges the whole saved draft into the current rows. If the roster changed since the draft was saved, the merge can bring back students who are no longer on the register, and the server then rejects the save with 400. A small fix: filter the draft to the current student ids.","-- **FR-9 avatars.** `avatarUrl` is always `null`, so `UserAvatar` shows initials. That is acceptable unless photos are expected.","-- **Admin page.** The admin page has a single static import chain. Lazy-loading ReportTab (`next/dynamic`) would keep the Today, Below-threshold and Settings tabs working even while DataGrid is broken.","-","-## New QA test files","-","-- `tests/integration/attendance-qa.test.ts`: 10 tests. The 2 that fail are intentional: they document defects FR-22 and FR-19.","-- `tests/unit/attendance-register-form.test.tsx`: 8 tests, all pass.","+1. Re-run the Dev phase for **TASK-9 onward**:","+   - the content service","+   - the content routes","+   - the components and pages","+   - the settings page","+   - seed and e2e","+2. Have Dev write SH-8 `dev-log.md` and `task-completion-markers.json`.","+3. Fix `vitest.config.ts` (`vitest/config.js` → `vitest/config`) so `npm test` runs.","+4. Re-run QA after that. The file storage layer is solid and can be built on as it stands."]}],"originalFile":"# QA Report — SH-7 (PRD-07 Attendance Tracking)\n\n## QA Summary\n\n- ticketId: SH-7\n- timestamp: 2026-11-06T12:35:00Z\n- overallStatus: FAIL\n- requirementsChecked: 51\n- requirementsPassed: 38\n- requirementsFailed: 13\n\n> This file replaces the stale SH-1 QA report.\n\n## Headline findings\n\n1. **BLOCKER (dependency issue from before SH-7): every attendance page that uses DataGrid fails to compile, so 9 FRs don't work in the running app.**\n   - Root cause: `@mui/x-data-grid@9.5.0` imports `@mui/x-internals/useFirstRender`. The lockfile resolves `@mui/x-internals` to `9.15.0` (because x-data-grid allows `^9.1.0`), and 9.15.0 no longer exports that path.\n   - QA reproduced it two ways:\n     - `node -e \"import('@mui/x-data-grid')\"` fails with *\"Package subpath './useFirstRender' is not defined by exports\"*.\n     - `next dev` logs `⨯ ./node_modules/@mui/x-data-grid/DataGrid/useDataGridComponent.mjs`.\n   - Pages that fail:\n     - `/students/[id]/attendance` (StudentAttendanceClient → DataTable).\n     - `/courses/[id]/attendance` (CourseAttendanceMatrix).\n     - **all of** `/admin/attendance`, because AdminAttendanceClient imports ReportTab statically, and ReportTab imports DataGrid. That takes down the Settings, Today and Below-threshold tabs as well.\n   - The **service and API layer behind these pages is proven correct** by the integration tests below. Each FAIL verdict blocked by this issue says so.\n   - Fix (a dependency change, outside SH-7's file ownership): pin `@mui/x-internals` to a version that matches 9.5, or upgrade all `@mui/x-*` packages together.\n2. **FAIL FR-22: an absent → present → absent sequence sends a second absence notification for the same session.**\n   - `notificationsFor` only compares against the previous save. Re-saving with no change is handled correctly, but the PRD says *\"Do not send more than one absence notification per student per session.\"*\n   - Evidence: `tests/integration/attendance-qa.test.ts` › FR-22 (expected 1, got 2).\n   - Fix: inside the transaction, check for an existing `attendance.absent` notification for this student and session (or keep a per-record `absenceNotifiedAt`) before sending.\n3. **FAIL FR-19 (from the FR-10 check): once an admin marks any student EXCUSED, the teacher can no longer save that register.**\n   - `saveRegister` rejects any EXCUSED value in the body for non-admins (`attendance-service.ts:219`), even when the row is unchanged.\n   - The UI always sends the full roster, so a teacher's later correction to *another* student fails with 403. That breaks the teacher's 14-day edit right.\n   - Evidence: `tests/integration/attendance-qa.test.ts` › FR-10/FR-19 (got FORBIDDEN).\n   - Fix: reject only rows whose status is EXCUSED **and** differs from the saved value. Do the check on `diff` inside the transaction.\n4. **FAIL NFR-10: `npm run test` cannot start** (issue from before SH-7). `vitest.config.ts` imports `vitest/config.js`, which doesn't resolve. Every test in this report was run with `vitest.tmp.config.ts`, the same config with the `vitest/config` import.\n5. **Carried over: the CSP still blocks hydration** (`next.config.js` `script-src 'self'`). The e2e only works with `bypassCSP: true`. See SH-1 QA blocker 1.\n\n## Test execution\n\n| Suite | Command | Result |\n|---|---|---|\n| Typecheck | `npx tsc --noEmit` | clean |\n| Lint | `npm run lint` | ✔ no warnings/errors |\n| `npm run test` | — | **does not start** (finding 4) |\n| Full vitest | `TEST_DATABASE_URL=… npx vitest run -c vitest.tmp.config.ts` | 225/229 pass. Failures: 2 QA SH-7 defect tests, plus 2 older failures (`auth-forms`, `useToast`). 2 older files fail to load (`DataTable`, `lockout`). |\n| SH-7 unit | attendance-rules (13) + attendance-register-form (8, new) | 21/21 pass |\n| SH-7 integration | attendance-service (7) + attendance-qa (10, new) | 15/17 pass (FR-22 and FR-19 fail) |\n| E2E | `APP_URL=http://localhost:3100 npx playwright test tests/e2e/attendance.spec.ts` (next dev :3100) | teacher test ✓. Parent test: notification ✓ (2nd, warm run); calendar ✘ (page fails to compile) |\n| NFR-1 timing (local) | attendance-qa › NFR-1 | 35-student save **39–101 ms** (<500). 1,200-record tab **45–50 ms** (<400). |\n\nStatic checks:\n- No banned or non-MUI UI libraries are imported in any SH-7 file. The only third-party imports are `@prisma/client`, `date-fns(-tz)`, `next/*`, `react` and `zod`, plus `@mui/*`.\n- No `console.*` calls in SH-7 `src/` files.\n\n## Requirement Results\n\n| Requirement | Status | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| FR-1 | PASS | prisma/schema.prisma; migrations/20261107000000_attendance/migration.sql:2,12-47 (enum, models, `sessionId_studentId` unique, `studentId_createdAt` index) |\n| FR-2 | PASS | migration.sql:73 CHECK; service builds course-xor-section keys (attendance-service.ts:247); attendance-service.test.ts › DB CHECK (both and neither rejected) |\n| FR-3 | PASS | migration.sql:77-78; attendance-service.test.ts › P2002 on both partial indexes |\n| FR-4 | PASS | migration.sql:8-9 (defaults PER_PERIOD / 90); attendance-qa.test.ts › FR-33 reads threshold 90 |\n| FR-5 | FAIL | `PATCH /api/settings/school` (src/app/api/settings/school/route.ts) and the Settings tab exist, but `/admin/attendance` doesn't compile (finding 1). The PATCH route also has no test. |\n| FR-6 | PASS | attendance-qa.test.ts › FR-6 (meeting listed, `taken:null`, `isCurrent`); take/page.tsx 'Taken HH:mm by' label + contained button for the current meeting |\n| FR-7 | PASS | attendance-service.ts:155-162 + take/page.tsx 'Daily register – <section>'. Code review only: no test, because the global mode is PER_PERIOD. |\n| FR-8 | PASS | attendance-rules.test.ts (14/15-day edges, future dates); attendance-service.test.ts › future → VALIDATION_ERROR, 15 days → FORBIDDEN, admin OK; DateNav.tsx disableFuture plus the same `canOpen` |\n| FR-9 | PASS | attendance-register-form.test.tsx › nothing selected by default, SR labels; attendance-service.test.ts › roster sorted by last name; e2e teacher test |\n| FR-10 | PASS | attendance-register-form.test.tsx › E disabled for a teacher, enabled for an admin; attendance-service.test.ts › teacher EXCUSED → FORBIDDEN. (The overly broad server check is reported under FR-19.) |\n| FR-11 | PASS | attendance-register-form.test.tsx › Mark all present keeps existing A |\n| FR-12 | PASS | attendance-register-form.test.tsx › L reveals minutes (default 5), 241 blocked, note behind icon, maxlength 500; validators.ts:40-48 |\n| FR-13 | PASS | attendance-register-form.test.tsx › live counters, Save disabled while unmarked; e2e |\n| FR-14 | PASS | attendance-service.test.ts › atomic save (no session row on failure), single session; register-form test + e2e › 'Last changed by' |\n| FR-15 | PASS | attendance-service.test.ts › homeroom teacher OK, other teacher FORBIDDEN; roster = sectionMember (service:97-99) |\n| FR-16 | PASS | src/app/(app)/attendance/take/section/[sectionId]/page.tsx reuses RegisterForm |\n| FR-17 | PASS | attendance-register-form.test.tsx › 44 px toggles and note button, sticky Paper; RegisterForm.tsx:182 minHeight 48; e2e at 375×667 |\n| FR-18 | PASS | attendance-service.test.ts › audit count; service:284-296 metadata {old,new,note}, actor |\n| FR-19 | FAIL | Window rule passes (attendance-service.test.ts). But attendance-qa.test.ts › FR-10/FR-19 shows a teacher can't save a register an admin has excused anyone on (finding 3). |\n| FR-20 | PASS | src/server/notifications/types.ts:61-76 |\n| FR-21 | PASS | attendance-qa.test.ts › title 'QA Aardvark was marked absent', body '<Course> – <Section>, <Period>, <Weekday d MMM yyyy>', link `/students/<id>/attendance`, parent + student |\n| FR-22 | FAIL | attendance-qa.test.ts › A→P→A sends 2 absence notifications (finding 2). Corrected and plain re-save work (attendance-service.test.ts). Also, \"within the same day\" is not enforced for `attendance.corrected`. |\n| FR-23 | PASS | types.ts:77-92; attendance-qa.test.ts › register_missing delivered to the teacher |\n| FR-24 | PASS | src/config/student-tabs.ts:13 (ALL_ROLES). Note: no page renders `studentTabs` yet (it is an extension point). |\n| FR-25 | FAIL | Service summary is correct (attendance-qa.test.ts › FR-28 summary.year). The tab page doesn't compile (finding 1). |\n| FR-26 | FAIL | `dayColour` is unit-tested; the e2e calendar assertion fails because the page doesn't compile (finding 1). |\n| FR-27 | FAIL | Notes are stripped for PARENT/STUDENT (attendance-qa.test.ts › FR-27), but the table page doesn't compile (finding 1). The table also has no filter controls beyond month navigation. |\n| FR-28 | PASS | attendance-rules.test.ts › rate; attendance-qa.test.ts › DROPPED records count (rate 0, records 1); `kindWhere` (service:52) picks session kind by mode |\n| FR-29 | FAIL | `getCourseMatrix` passes (attendance-qa.test.ts › dropped row, rate, oldest→newest sessions); CourseAttendanceMatrix doesn't compile (finding 1) |\n| FR-30 | FAIL | `getOverview` passes (attendance-qa.test.ts › FR-30/31); `/admin/attendance` doesn't compile (finding 1) |\n| FR-31 | FAIL | Missing-register list + `remindTeacher` pass (attendance-qa.test.ts); the admin UI with the Remind button doesn't compile (finding 1) |\n| FR-32 | FAIL | `getReport` aggregates and status filter pass, CSV via `toCsv` (attendance-qa.test.ts › FR-32); the ReportTab UI doesn't compile (finding 1) |\n| FR-33 | FAIL | `getBelowThreshold` passes (ascending, href, threshold 90); the UI doesn't compile (finding 1) |\n| FR-34 | PASS | src/config/navigation.ts:34-35 |\n| FR-35 | PASS | All 9 routes exist under src/app/api/{attendance,students,courses,admin/attendance}. Role gates: `requireRole('TEACHER','ADMIN')` / `requireRole('ADMIN')`, plus service checks (`assertCanManageCourse`/`assertCanViewStudent`). Handlers are not unit-tested; the e2e covers PUT register. |\n| FR-36 | PASS | src/lib/validators/attendance.ts imported by RegisterForm.tsx:19 and every handler |\n| FR-37 | PASS | src/server/attendance/attendance-service.ts |\n| FR-38 | PASS | prisma/seed.ts:165-261 (mulberry32(20261107), 15 teaching days, 94/3/3, two students forced to 73%). Code review only: this DB has no 7A/7B data, so the seed skips. |\n| FR-39 | PASS | tests/unit/attendance-rules.test.ts (13/13) |\n| FR-40 | PASS | tests/integration/attendance-service.test.ts (7/7) |\n| FR-41 | FAIL | tests/e2e/attendance.spec.ts: teacher flow at 375 px ✓, parent notification ✓, parent calendar red-day ✘ (finding 1) |\n| NFR-1 | PASS | attendance-qa.test.ts › NFR-1: save of 35 in 39–101 ms, tab with 1,200 records in 45–50 ms (local DB) |\n| NFR-2 | PASS | attendance-register-form.test.tsx › fetch rejects → localStorage `attendance-draft:c1:<date>:p1` → next open offers 'Restore unsaved attendance?' → marks restored |\n| NFR-3 | PASS | attendance-service.test.ts › enrolled-after and dropped students → VALIDATION_ERROR with `invalidStudentIds`; incomplete roster rejected |\n| NFR-4 | PASS | e2e teacher test: mark all + 2 exceptions + save in ~2 s; one tap per exception |\n| NFR-5 | PASS | attendance-qa.test.ts › in-app notification created synchronously after commit; EmailOutbox row queued for the parent |\n| NFR-6 | PASS | No banned imports (static scan above); tsc clean against @mui 9.5 types; dev-log lists the mui-mcp lookups (useMuiDocs 9.5.0, fetchDocs for ToggleButtonGroup/ToggleButton/Tabs/DateCalendar). Caveat: lookups aren't logged for every component used (Chip, Tooltip, DatePicker, DataGrid…). |\n| NFR-7 | PASS | attendance-qa.test.ts › unlinked parent and other student → NOT_FOUND (platform convention), linked parent OK; attendance-service.test.ts › non-owner/non-homeroom teacher FORBIDDEN |\n| NFR-8 | PASS | `@db.Date` DATE columns, cuid ids, `ok`/`paginated` envelopes, `parsePagination` (max 100), `audit()` on edits and reminders. Minor: prisma/seed.ts:205 uses `console.log` (seed script). |\n| NFR-9 | PASS | attendance-register-form.test.tsx › every toggle has an accessible name and is ≥44×44 px |\n| NFR-10 | FAIL | lint and typecheck are green; `npm run test` does not start (vitest.config.ts, from before SH-7). No PRD-14/15 scope was implemented. |\n\n## Other observations (not failing)\n\n- **NFR-2 restore.** \"Restore\" merges the whole saved draft into the current rows. If the roster changed since the draft was saved, the merge can bring back students who are no longer on the register, and the server then rejects the save with 400. A small fix: filter the draft to the current student ids.\n- **FR-9 avatars.** `avatarUrl` is always `null`, so `UserAvatar` shows initials. That is acceptable unless photos are expected.\n- **Admin page.** The admin page has a single static import chain. Lazy-loading ReportTab (`next/dynamic`) would keep the Today, Below-threshold and Settings tabs working even while DataGrid is broken.\n\n## New QA test files\n\n- `tests/integration/attendance-qa.test.ts`: 10 tests. The 2 that fail are intentional: they document defects FR-22 and FR-19.\n- `tests/unit/attendance-register-form.test.tsx`: 8 tests, all pass.\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01AeEMYph3pEY6qD7vLVdi8B","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnuffeKRxQT1XnmBeyV8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"QA verdict for SH-8: **FAIL**. Dev finished only about the first third of the ticket. 21 of 60 requirements pass, 2 fail and 37 aren't implemented.\n\n- **Dev phase incomplete:** `artifacts/dev/dev-log.md` and `task-completion-markers.json` are still the SH-7 files, because Dev never wrote SH-8 ones. Dev ran 3 times without its first pass being accepted, and the SH-8 security scan checked 0 files. So I compared the SH-8 file list against what's on disk: 33 of the 66 planned files are missing.\n- **What works:** the file storage backend (TASK-1 to TASK-8):\n  - **Data and storage:** the database models and migration, disk storage, upload validation, and access control on downloads.\n  - **Endpoints and cleanup:** the `/api/files` upload, download and delete endpoints, the per-user upload limit, and the daily cleanup of unattached files.\n  - **Quality:** it's real code with no placeholders. Typecheck and lint pass, and all 40 tests pass, including 14 I added.\n- **What's missing:** TASK-9 onward, so no role can use course content yet:\n  - **Backend:** the content service and every module, lesson, progress and learning API route.\n  - **UI:** every component and page — the Content tab, lesson viewer and editor, Learning tab, and `/admin/settings/school`.\n  - **Seed and tests:** the seed content, its PDF asset, and Dev's integration and end-to-end tests.\n- **`npm test` doesn't start:** this was already broken before SH-8. `vitest.config.ts` imports `vitest/config.js`, which can't be found. I ran everything with `vitest.tmp.config.ts` instead.\n\nTests I added:\n- **`tests/integration/files-qa.test.ts`** (10 tests, run against the local Postgres; test data is cleaned up afterwards): upload checks, oversize and disguised files, who can download what, delete rules, the audit log entry, the 60-uploads-per-hour limit, and the 24-hour cleanup.\n- **`tests/unit/content-validators.test.ts`** (4 tests): content field limits, link and video URL rules, scheduling must be in the future, and the reorder request shape.\n\nNo coverage tool is installed, so the coverage report is a manual mapping, roughly 75% of the existing server code. The two `/api/files` endpoint handlers themselves have no tests; I only read their code.\n\nNext steps: re-run Dev from TASK-9 and have it write SH-8 dev artifacts, change `vitest/config.js` to `vitest/config` in `vitest.config.ts`, then re-run QA.\n\nFiles are in `artifacts/qa/`:\n- `qa-report.md`\n- `coverage-report.md`"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":89161,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":760,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e79742d4-00ef-4cc8-ab33-edc1cbedabaa","uuid":"45d5a42c-5ad5-433a-8a56-bf20131d059a","timestamp":"2026-11-07T04:07:25.957Z","request_id":"req_011CgnuffQw14ZVxnPEyDD1y"}
