PASS | English copy; labelled inputs used by e2e `getByLabel` (Title, Max points, Attach files, Feedback, Final score); keyboard-operable ToggleButtons / List |\n\n## Test files written by QA\n- `tests/integration/assignments/qa-sh9.test.ts`: 9 tests, real Postgres, tagged fixtures (`qa-sh9-gap`) cleaned up in `afterAll`.\n  - Run: `TEST_DATABASE_URL=\"postgresql://schoolhub:schoolhub@localhost:5433/schoolhub?schema=public\" npx vitest run tests/integration/assignments`\n\n## Artifacts\n- `artifacts/qa/coverage-report.md`: function-to-test coverage map and gaps.\n- `artifacts/qa/qa-report.md`: this file.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":162,"newStart":1,"newLines":153,"lines":["-# QA Report — SH-8 (PRD-08 File Storage & Course Content)","+# QA Report — SH-9 (PRD-09 Assignments & Submissions)"," "," ## QA Summary"," ","-- ticketId: SH-8","-- timestamp: 2026-11-07T03:45:00Z","+- ticketId: SH-9","+- timestamp: 2026-11-09T06:10:50Z"," - overallStatus: FAIL","-- requirementsChecked: 60","-- requirementsPassed: 21","-- requirementsFailed: 39","+- requirementsChecked: 78","+- requirementsPassed: 76","+- requirementsFailed: 2"," ","-> This file replaces the stale SH-7 QA report. Of the 39 failed requirements, 2 are FAIL and 37 are NOT-IMPLEMENTED.","+> This file replaces the stale SH-8 QA report. All 61 functional requirements PASS. The 2 failures are non-functional:","+> **NFR-12** is a small fix (3 `console.log` lines in the seed). **NFR-13** fails because `npm run test` is not fully green. All 6 failing tests are outside SH-9 and existed before it.","+> The feature is complete and works end to end. It is ready for review once NFR-12 is fixed and the NFR-13 failures are accepted as known or fixed separately."," "," ## Headline findings"," ","-### 1. BLOCKER: the Dev phase for SH-8 is incomplete, and it left no report","+### 1. The build and test suite run, and the feature works end to end","+- `tsc --noEmit` is clean and `npm run lint` is clean.","+- All 57 SH-9 tests are green (29 unit, 23 integration against a real Postgres on :5433, 5 Playwright e2e against `next start -p 3100`).","+- QA added `tests/integration/assignments/qa-sh9.test.ts` (9 tests). It covers what Dev's tests did not: scheduling and visibility, publish-once, delete vs archive, duplicate, privacy and access control, the roster, \"To grade\", and editing max points.","+- All 9 pass. QA found no functional defects.","+- Dev's self-report checked out. All 55 `file-ownership-matrix.json` paths are present (54 exist; `vitest.tmp.config.ts` was deleted as planned). A grep found no TODO, FIXME or stub implementations in the SH-9 files."," ","-- `artifacts/dev/dev-log.md` and `artifacts/dev/task-completion-markers.json` are still the **SH-7** files. Dev never wrote SH-8 versions.","-- `dev-rerun-count.json` shows `count: 3, firstPassAccepted: false`.","-- `security-scan-report.json` (SH-8) scanned **0 files**.","-- QA therefore checked reality against `file-ownership-matrix.json` (SH-8) directly. **33 of the 66 owned paths are missing on disk.**","+### 2. NFR-13: `npm run test` is not fully green, and the cause is outside SH-9","+The full suite passed 306 of 312 tests on the first run. The 6 failures:"," ","-### 2. What was built: the file storage backend (TASK-1 to TASK-8, roughly)","+| Test | Failure | Why it is not SH-9 |","+|---|---|---|","+| `attendance-qa.test.ts` FR-22 | expected 2 absence notifications to be 1 | `attendance-service.ts` was last changed Nov 6, before SH-9. SH-9 only added entries to `notifications/types.ts`. |","+| `attendance-qa.test.ts` FR-10/FR-19 | `FORBIDDEN` vs `OK` | Depends on the time of day (the attendance edit window). Not SH-9 code. |","+| `attendance-qa.test.ts` NFR-1 perf | timing | Flaky: it passed on the rerun. |","+| `auth.test.ts` rate limit | — | Flaky: it passed on the rerun. |","+| `auth-forms.test.tsx`, `useToast.test.tsx` | focus and timer assertions | Do not import SH-9 code. |","+| `lockout.test.ts` | next-auth can't resolve `next/server` under Node 24 ESM | Environment problem. Not SH-9 code. |"," ","-- Built:","-  - dependencies, env vars and `.gitignore`","-  - the Prisma models and migration","-  - `storage.ts`","-  - upload validation","-  - the visibility rule and video parser","-  - the access registry and built-in contexts","-  - the files service","-  - the `/api/files` routes","-  - the orphan purge and its maintenance hook","-  - the content Zod validators","-- This code is real (no stubs or TODOs). It typechecks and lints clean, and it passes 40/40 tests, including the 14 QA added.","+- The repo has no git baseline: the git root is `$HOME` and the whole project is untracked. Before SH-9, `vitest.config.ts` could not load at all.","+- So QA cannot prove these failures existed before SH-9. The evidence above (file dates, imports, flakiness) points that way.","+- Strictly, NFR-13 (\"npm run test keeps passing\") is **not met**. It needs a separate fix outside this ticket."," ","-### 3. What is missing: TASK-10 to TASK-21","+### 3. NFR-12: `console.log` in committed SH-9 code","+- `prisma/seed.ts` lines 303, 341 and 385 (the FR-61 \"course not found, skipping\" messages) use `console.log`.","+- `logger` is already imported in that file. The older seed blocks at lines 148 and 206 use the same pattern, which is probably why it was copied.","+- Fix: change those 3 lines to `logger.info(...)`.","+- The runtime code has no `console.log` (`src/server/assignments`, the API routes, the pages and the components)."," ","-- **Server:** the content service, every content/lesson/module/progress/learning API route, and the settings validator.","-- **UI:** every UI component (FileUpload, FileList, MarkdownView, StatusChip, VideoEmbed) and every page (Content tab, lesson viewer and editor, Learning tab, `/admin/settings/school`).","-- **Seed:** the seed content and the seed PDF asset.","-- **Tests:** the Dev-owned integration, Markdown and e2e tests.","-- **Effect:** no course-content feature is usable by any role.","+### 4. Notes for the reviewer (not failures)","+- **FR-41:** the student tab is registered and `/students/[id]/assignments` plus its API work, but no page renders `studentTabs`. The page is reachable by URL only. This gap was carried over from SH-8 and was known at intake.","+- **FR-40:** the nav entry also includes `ADMIN`, which the spec did not ask for. Admins get the cross-course \"To grade\" list. This is harmless, but it is a scope deviation.","+- **D11 / `next.config.js`:**","+  - `X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN` and `frame-ancestors 'self'` now apply to `/api/files/:id` only.","+  - There is also a webpack alias for `@mui/x-internals/useFirstRender`.","+  - These security-header and build changes need a human sign-off.","+- **e2e build freshness:**","+  - `src/app/api/me/assignments/route.ts` was changed at 11:02, after `.next/BUILD_ID` was built at 11:00 (local time).","+  - The e2e run used that build. The change is `force-dynamic`, a build-mode flag that does not change behaviour.","+  - That route is covered by the integration tests on source.","+- **Stale server:**","+  - A stale `next-server` (PID 63666) from 27 Oct is still listening on :3000 and serving old code. QA did not kill it.","+  - Playwright's `reuseExistingServer` would test the wrong code on :3000, so restart that server before manual QA.","+- **FR-61 seed:** QA checked the seed code but did not run it, to avoid changing the shared dev database. Dev reports the seed is idempotent (7 rows created, then 0 on a second run).","+- **NFR-3 / NFR-16:** these are checked against the implementation only (prefetch cache, keyboard handler). Nothing measures the timings automatically."," ","-### 4. Pre-existing: `npm test` does not start","-","-- `vitest.config.ts` imports `vitest/config.js` (MODULE_NOT_FOUND). This was carried over from SH-7 and is not caused by SH-8.","-- All runs used `vitest.tmp.config.ts`.","-","-### 5. Minor (not a defect)","-","-- If an uploaded filename contains a raw control character in the multipart header, busboy rejects it as \"Malformed multipart body\" before `sanitizeFilename` runs.","-- That is a safe failure. Browsers do not send raw control characters.","-- `sanitizeFilename` itself strips them (unit-tested).","-","-## Commands run","-","-| Command | Result |","-|---|---|","-| `npx tsc --noEmit` | exit 0 |","-| `npx eslint` on all SH-8 source and test files | exit 0 |","-| `npx prisma migrate status` | 9 migrations, DB up to date (the SH-8 migration is applied) |","-| `npx vitest run --config vitest.tmp.config.ts` on the 5 SH-8 unit tests | 30/30 pass |","-| `TEST_DATABASE_URL=… npx vitest run --config vitest.tmp.config.ts tests/integration/files-qa.test.ts` | 10/10 pass |","-| `npx vitest run` (`npm test`) | fails to start (pre-existing config break) |","-","-## Tests added by QA","-","-- **tests/integration/files-qa.test.ts** (10 tests, real Postgres plus a temp UPLOAD_DIR). It covers:","-  - PNG upload with sha256, key format, server-side MIME and path under UPLOAD_DIR","-  - rejection of .exe, an ELF disguised as .txt, SVG outside logo, and oversize files","-  - txt and logo-SVG accepted","-  - owner/admin can download an unattached file; others and anonymous get NOT_FOUND","-  - an attached logo is public; a lesson file pointing at a missing lesson is denied","-  - attaching someone else's file is refused","-  - delete: owner OK (row and bytes), attached → CONFLICT, stranger → NOT_FOUND","-  - an admin delete writes an audit row","-  - 61st upload → RATE_LIMITED","-  - orphan purge: only unattached files older than 24 h, with their bytes","-- **tests/unit/content-validators.test.ts** (4 tests). It covers:","-  - FR-16 field limits","-  - link and video URL rules","-  - SCHEDULED must be in the future","-  - the reorder schema shape","-"," ## Requirement Results"," "," | Requirement | Status | Evidence |"," |---|---|---|","-| FR-1 | PASS | prisma/schema.prisma:564 FileObject (unique s