ed). A grep found no TODO, FIXME or stub implementations in the SH-9 files.","+### 1. The build and tests run, and every quiz test is green","+| Check | Result |","+|---|---|","+| `npx prisma migrate status` | ✅ 11 migrations, schema up to date (incl. `20261110000000_add_quizzes`) |","+| `npm run lint` | ✅ no warnings/errors |","+| `npx tsc --noEmit` | ✅ clean (incl. the new QA test) |","+| Quiz unit + integration (`tests/unit/quiz`, `tests/integration/quiz`) | ✅ **53/53**: 37 unit, 8 dev integration, 8 new QA integration |","+| E2E `tests/e2e/quizzes.spec.ts` (QA rerun on `next start -p 3100`) | ✅ **4/4** (build → publish → take with reload → grade essay → see results) |","+| Full `vitest run` | ⚠️ 360/366. 6 failures, all pre-existing (see below) |"," ","-### 2. NFR-13: `npm run test` is not fully green, and the cause is outside SH-9","-The full suite passed 306 of 312 tests on the first run. The 6 failures:","+### 2. Full-suite failures are pre-existing and do not touch quiz code","+| Failing test | Status before SH-10 |","+|---|---|","+| `attendance-qa.test.ts` FR-22, FR-10/FR-19 | Listed in the SH-9 report (time-of-day / attendance service) |","+| `auth.test.ts` rate limit | Listed in SH-9 (flaky) |","+| `auth-forms.test.tsx`, `useToast.test.tsx` | Listed in SH-9 |","+| `lockout.test.ts` | Listed in SH-9 (next-auth ESM resolution under Node 24) |","+| `email-dispatch.test.ts` AC-4 (concurrent dispatchers) | Flaky when run alongside other DB suites. Passed **3/3** when run alone. It tests `server/email/dispatch`, which SH-10 did not change; SH-10 only added two try/catch'd calls in the dispatch *route*. |"," ","-| Test | Failure | Why it is not SH-9 |","-|---|---|---|","-| `attendance-qa.test.ts` FR-22 | expected 2 absence notifications to be 1 | `attendance-service.ts` was last changed Nov 6, before SH-9. SH-9 only added entries to `notifications/types.ts`. |","-| `attendance-qa.test.ts` FR-10/FR-19 | `FORBIDDEN` vs `OK` | Depends on the time of day (the attendance edit window). Not SH-9 code. |","-| `attendance-qa.test.ts` NFR-1 perf | timing | Flaky: it passed on the rerun. |","-| `auth.test.ts` rate limit | — | Flaky: it passed on the rerun. |","-| `auth-forms.test.tsx`, `useToast.test.tsx` | focus and timer assertions | Do not import SH-9 code. |","-| `lockout.test.ts` | next-auth can't resolve `next/server` under Node 24 ESM | Environment problem. Not SH-9 code. |","+### 3. Dev's self-reported completion matches the code","+- All 51 paths in `file-ownership-matrix.json` exist and contain real implementations.","+- There are no `TODO` or `FIXME` markers and no stub functions in the quiz code.","+- The two `ponytail:` notes in `attempt-service.ts` are documented trade-offs, not missing features: a hand-rolled cuid-shaped id, and a rare save-vs-submit race that a Regrade fixes.","+- All 23 tasks are marked complete, and each maps to the code that implements it."," ","-- The repo has no git baseline: the git root is `$HOME` and the whole project is untracked. Before SH-9, `vitest.config.ts` could not load at all.","-- So QA cannot prove these failures existed before SH-9. The evidence above (file dates, imports, flakiness) points that way.","-- Strictly, NFR-13 (\"npm run test keeps passing\") is **not met**. It needs a separate fix outside this ticket.","+### 4. New QA tests (`tests/integration/quiz/qa-sh10.test.ts`, 8 tests) fill the gaps in dev's coverage","+- **NFR-1:** asserts that the JSON from the student `getQuiz`, the in-progress attempt and the pre-release result never contains `\"correct\"`, `\"explanation\"` or the explanation text. Manager `getQuiz` does include them.","+- **FR-11 / FR-31:** the course list is shaped by role (manager / student / parent). Drafts are hidden from students. A student outside the course and a teacher of another course get NOT_FOUND. A quiz with no attempts can be deleted.","+- **FR-26 / FR-27:** checks the analytics summary (avg / median / high / low), the 10-bucket histogram, the option distribution, the most-chosen wrong option, and the CSV header and rows. Non-managers get NOT_FOUND.","+- **FR-34 / NFR-5:** a parent sees a linked child's result only after release. An unlinked parent, another student and another teacher get NOT_FOUND. Cross-student autosave and cross-course grading are refused.","+- **FR-28 / FR-38:** extra time feeds the deadline (10 + 15 = 25 min). An accommodation for a student not enrolled in the course gets NOT_FOUND. Accommodation, grade, regrade and release each write an `AuditLog` row.","+- **FR-31:** reorder rejects a partial or duplicate id list.","+- **NFR-2:** the median of 50 concurrent saves is under 50 ms. Saves are upserts: 2 rows after 51 saves."," ","-### 3. NFR-12: `console.log` in committed SH-9 code","-- `prisma/seed.ts` lines 303, 341 and 385 (the FR-61 \"course not found, skipping\" messages) use `console.log`.","-- `logger` is already imported in that file. The older seed blocks at lines 148 and 206 use the same pattern, which is probably why it was copied.","-- Fix: change those 3 lines to `logger.info(...)`.","-- The runtime code has no `console.log` (`src/server/assignments`, the API routes, the pages and the components).","-","-### 4. Notes for the reviewer (not failures)","-- **FR-41:** the student tab is registered and `/students/[id]/assignments` plus its API work, but no page renders `studentTabs`. The page is reachable by URL only. This gap was carried over from SH-8 and was known at intake.","-- **FR-40:** the nav entry also includes `ADMIN`, which the spec did not ask for. Admins get the cross-course \"To grade\" list. This is harmless, but it is a scope deviation.","-- **D11 / `next.config.js`:**","-  - `X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN` and `frame-ancestors 'self'` now apply to `/api/files/:id` only.","-  - There is also a webpack alias for `@mui/x-internals/useFirstRender`.","-  - These security-header and build changes need a human sign-off.","-- **e2e build freshness:**","-  - `src/app/api/me/assignments/route.ts` was changed at 11:02, after `.next/BUILD_ID` was built at 11:00 (local time).","-  - The e2e run used that build. The change is `force-dynamic`, a build-mode flag that does not change behaviour.","-  - That route is covered by the integration tests on source.","-- **Stale server:**","-  - A stale `next-server` (PID 63666) from 27 Oct is still listening on :3000 and serving old code. QA did not kill it.","-  - Playwright's `reuseExistingServer` would test the wrong code on :3000, so restart that server before manual QA.","-- **FR-61 seed:** QA checked the seed code but did not run it, to avoid changing the shared dev database. Dev reports the seed is idempotent (7 rows created, then 0 on a second run).","-- **NFR-3 / NFR-16:** these are checked against the implementation only (prefetch cache, keyboard handler). Nothing measures the timings automatically.","-"," ## Requirement Results"," "," | Requirement | Status | Evidence |"," |---|---|---|","-| FR-1 | PASS | `prisma/migrations/20261109000000_add_assignments/migration.sql`, `prisma/schema.prisma`; enums used by all integration tests |","-| FR-2 | PASS | `prisma/schema.prisma` Assignment (allowExtraCredit, notifiedAt, archivedAt, rubricId @unique, Cascade); `qa-sh9.test.ts` (archive, notifiedAt) |","-| FR-3 | PASS | `schema.prisma` AssignmentAttachment/Rubric/RubricCriterion; `qa-sh9.test.ts` FR-15 (rubric criteria copied) |","-| FR-4 | PASS | `schema.prisma` Submission/SubmissionFile/SubmissionHistory; `submissions.test.ts` resubmission history |","-| FR-5 | PASS | `schema.prisma` GradeExemption composite id; `submissions.test.ts` FR-35 |","-| FR-6 | PASS | `schema.prisma` AssignmentReminder unique; `reminders.test.ts` idempotency |","-| FR-7 | PASS | `src/lib/validators/assignments.ts`; `tests/unit/assignments/assignment-validators.test.ts` (limits, cutoff > due) |","-| FR-8 | PASS | `assignments-service.ts` `gradeOffline`; `grading.test.ts` \"offline grade creates attempt 0\" |","-| FR