fies students + parent once; `attempts.test.ts` AFTER_CLOSE idempotent under concurrent runs |","+| FR-31 | PASS | Route files under `src/app/api/{courses/[id]/quizzes,quizzes,questions}`; `regrade.test.ts` + `qa-sh10.test.ts` (CRUD, delete-only-without-attempts, reorder validation) |","+| FR-32 | PASS | `src/app/api/attempts/**`, `quizzes/[id]/attempts`; `attempts.test.ts` (start/resume, save, submit, owner-only) |","+| FR-33 | PASS | `attempts.test.ts` \"getStudentQuizScore … reports isPractice\" |","+| FR-34 | PASS | `src/server/quiz/access.ts` wraps `course-access.ts`; `qa-sh10.test.ts` parent / outsider / other-teacher checks |","+| FR-35 | PASS | `src/app/api/internal/email/dispatch/route.ts` L9, L40–50; `attempts.test.ts` \"maintenance … idempotent under concurrent runs\" |","+| FR-36 | PASS | `prisma/seed.ts` L455–557 (Fractions Check CLOSED + GRADED attempts; Unit 1 Test AFTER_CLOSE +3 days; Parts of Speech practice, 3 attempts, HIGHEST). Verified by code inspection: the dev DB has no MATH-7A, so this QA run could not execute it (the dev log records an idempotent fixture run) |","+| FR-37 | PASS | No sidebar entry needed per FR-37; the course tab (`course-tabs.ts` L18) plus direct routes cover it |","+| FR-38 | PASS | `qa-sh10.test.ts` asserts AuditLog actions `quiz.accommodation`, `quizAnswer.grade`, `quiz.regrade`, `quiz.release_results` |","+| FR-39 | PASS | `QuestionEditor.tsx` (MarkdownEditor + FileUpload); `QuizGradingWorkspace.tsx` MarkdownView; `files/contexts.ts` `'quiz'` resolver; `quiz-service.ts` `attachPromptFiles` |","+| NFR-1 | PASS | `serializers.test.ts` (no `correct` key); `qa-sh10.test.ts` (no `correct`/`explanation` in student quiz, attempt, or pre-release result JSON) |","+| NFR-2 | PASS | `attempt-service.ts` `saveAnswer` (one read + one upsert); `qa-sh10.test.ts` median of 50 concurrent saves < 50 ms, upsert-only. Not load-tested at 300 users |","+| NFR-3 | PASS | `QuizPlayer.tsx` native MUI Radio/Checkbox; `aria-live=\"assertive\"` L329, announced at 5 and 1 min L286–288; e2e axe scan of `<main>` |","+| NFR-4 | PASS | Grep found no banned imports (Tailwind/Radix/Recharts/notistack/etc.) and no `className` in quiz UI; BarChart from `@mui/x-charts`; the dev log records the mui-mcp lookups |","+| NFR-5 | PASS | Every quiz route handler and page calls `requireUser`/`requireRole` (static check); `qa-sh10.test.ts` + `attempts.test.ts` NOT_FOUND for non-owners and non-managers |","+| NFR-6 | PASS | Handlers use `withHandler` + `parseBody(zod)` + `ok()`; pagination in `listCourseQuizzes`; `CONFLICT` after deadline (`attempts.test.ts`) |","+| NFR-7 | **FAIL** | Code lives in `src/server/quiz/` and reuses `grading-math`, `notify`, `audit`, `csv`, `logger`, MarkdownView and ConfirmDialog, with no new deps. **But `prisma/seed.ts:463` and `:526` add `console.log`** (\"skipping its quizzes\"). Fix: use `logger.info` (already imported at L3) |","+| NFR-8 | **FAIL** | All the required tests exist and pass: grading/deadline/policy/serializer units, autosave-after-deadline / auto-submit / regrade integration, and the 4-step e2e. **But `npm run test` is not green**: 6 failures, all pre-existing and outside SH-10 (Headline 2). lint and typecheck are green |","+| NFR-9 | PASS | Builder flow: add + type picker + per-type editor + publish (`QuizBuilder.tsx`, `QuestionList.tsx`). The e2e builds and publishes a 4-question quiz through the UI. No human timing study was done |","+| NFR-10 | PASS | Out of scope, and none of it is present (grep for lockdown/webcam/question bank in `src` and the schema: no matches) |"," ","-## Test files written by QA","-- `tests/integration/assignments/qa-sh9.test.ts`: 9 tests, real Postgres, tagged fixtures (`qa-sh9-gap`) cleaned up in `afterAll`.","-  - Run: `TEST_DATABASE_URL=\"postgresql://schoolhub:schoolhub@localhost:5433/schoolhub?schema=public\" npx vitest run tests/integration/assignments`","-","-## Artifacts","-- `artifacts/qa/coverage-report.md`: function-to-test coverage map and gaps.","-- `artifacts/qa/qa-report.md`: this file.","+## Recommended follow-ups (not blocking feature behaviour)","+1. **NFR-7:** in `prisma/seed.ts` L463 and L526, change `console.log` to `logger.info`.","+2. **NFR-8:** triage the 6 pre-existing failures (carried over from SH-9), or mark them as known so the suite can be green.","+3. **Coverage gaps (low risk):** a unit test for the `useAutosave` offline queue/retry, and an e2e for builder duplicate, drag and preview.","+4. **From the dev log, outside SH-10's scope:** NUL bytes in `renderEmail` previews (`EmailOutbox` insert rejected); the chained-refine `DecimalError` in `validators/assignments.ts`; the app-shell sidebar axe `list` violation."]}],"originalFile":"# QA Report — SH-9 (PRD-09 Assignments & Submissions)\n\n## QA Summary\n\n- ticketId: SH-9\n- timestamp: 2026-11-09T06:10:50Z\n- overallStatus: FAIL\n- requirementsChecked: 78\n- requirementsPassed: 76\n- requirementsFailed: 2\n\n> This file replaces the stale SH-8 QA report. All 61 functional requirements PASS. The 2 failures are non-functional:\n> **NFR-12** is a small fix (3 `console.log` lines in the seed). **NFR-13** fails because `npm run test` is not fully green. All 6 failing tests are outside SH-9 and existed before it.\n> The feature is complete and works end to end. It is ready for review once NFR-12 is fixed and the NFR-13 failures are accepted as known or fixed separately.\n\n## Headline findings\n\n### 1. The build and test suite run, and the feature works end to end\n- `tsc --noEmit` is clean and `npm run lint` is clean.\n- All 57 SH-9 tests are green (29 unit, 23 integration against a real Postgres on :5433, 5 Playwright e2e against `next start -p 3100`).\n- QA added `tests/integration/assignments/qa-sh9.test.ts` (9 tests). It covers what Dev's tests did not: scheduling and visibility, publish-once, delete vs archive, duplicate, privacy and access control, the roster, \"To grade\", and editing max points.\n- All 9 pass. QA found no functional defects.\n- Dev's self-report checked out. All 55 `file-ownership-matrix.json` paths are present (54 exist; `vitest.tmp.config.ts` was deleted as planned). A grep found no TODO, FIXME or stub implementations in the SH-9 files.\n\n### 2. NFR-13: `npm run test` is not fully green, and the cause is outside SH-9\nThe full suite passed 306 of 312 tests on the first run. The 6 failures:\n\n| Test | Failure | Why it is not SH-9 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `attendance-qa.test.ts` FR-22 | expected 2 absence notifications to be 1 | `attendance-service.ts` was last changed Nov 6, before SH-9. SH-9 only added entries to `notifications/types.ts`. |\n| `attendance-qa.test.ts` FR-10/FR-19 | `FORBIDDEN` vs `OK` | Depends on the time of day (the attendance edit window). Not SH-9 code. |\n| `attendance-qa.test.ts` NFR-1 perf | timing | Flaky: it passed on the rerun. |\n| `auth.test.ts` rate limit | — | Flaky: it passed on the rerun. |\n| `auth-forms.test.tsx`, `useToast.test.tsx` | focus and timer assertions | Do not import SH-9 code. |\n| `lockout.test.ts` | next-auth can't resolve `next/server` under Node 24 ESM | Environment problem. Not SH-9 code. |\n\n- The repo has no git baseline: the git root is `$HOME` and the whole project is untracked. Before SH-9, `vitest.config.ts` could not load at all.\n- So QA cannot prove these failures existed before SH-9. The evidence above (file dates, imports, flakiness) points that way.\n- Strictly, NFR-13 (\"npm run test keeps passing\") is **not met**. It needs a separate fix outside this ticket.\n\n### 3. NFR-12: `console.log` in committed SH-9 code\n- `prisma/seed.ts` lines 303, 341 and 385 (the FR-61 \"course not found, skipping\" messages) use `console.log`.\n- `logger` is already imported in that file. The older seed blocks at lines 148 and 206 use the same pattern, which is probably why it was copied.\n- Fix: change those 3 lines to `logger.info(...)`.\n- The runtime code has no `console.log` (`src/server/assignments`, the API routes, the pages and the components).\n\n### 4. Notes for the reviewer (not failures)\n- **FR-41:** the student tab is registered and `/students/[id]/assignments` plus its API work, but no page renders `studentTabs`. The page is reachable by URL only. This gap was carried over from SH-8 and was known at intake.\n- **FR-40:** the nav entry also includes `ADMIN`, which the spec did not ask for. Admins get the cross-course \"To grade\" list. This is harmless, but it is a scope deviation.\n- **D11 / `next.config.js`:**\n  - `X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN` and `frame-ancestors 'self'` now apply to `/api/files/:id` only.\n  - There is also a webpack alias for `@mui/x-internals/useFirstRender`.\n  - These security-header and build changes need a human sign-off.\n- **e2e build freshness:**\n  - `src/app/api/me/assignments/route.ts` was changed at 11:02, after `.next/BUILD_ID` was built at 11:00 (local time).\n  - The e2e run used that build. The change is `force-dynamic`, a build-mode flag that does not change behaviour.\n  - That route is covered by the integration tests on source.\n- **Stale server:**\n  - A stale `next-server` (PID 63666) from 27 Oct is still listening on :3000 and serving old code. QA did not kill it.\n  - Playwright's `reuseExistingServer` would test the wrong code on :3000, so restart that server before manual QA.\n- **FR-61 seed:** QA checked the seed code but did not run it, to avoid changing the shared dev database. Dev reports the seed is idempotent (7 rows created, then 0 on a second run).\n- **NFR-3 / NFR-16:** these are checked against the implementation only (prefetch cache, keyboard handler). Nothing measures the timings automatically.\n\n## Requirement Results\n\n| Requirement | Status | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| FR-1 | PASS | `prisma/migrations/20261109000000_add_assignments/migration.sql`, `prisma/schema.prisma`; enums used by all integration tests |\n| FR-2 | PASS | `prisma/schema.prisma` Assignment (allowExtraCredit, notifiedAt, archivedAt, rubricId @unique, Cascade); `qa-sh9.test.ts` (archive, notifiedAt) |\n| FR-3 | PASS | `schema.prisma` AssignmentAttachment/Rubric/RubricCriterion; `qa-sh9.test.ts` FR-15 (rubric criteria copied) |\n| FR-4 | PASS | `schema.prisma` Submission/SubmissionFile/SubmissionHistory; `submissions.test.ts` resubmission history |\n| FR-5 | PASS | `schema.prisma` GradeExemption composite id; `submissions.test.ts` FR-35 |\n| FR-6 | PASS | `schema.prisma` AssignmentReminder unique; `reminders.test.ts` idempotency |\n| FR-7 | PASS | `src/lib/validators/assignments.ts`; `tests/unit/assignments/assignment-validators.test.ts` (limits, cutoff > due) |\n| FR-8 | PASS | `assignments-service.ts` `gradeOffline`; `grading.test.ts` \"offline grade creates attempt 0\" |\n| FR-9 | PASS | `AssignmentForm.tsx` (title, MarkdownEditor, FileUpload 'assignment', DateTimePicker in school TZ, late policy, rubric); e2e test 1 |\n| FR-10 | PASS | `src/lib/dates.ts` `nextTeachingDayDueAt`, used in `new/page.tsx:31`; `tests/unit/dates.test.ts` |\n| FR-11 | PASS | `RubricBuilder.tsx`; validator `rubricSumMessage`; `assignment-validators.test.ts` \"rejects a rubric whose criteria do not sum\"; e2e test 1 |\n| FR-12 | PASS | `AssignmentForm.tsx` Save draft / Publish / Schedule; `assertSchedule`; `qa-sh9.test.ts` FR-12 (past schedule rejected) |\n| FR-13 | PASS | `isAssignmentVisible`/`visibleWhere`; `qa-sh9.test.ts` FR-13 (hidden before, visible after, status stays SCHEDULED) |\n| FR-14 | PASS | `AssignmentForm.tsx:216-220` warning and banner; `qa-sh9.test.ts` FR-14 (scores kept after a max-points change) |\n| FR-15 | PASS | `duplicateAssignment`; `qa-sh9.test.ts` FR-15 (DRAFT, same dueAt, new rubric ids, unmanaged course FORBIDDEN) |\n| FR-16 | PASS | `src/config/course-tabs.ts:17` (ALL_ROLES) |\n| FR-17 | PASS | `CourseAssignmentsTable.tsx`, `listCourseAssignments` manager counts; e2e test 3 (Grade link from the row) |\n| FR-18 | PASS | `AssignmentList.tsx` grouped variant; `groupOf`; e2e tests 2 and 5; `qa-sh9.test.ts` student view |\n| FR-19 | PASS | `[assignmentId]/page.tsx`, `SubmissionPanel.tsx:41-48` \"Due in h min\"; e2e test 4 (instructions, rubric) |\n| FR-20 | PASS | `SubmissionPanel.tsx:123-154` localStorage draft, `FileUpload max={maxFileCount}`; `submissions.test.ts` maxFileCount / type rules |\n| FR-21 | PASS | `SubmissionPanel.tsx:223` ConfirmDialog; e2e test 2 (dialog → Submit) |\n| FR-22 | PASS | `submit()` rules; `submissions.test.ts` \"deadline and late rules\", exemption; `qa-sh9.test.ts` (not enrolled → FORBIDDEN) |\n| FR-23 | PASS | `grading-math.ts` `lateDays`; `grading-math.test.ts` (PRD example = 2, 24 h boundary) |\n| FR-24 | PASS | `submit()` history snapshot and grade clearing; `submissions.test.ts` \"resubmission snapshots history\", \"refuses resubmission once RETURNED\" |\n| FR-25 | PASS | `SubmissionPanel.tsx` receipt; e2e test 2 (\"(attempt 1)\") |\n| FR-26 | PASS | e2e test 4 (rubric scores 10/10, feedback); `grading.test.ts` FR-27 after return |\n| FR-27 | PASS | `toStudentSubmission`; `grading.test.ts` \"hides grades … until RETURNED\"; e2e test 2 \"Submitted — awaiting grading\" |\n| FR-28 | PASS | `GradingWorkspace.tsx:33-39,77-96,295-302` List, Chips, filter, sort; `listGradingRoster`; `qa-sh9.test.ts` FR-54 |\n| FR-29 | PASS | `FileList.tsx:36-39` img/iframe `?inline=1`; `GradingWorkspace.tsx:264,336-339` history dropdown; `qa-sh9.test.ts` (manager history) |\n| FR-30 | PASS | `GradingWorkspace.tsx:153,366` ToggleButtonGroup + `defaultPenalty`; e2e test 3 (10 + 10 → \"20 / 20\"); `grading.test.ts` D7 |\n| FR-31 | PASS | `computeFinalScore`; `grading-math.test.ts` \"18 @ 20 % = 14.40\", half-up; `qa-sh9.test.ts` FR-14 (14.40 stored) |\n| FR-32 | PASS | `gradeSubmission` return flag, `bulkReturn`; `grading.test.ts` bulk return; e2e test 3 Save & return |\n| FR-33 | PASS | `GradingWorkspace.tsx:62-64,246-258` J/K/Ctrl+Enter, `isTyping` guard (implementation only; no automated key test) |\n| FR-34 | PASS | `gradeOffline`, route `assignmen