|\n| FR-50 | PASS | `getAssignment`; `qa-sh9.test.ts` (own submission only); `grading.test.ts` (grade fields only once returned) |\n| FR-51 | PASS | `deleteOrArchiveAssignment`; `qa-sh9.test.ts` FR-51 (deleted vs archived; student FORBIDDEN) |\n| FR-52 | PASS | `visibleWhere` archivedAt; `qa-sh9.test.ts` FR-52 (hidden from get, submit, /assignments; manager still sees it) |\n| FR-53 | PASS | `submit` + `assertFileContext`; `submissions.test.ts` \"rejects files that are not mine or have the wrong context\" |\n| FR-54 | PASS | `listGradingRoster`; `qa-sh9.test.ts` FR-54 (non-submitter listed as NOT_SUBMITTED) |\n| FR-55 | PASS | `getSubmission`; `qa-sh9.test.ts` NFR-4/FR-55 (history only for the manager; other student, unlinked parent and other teacher get NOT_FOUND) |\n| FR-56 | PASS | `gradeSubmission`, `api/submissions/[id]/grade/route.ts`; `grading.test.ts` |\n| FR-57 | PASS | `api/me/assignments/route.ts`, `listMyAssignments`; `qa-sh9.test.ts` (parent studentId must be linked) |\n| FR-58 | PASS | `api/students/[id]/assignments/route.ts` → `listStudentAssignments` with `assertCanViewStudent` (code inspection; no automated test) |\n| FR-59 | PASS | `audit()` calls in grade, return, offline and exempt (`assignments-service.ts`, 9 calls); `grading.test.ts` (one audit row per return) |\n| FR-60 | PASS | `missingWhere`, `groupOf`, reminders filter; `submissions.test.ts` \"NO_SUBMISSION is never missing\"; `reminders.test.ts` |\n| FR-61 | PASS | `prisma/seed.ts:285-403` (MATH-7A ×4, ENG/ELA-7A ×2 with a 3-criterion rubric, SCI-7A NO_SUBMISSION offline). Inspected only; QA did not run it. |\n| NFR-1 | PASS | `grading-math.ts` Decimal (Prisma's bundled decimal.js); `grading-math.test.ts` \"no float drift\", half-up |\n| NFR-2 | PASS | `submit` uses `new Date()` on the server; no validator takes a client \"now\"; `submissions.test.ts` deadline rules |\n| NFR-3 | PASS | `GradingWorkspace.tsx:73,109` Map cache + next/prev prefetch (implementation only; <300 ms not measured) 