o warnings/errors |","-| `npx tsc --noEmit` | ✅ clean (incl. the new QA test) |","-| Quiz unit + integration (`tests/unit/quiz`, `tests/integration/quiz`) | ✅ **53/53**: 37 unit, 8 dev integration, 8 new QA integration |","-| E2E `tests/e2e/quizzes.spec.ts` (QA rerun on `next start -p 3100`) | ✅ **4/4** (build → publish → take with reload → grade essay → see results) |","-| Full `vitest run` | ⚠️ 360/366. 6 failures, all pre-existing (see below) |","+| `attendance-qa.test.ts` FR-22, FR-10/FR-19 | Pre-existing (SH-9/SH-10 lists) |","+| `auth.test.ts` rate limit | Pre-existing (flaky) |","+| `auth.test.ts` password reset | Contention only: passes when the file is run alone |","+| `auth-forms.test.tsx` ForgotPasswordForm | Pre-existing (fails alone too) |","+| `auth-forms.test.tsx` ChangePasswordForm ×3 | Contention only: pass when the file is run alone |","+| `useToast.test.tsx` auto-hide | Pre-existing |","+| `lockout.test.ts` (file fails to load) | Pre-existing (next-auth ESM) |"," ","-### 2. Full-suite failures are pre-existing and do not touch quiz code","-| Failing test | Status before SH-10 |","+Full run: **399/409 pass**. SH-11 changed no auth, attendance or toast code (`git diff --stat`).","+","+### 3. Environment note (not a defect)","+The dev DB's current academic year (2026-2027) has **no terms**, so both SH-11 Playwright specs crash in `beforeAll` (`terms[0].id`). QA inserted a temporary term, ran both specs (**2/2 pass**), and then deleted the term. No rows referenced it.","+","+## Gates run by QA","+| Check | Result |"," |---|---|","-| `attendance-qa.test.ts` FR-22, FR-10/FR-19 | Listed in the SH-9 report (time-of-day / attendance service) |","-| `auth.test.ts` rate limit | Listed in SH-9 (flaky) |","-| `auth-forms.test.tsx`, `useToast.test.tsx` | Listed in SH-9 |","-| `lockout.test.ts` | Listed in SH-9 (next-auth ESM resolution under Node 24) |","-| `email-dispatch.test.ts` AC-4 (concurrent dispatchers) | Flaky when run alongside other DB suites. Passed **3/3** when run alone. It tests `server/email/dispatch`, which SH-10 did not change; SH-10 only added two try/catch'd calls in the dispatch *route*. |","+| `npm run lint` | ✅ no warnings or errors |","+| `npm run typecheck` | ✅ clean (including the QA test files) |","+| `next build` | ✅ |","+| `prisma migrate status` | ✅ up to date (12 migrations). `grading_scale_one_default` index present |","+| SH-11 unit (25) + integration (21) | ✅ 46/46 |","+| SH-11 Playwright (prod build :3100) | ✅ 2/2 |","+| Full `vitest run` | ❌ 399/409 (Headlines 1–2) |","+| Static: banned UI imports / Pro grid features / `console.*` in new code | ✅ none |"," ","-### 3. Dev's self-reported completion matches the code","-- All 51 paths in `file-ownership-matrix.json` exist and contain real implementations.","-- There are no `TODO` or `FIXME` markers and no stub functions in the quiz code.","-- The two `ponytail:` notes in `attempt-service.ts` are documented trade-offs, not missing features: a hand-rolled cuid-shaped id, and a rare save-vs-submit race that a Regrade fixes.","-- All 23 tasks are marked complete, and each maps to the code that implements it.","+## Tests added by QA","+- `tests/integration/gradebook/qa-sh11.test.ts` (7 tests, Postgres). Covers FR-40 weights, FR-15 end to end in both the gradebook and the student view, FR-18 sort, FR-38 + NFR-4 grade.posted once with audit old→new, FR-9 synced comment-only, FR-42/NFR-5 hidden and unreturned exclusion for student and parent, NFR-6 refusals, FR-24 mark-missing due gate, FR-14 letter-only override + audit, and the **NFR-2 perf check (35×80 < 800 ms)**. Self-cleaning; verified 3/3 runs with zero leftovers.","+- `tests/unit/gradebook/validators.test.ts` (4 tests). Covers FR-16 band rules, weight sum, unique category names, the 1,000-character comment cap."," ","-### 4. New QA tests (`tests/integration/quiz/qa-sh10.test.ts`, 8 tests) fill the gaps in dev's coverage","-- **NFR-1:** asserts that the JSON from the student `getQuiz`, the in-progress attempt and the pre-release result never contains `\"correct\"`, `\"explanation\"` or the explanation text. Manager `getQuiz` does include them.","-- **FR-11 / FR-31:** the course list is shaped by role (manager / student / parent). Drafts are hidden from students. A student outside the course and a teacher of another course get NOT_FOUND. A quiz with no attempts can be deleted.","-- **FR-26 / FR-27:** checks the analytics summary (avg / median / high / low), the 10-bucket histogram, the option distribution, the most-chosen wrong option, and the CSV header and rows. Non-managers get NOT_FOUND.","-- **FR-34 / NFR-5:** a parent sees a linked child's result only after release. An unlinked parent, another student and another teacher get NOT_FOUND. Cross-student autosave and cross-course grading are refused.","-- **FR-28 / FR-38:** extra time feeds the deadline (10 + 15 = 25 min). An accommodation for a student not enrolled in the course gets NOT_FOUND. Accommodation, grade, regrade and release each write an `AuditLog` row.","-- **FR-31:** reorder rejects a partial or duplicate id list.","-- **NFR-2:** the median of 50 concurrent saves is under 50 ms. Saves are upserts: 2 rows after 51 saves.","+## Dev completion check","+All 33 tasks in `task-completion-markers.json` were checked. All 77 files in `file-ownership-matrix.json` exist and contain real implementations. No `TODO`/`FIXME`/stub markers were found in the new code."," "," ## Requirement Results"," "," | Requirement | Status | Evidence |"," |---|---|---|","-| FR-1 | PASS | `prisma/schema.prisma` (5 enums, 5 models, back-relations); `prisma/migrations/20261110000000_add_quizzes/migration.sql`; `migrate status` up to date; all integration tests use the models |","-| FR-2 | PASS | `src/lib/validators/quiz.ts`; `tests/unit/quiz/quiz-validators.test.ts` (window, 1–300, 1–10, 0.5–100, 2–8 options, 1–10 accepted, 10,000 chars, accommodation limits) |","-| FR-3 | PASS | `src/server/quiz/grading.ts`; `grading.test.ts` \"MULTIPLE_CHOICE partial credit — FR-2 example\" ({A,B}=0, {A}=2), SINGLE_CHOICE/TF all-or-nothing |","-| FR-4 | PASS | `grading.test.ts` \"SHORT_ANSWER normalises; ' Photosynthesis ' is correct\"; `needsReview` test; override in `regrade.test.ts` |","-| FR-5 | PASS | `grading.test.ts` \"ESSAY is manual\"; guidance in `correct.guidance` (`regrade.test.ts`) |","-| FR-6 | PASS | `edit/QuizSettingsPanel.tsx`; time-limit ≤ window rule in `quiz-validators.test.ts` \"rejects a time limit longer than the window\" |","-| FR-7 | PASS | `edit/QuestionList.tsx` (dnd-kit `useSortable`, Duplicate, Delete), `edit/QuestionEditor.tsx` (per-type editors); e2e adds 4 question types; server reorder tested in `qa-sh10.test.ts` |","-| FR-8 | PASS | `edit/QuizBuilder.tsx` L112 (running points total), L115/187 (Preview as student, `QuizPlayer mode='preview'` skips saves, L259/279) |","-| FR-9 | PASS | `grading.test.ts` \"canPublish\"; `regrade.test.ts` (publish with 0 questions → VALIDATION_ERROR) |","-| FR-10 | PASS | `regrade.test.ts` (edit lock: add/delete/points/essay-correct → CONFLICT; accepted answers editable; regrade keeps manual grades) |","-| FR-11 | PASS | `src/config/course-tabs.ts` L18; `CourseQuizzesView.tsx`; `qa-sh10.test.ts` role-shaped list test |","-| FR-12 | PASS | `take/page.tsx` + `QuizPlayer.tsx` start screen (time limit, attempts, confirm dialog L128); e2e student step |","-| FR-13 | PASS | `grading.test.ts` \"computeDeadline\" (AC-1) + \"seededShuffle\"; `serializers.test.ts` frozen order and seeded option shuffle |","-| FR-14 | PASS | `QuizPlayer.tsx` (RadioGroup/Checkbox/TextField, LinearProgress L332, navigator L336, sticky header L308, red timer under 2 min L319) |","-| FR-15 | PASS | `take/useAutosave.ts` (800 ms debounce, localStorage queue, 5 s retry); status pill labels `QuizPlayer.tsx` L221; e2e reload mid-attempt keeps answers |","-| FR-16 | PASS | `attempts.test.ts` \"autosave within grace succeeds; after deadline + 30 s it is 409 and the attempt is auto-submitted\" |","-| FR-17 | PASS | `regrade.test.ts` (essay → NEEDS_GRADING); `attempts.test.ts` double submit; unanswered count `QuizPlayer.tsx` L301 |","-| FR-18 | PASS | `attempts.test.ts` \"GET auto-submits an expired attempt\" + maintenance auto-submit test |","-| FR-19 | PASS | `attempts.test.ts` \"resume returns the same attempt; concurrent starts produce one attempt\"; e2e reload |","-| FR-20 | PASS | `grading.test.ts` \"resultsVisible\"; `regrade.test.ts` manual release (idempotent); `qa-sh10.test.ts` parent hidden until release |","-| FR-21 | PASS | `serializers.test.ts` (score, percent, correct + explanation only when showCorrectAnswers); `attempts/[attemptId]/page.tsx`; e2e \"student sees the results\" |","-| FR-22 | PASS | `grading.test.ts` \"applyScoringPolicy\" HIGHEST/LATEST/AVERAGE; `attempts.test.ts` getStudentQuizScore |","-| FR-23 | PASS | `grading.test.ts` \"attemptLimit adds extra attempts\"; `attempts.test.ts` attempt limit + accommodation (AC-8) |","-| FR-24 | PASS | `grade/QuizGradingWorkspace.tsx` (By student / By question, step 0.5); `regrade.test.ts` override + over-max → VALIDATION_ERROR; e2e \"teacher grades the essay\" |","-| FR-25 | PASS | `regrade.test.ts` essay graded → GRADED, score 6.50/7.00 |","-| FR-26 | PASS | `analytics.ts`, `QuizAnalytics.tsx` (x-charts BarChart); `qa-sh10.test.ts` summary + histogram |","-| FR-27 | PASS | `qa-sh10.test.ts` per-question % correct, avg points, option distribution, most-chosen wrong, CSV |","-| FR-28 | PASS | `qa-sh10.test.ts` (extra time → 25-min deadline; non-enrolled → NOT_FOUND); `attempts.test.ts` extra attempt |","-| FR-29 | PASS | `src/server/notifications/types.ts` L136 (`defaultEmail: false`, STUDENT); `regrade.test.ts` publish → 1 `quiz.published` notification |","-| FR-30 | PASS | `types.ts` L144 (STUDENT + PARENT); `regrade.test.ts` MANUAL release notifies students + parent once; `attempts.test.ts` AFTER_CLOSE idempotent under concurrent runs |","-| FR-31 | PASS | Route files under `src/app/api/{courses/[id]/quizzes,quizzes,questions}`; `regrade.test.ts` + `qa-sh10.test.ts` (CRUD, delete-only-without-attempts, reorder validation) |","-| FR-32 | PASS | `src/app/api/attempts/**`, `quizzes/[id]/attempts`; `attempts.test.ts` (start/resume, save, submit, owner-only) |","-| FR-33 | PASS | `attempts.test.ts` \"getStudentQuizScore … reports isPractice\" |","-| FR-34 | PASS | `src/server/quiz/access.ts` wraps `course-access.ts`; `qa-sh10.test.ts` parent / outsider / other-teacher checks |","-| FR-35 | PASS | `src/app/api/internal/email/dispatch/route.ts` L9, L40–50; `attempts.test.ts` \"maintenance … idempotent under concurrent runs\" |","-| FR-36 | PASS | `prisma/seed.ts` L455–557 (Fractions Check CLOSED + GRADED attempts; Unit 1 Test AFTER_CLOSE +3 days; Parts of Speech practice, 3 attempts, HIGHEST). Verified by code inspection: the dev DB has no MATH-7A, so this QA run could not execute it (the dev log records an idempotent fixture run) |","-| FR-37 | PASS | No sidebar entry needed per FR-37; the course tab (`course-tabs.ts` L18) plus direct routes cover it |","-| FR-38 | PASS | `qa-sh10.test.ts` asserts AuditLog actions `quiz.accommodation`, `quizAnswer.grade`, `quiz.regrade`, `quiz.release_results` |","-| FR-39 | PASS | `QuestionEditor.tsx` (MarkdownEditor + FileUpload); `QuizGradingWorkspace.tsx` MarkdownView; `files/contexts.ts` `'quiz'` resolver; `quiz-service.ts` `attachPromptFiles` |","-| NFR-1 | PASS | `serializers.test.ts` (no `correct` key); `qa-sh10.test.ts` (no `correct`/`explanation` in student quiz, attempt, or pre-release result JSON) |","-| NFR-2 | PASS | `attempt-service.ts` `saveAnswer` (one read + one upsert); `qa-sh10.test.ts` median of 50 concurrent saves < 50 ms, upsert-only. Not load-tested at 300 users |","-| NFR-3 | PASS | `QuizPlayer.tsx` native MUI Radio/Checkbox; `aria-live=\"assertive\"` L329, announced at 5 and 1 min L286–288; e2e axe scan of `<main>` |","-| NFR-4 | PASS | Grep found no banned imports (Tailwind/Radix/Recharts/notistack/etc.) and no `className` in quiz UI; BarChart from `@mui/x-charts`; the dev log records the mui-mcp lookups |","-| NFR-5 | PASS | Every quiz route handler and page calls `requireUser`/`requireRole` (static check); `qa-sh10.test.ts` + `attempts.test.ts` NOT_FOUND for non-owners and non-managers |","-| NFR-6 | PASS | Handlers use `withHandler` + `parseBody(zod)` + `ok()`; pagination in `listCourseQuizzes`; `CONFLICT` after deadline (`attempts.test.ts`) |","-| NFR-7 | **FAIL** | Code lives in `src/server/quiz/` and reuses `grading-math`, `notify`, `audit`, `csv`, `logger`, MarkdownView and ConfirmDialog, with no new deps. **But `prisma/seed.ts:463` and `:526` add `console.log`** (\"skipping its quizzes\"). Fix: use `logger.info` (already imported at L3) |","-| NFR-8 | **FAIL** | All the required tests exist and pass: grading/deadline/policy/serializer units, autosave-after-deadline / auto-submit / regrade integration, and the 4-step e2e. **But `npm run test` is not green**: 6 failures, all pre-existing and outside SH-10 (Headline 2). lint and typecheck are green |","-| NFR-9 | PASS | Builder flow: add + type picker + per-type editor + publish (`QuizBuilder.tsx`, `QuestionList.tsx`). The e2e builds and publishes a 4-question quiz through the UI. No human timing study was done |","-| NFR-10 | PASS | Out of scope, and none of it is present (grep for lockdown/webcam/question bank in `src` and the schema: no matches) |","+| FR-1 | PASS | `prisma/migrations/20261111000000_add_gradebook/migration.sql` and `prisma/schema.prisma`. `migrate status` up to date. All integration tests write these models |","+| FR-2 | PASS | `schema.prisma` (Course.gradingScaleId, Assignment/Quiz.categoryId). Category select in `AssignmentForm.tsx:285-288` and `QuizSettingsPanel.tsx:123`. `assertCategoryInCourse` in `gradebook-sync.ts:92` |","+| FR-3 | PASS | `gradebook-sync.test.ts` \"publishing an assignment creates its item in the containing term\". `term-placement.test.ts` |","+| FR-4 | PASS | `gradebook-sync.test.ts` \"FR-4: archive hides, hard delete removes\". Practice/delete quiz test |","+| FR-5 | PASS | `gradebook-sync.test.ts` \"AC-3: return syncs the score; saving without returning does not\" |","+| FR-6 | PASS | `gradebook-sync.test.ts` \"FR-6 / A1: exemption sets excused; removing it re-derives\" |","+| FR-7 | PASS | `gradebook-sync.test.ts` FR-7 IMMEDIATELY / MANUAL / AFTER_CLOSE tests (scaled to maxPoints) |","+| FR-8 | PASS | `backfill.test.ts` \"a second run changes nothing\". `package.json` `gradebook:backfill`. `scripts/gradebook-backfill.ts`. `seed.ts:590` |","+| FR-9 | PASS | `qa-sh11.test.ts` \"FR-9: synced grades accept a comment only\" (score/excused/maxPoints → VALIDATION_ERROR). Manual grades are edited in the same file and in the e2e |","+| FR-10 | PASS | `grade-calc.test.ts` AC-5, hidden-items, strict-due-boundary and nothing-counted cases |","+| FR-11 | PASS | `grade-calc.test.ts` \"AC-2: dropLowest 1\" and \"never drops every counted item\" |","+| FR-12 | PASS | `grade-calc.test.ts` no-categories, empty-categories renormalised, A8 Uncategorised |","+| FR-13 | PASS | `grade-calc.test.ts` \"89.95 → 90.0 → A-\", 76.95→77.0 C+, 76.94→76.9 C |","+| FR-14 | PASS | `grade-calc.test.ts` AC-6 / A12. `qa-sh11.test.ts` letter-only override via service (78.0 B, computed C+) |","+| FR-15 | PASS | `grade-calc.test.ts` golden case. `qa-sh11.test.ts` 78.0 C+ in both `getGradebook` and `getStudentGrades`. `gradebook.spec.ts` e2e |","+| FR-16 | PASS | `validators.test.ts` FR-16. `scales-service.ts` default swap / no un-default. DB partial unique index `grading_scale_one_default`. `admin/grading-scales/*`. (The service has no runtime test, see coverage report) |","+| FR-17 | PASS | `qa-sh11.test.ts` weights≠100 rejected. `GradebookSettingsClient.tsx` (live sum via `weightSum`, scale select) |","+| FR-18 | PASS | `GradebookGrid.tsx:380` `columnGroupingModel`, no pinned columns. `qa-sh11.test.ts` last-name sort + NFR-2 35×80. `gradebook.spec.ts` |","+| FR-19 | PASS | `GradebookGrid.tsx:112-115` (EX / M / —), `:226` M in red, `:230` late clock icon |","+| FR-20 | PASS | `gradebook.spec.ts` (digits+Enter, E, M, Delete → 78.0% C+, 6 audit rows). `GradebookGrid.tsx:303-317` |","+| FR-21 | PASS | `GradebookGrid.tsx:343-344`. The target routes `assignments/[assignmentId]/grade` and `quizzes/[quizId]/attempts/[attemptId]` exist |","+| FR-22 | PASS | `AddManualItemDialog.tsx`. `api/courses/[id]/grade-items/route.ts`. `qa-sh11.test.ts` `createManualItem` |","+| FR-23 | PASS | `TermOverrideDialog.tsx`. `api/courses/[id]/term-overrides/[studentId]/route.ts`. `validators.test.ts` 1,000-character cap. `qa-sh11.test.ts` override |","+| FR-24 | PASS | `qa-sh11.test.ts` mark-missing refused before due and applied after. Hide via `updateItem`. `ItemStatsDialog.tsx:19` (avg/median/high/low) |","+| FR-25 | PASS | `gradebook-service.ts` `exportGradebookCsv` uses `toCsv` from `@/server/csv`. Export button in `GradebookGrid.tsx:365` (no runtime test) |","+| FR-26 | PASS | `student-tabs.ts:17`. `StudentGradesView.tsx`. `grade-calc.test.ts` gradeColour. `qa-sh11.test.ts` colour `warning` at 78.0 |","+| FR-27 | PASS | `src/app/(app)/grades/page.tsx` + `GradesClient.tsx`. Nav entry `navigation.ts:39` (STUDENT, PARENT) |","+| FR-28 | PASS | `course-tabs.ts:22`. `courses/[courseId]/grades/page.tsx`. `qa-sh11.test.ts` course-filtered `getStudentGrades` |","+| FR-29 | PASS | `report-cards.test.ts` \"roster shows status and warnings\". `ReportCardsAdminClient.tsx` |","+| FR-30 | PASS | `report-cards.test.ts` \"generates a draft snapshot\". `snapshot.ts` |","+| FR-31 | PASS | `report-cards.test.ts` \"AC-8 … regeneration skips PUBLISHED\". `report-card-service.ts` `updateMany where status DRAFT` |","+| FR-32 | PASS | `report-cards.test.ts` \"comments follow field-level rules\". `access.ts:25` `canEditHomeroomComment`. `report-cards/[id]/*` |","+| FR-33 | PASS | `src/app/(app)/report-cards/page.tsx`. Nav `navigation.ts:41` (TEACHER) |","+| FR-34 | PASS | `report-cards.test.ts` \"AC-7: publish notifies Sam and Pat\" and \"unpublish … audited reason\". `report-cards.spec.ts` |","+| FR-35 | PASS | `report-cards.spec.ts` (print view hides sidebar / app bar / button under `print` media). `ReportCardDocument.tsx:24-31` (A4, page breaks). `PrintButton.tsx` `window.print()`. `report-cards/print/page.tsx` bulk |","+| FR-36 | PASS | `student-tabs.ts:18`. `students/[id]/report-cards/page.tsx` |","+| FR-37 | PASS | `report-cards.test.ts` \"a 7B student gets NOT_FOUND\", drafts hidden from family. `access.ts:13-18` |","+| FR-38 | PASS | `notifications/types.ts:153,161` (defaultEmail false/true). `qa-sh11.test.ts` grade.posted once per student per item, including parent. `report-cards.test.ts` report_card.published |","+| FR-39 | PASS | All 17 route files are thin (`requireUser`/`requireRole('ADMIN')` → validator → service). Services call `assertCanManageCourse` / `assertCanViewStudent`. `qa-sh11.test.ts` FORBIDDEN cases |","+| FR-40 | PASS | `qa-sh11.test.ts` 40+50 → VALIDATION_ERROR, 40+60 OK. `categories-service.ts` full replace in a transaction |","+| FR-41 | PASS | `prisma/seed.ts:548-604` (Standard A–F bands, 7A Homework 30/drop 1, Quizzes 30, Exams 40, Oral presentation, S1 drafts). \"Standard A–F\" is the default in the dev DB. The 7A block was verified by Dev on temp fixtures; QA did not re-run it (no 7A courses in the dev DB) |","+| FR-42 | PASS | `qa-sh11.test.ts` \"student view hides hidden items and unreturned scores\" (student + parent) and refusal of other student / unlinked parent |","+| NFR-1 | PASS | `grade-calc.ts` is pure (no Prisma, `now` injected) and uses Decimal helpers from `grading-math`. `grade-calc.test.ts` matrix (17) |","+| NFR-2 | PASS | `qa-sh11.test.ts` \"NFR-2: 35 students × 80 items loads in under 800 ms\" (`getGradebook`, warm), 3/3 runs |","+| NFR-3 | PASS | `report-card-service.ts` generate uses a fixed set of `findMany` calls plus one `loadCourseTermData` for all students/courses, and chunked `createMany`/`updateMany` (no N+1). The 600×8 < 30 s timing was **not load-tested** (Dev also skipped the optional perf test) |","+| NFR-4 | PASS | `qa-sh11.test.ts` grade.update audit old 7.00 → new 8.00, termOverride.upsert audit old/new. `report-cards.test.ts` unpublish audit with reason |","+| NFR-5 | PASS | `qa-sh11.test.ts` (hidden / unreturned). `report-cards.test.ts` (draft hidden). `gradebook-sync.test.ts` MANUAL quiz syncs only on release |","+| NFR-6 | PASS | `qa-sh11.test.ts` other teacher FORBIDDEN on gradebook and putGrade, student FORBIDDEN on putGrade, other student / unlinked parent refused. `report-cards.test.ts` 7B NOT_FOUND |","+| NFR-7 | PASS | Static scan: new UI imports only `@mui/material`, `@mui/icons-material`, `@mui/x-data-grid`, `@mui/x-date-pickers`, `react`, `next`. No banned libraries. Minor: two raw `<span>`s (`GradingScalesClient.tsx:68` is the MUI-documented Tooltip-on-disabled wrapper; `StudentGradesView.tsx:117` could be `Typography`) |","+| NFR-8 | PASS | Repo-wide grep: no `pinnedColumns`, `DataGridPro`/`Premium`, row grouping or aggregation. `columnGroupingModel` + `processRowUpdate` only |","+| NFR-9 | PASS | Reuses `csv.ts`, `grading-math`, `student-access`, `course-access`, `notify`, `audit`, `logger`, quiz `resultsVisible`. New code in `src/server/gradebook/` and `src/server/report-cards/`. No `console.*` in new code or in the seed diff. (DataGrid used instead of `DataTable` for 2 lists. The deviation is justified in dev-log) |","+| NFR-10 | PASS | `term-placement.ts:21-22` uses `schoolToday(date, tz)`. `term-placement.test.ts` \"uses the school-local date at day boundaries\". Past-due is a strict instant compare (`grade-calc.test.ts` boundary) |","+| NFR-11 | PASS | `report-cards.spec.ts` print media check. `ReportCardDocument.tsx:24` `@page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 12mm }`, one card per page |","+| NFR-12 | **FAIL** | lint ✅, typecheck ✅, all required SH-11 tests exist and pass. **But `npm run test` is 399/409**: 1 SH-11-induced flake (`qa-sh9` FR-13/FR-42, Headline 1) plus pre-existing failures (Headline 2) |","+| NFR-13 | PASS | `grade-calc.ts` never reads `gpa`. GPA is only stored in band JSON (`validators/gradebook.ts:42`). No rank or transcript code |"," ","-## Recommended follow-ups (not blocking feature behaviour)","-1. **NFR-7:** in `prisma/seed.ts` L463 and L526, change `console.log` to `logger.info`.","-2. **NFR-8:** triage the 6 pre-existing failures (carried over from SH-9), or mark them as known so the suite can be green.","-3. **Coverage gaps (low risk):** a unit test for the `useAutosave` offline queue/retry, and an e2e for builder duplicate, drag and preview.","-4. **From the dev log, outside SH-10's scope:** NUL bytes in `renderEmail` previews (`EmailOutbox` insert rejected); the chained-refine `DecimalError` in `validators/assignments.ts`; the app-shell sidebar axe `list` violation.","+## Recommended actions","+1. **Fix Headline 1:** in `publishOnce`, run the gradebook upsert after `notify()`, or guard it with try/log. Then rerun `qa-sh9.test.ts` several times.","+2. Triage or quarantine the pre-existing auth/attendance/toast/lockout failures so the suite can be green (carried over from SH-9/SH-10).","+3. Restore a term for the current academic year in the dev DB (the e2e specs require one), or make the specs create their own term.","+4. Optional: add runtime tests for `scales-service.ts` and the CSV export, and a load test for NFR-3."]}],"originalFile":"# QA Report — SH-10 (PRD-10 Quizzes & Online Exams)\n\n## QA Summary\n\n- ticketId: SH-10\n- timestamp: 2026-11-09T07:57:09Z\n- overallStatus: FAIL\n- requirementsChecked: 49\n- requirementsPassed: 47\n- requirementsFailed: 2\n\n> This file replaces the stale SH-9 QA report.\n> **All 39 functional requirements PASS. The feature works end to end.**\n> Two non-functional requirements FAIL, and neither is a feature defect:\n> - **NFR-7:** two new `console.log` calls in the quiz seed (`prisma/seed.ts:463`, `:526`). The fix is to change them to `logger.info`, which the file already imports.\n> - **NFR-8:** the full `npm run test` run is still not green. It has the **same 6 failing tests that were already failing before SH-10** (the SH-9 report lists them). None of them import quiz code.\n>\n> The verdict is consistent with SH-9, where the same two kinds of finding also produced FAIL. The feature is ready for review once the 2-line seed fix lands and the pre-existing failures are accepted as known or fixed separately.\n\n## Headline findings\n\n### 1. The build and tests run, and every quiz test is green\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `npx prisma migrate status` | ✅ 11 migrations, schema up to date (incl. `20261110000000_add_quizzes`) |\n| `npm run lint` | ✅ no warnings/errors |\n| `npx tsc --noEmit` | ✅ clean (incl. the new QA test) |\n| Quiz unit + integration (`tests/unit/quiz`, `tests/integration/quiz`) | ✅ **53/53**: 37 unit, 8 dev integration, 8 new QA integration |\n| E2E `tests/e2e/quizzes.spec.ts` (QA rerun on `next start -p 3100`) | ✅ **4/4** (build → publish → take with reload → grade essay → see results) |\n| Full `vitest run` | ⚠️ 360/366. 6 failures, all pre-existing (see below) |\n\n### 2. Full-suite failures are pre-existing and do not touch quiz code\n| Failing test | Status before SH-10 |\n|---|---|\n| `attendance-qa.test.ts` FR-22, FR-10/FR-19 | Listed in the SH-9 report (time-of-day / attendance service) |\n| `auth.test.ts` rate limit | Listed in SH-9 (flaky) |\n| `auth-forms.test.tsx`, `useToast.test.tsx` | Listed in SH-9 |\n| `lockout.test.ts` | Listed in SH-9 (next-auth ESM resolution under Node 24) |\n| `email-dispatch.test.ts` AC-4 (concurrent dispatchers) | Flaky when run alongside other DB suites. Passed **3/3** when run alone. It tests `server/email/dispatch`, which SH-10 did not change; SH-10 only added two try/catch'd calls in the dispatch *route*. |\n\n### 3. Dev's self-reported completion matches the code\n- All 51 paths in `file-ownership-matrix.json` exist and contain real implementations.\n- There are no `TODO` or `FIXME` markers and no stub functions in the quiz code.\n- The two `ponytail:` notes in `attempt-service.ts` are documented trade-offs, not missing features: a hand-rolled cuid-shaped id, and a rare save-vs-submit race that a Regrade fixes.\n- All 23 tasks are marked complete, and each maps to the code that implements it.\n\n### 4. New QA tests (`tests/integration/quiz/qa-sh10.test.ts`, 8 tests) fill the gaps in dev's coverage\n- **NFR-1:** asserts that the JSON from the student `getQuiz`, the in-progress attempt and the pre-release result never contains `\"correct\"`, `\"explanation\"` or the explanation text. Manager `getQuiz` does include them.\n- **FR-11 / FR-31:** the course list is shaped by role (manager / student / parent). Drafts are hidden from students. A student outside the course and a teacher of another course get NOT_FOUND. A quiz with no attempts can be deleted.\n- **FR-26 / FR-27:** checks the analytics summary (avg / median / high / low), the 10-bucket histogram, the option distribution, the most-chosen wrong option, and the CSV header and rows. Non-managers get NOT_FOUND.\n- **FR-34 / NFR-5:** a parent sees a linked child's result only after release. An unlinked parent, another student and another teacher get NOT_FOUND. Cross-student autosave and cross-course grading are refused.\n- **FR-28 / FR-38:** extra time feeds the deadline (10 + 15 = 25 min). An accommodation for a student not enrolled in the course gets NOT_FOUND. Accommodation, grade, regrade and release each write an `AuditLog` row.\n- **FR-31:** reorder rejects a partial or duplicate id list.\n- **NFR-2:** the median of 50 concurrent saves is under 50 ms. Saves are upserts: 2 rows after 51 saves.\n\n## Requirement Results\n\n| Requirement | Status | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| FR-1 | PASS | `prisma/schema.prisma` (5 enums, 5 models, back-relations); `prisma/migrations/20261110000000_add_quizzes/migration.sql`; `migrate status` up to date; all integration tests use the models |\n| FR-2 | PASS | `src/lib/validators/quiz.ts`; `tests/unit/quiz/quiz-validators.test.ts` (window, 1–300, 1–10, 0.5–100, 2–8 options, 1–10 accepted, 10,000 chars, accommodation limits) |\n| FR-3 | PASS | `src/server/quiz/grading.ts`; `grading.test.ts` \"MULTIPLE_CHOICE partial credit — FR-2 example\" ({A,B}=0, {A}=2), SINGLE_CHOICE/TF all-or-nothing |\n| FR-4 | PASS | `grading.test.ts` \"SHORT_ANSWER normalises; ' Photosynthesis ' is correct\"; `needsReview` test; override in `regrade.test.ts` |\n| FR-5 | PASS | `grading.test.ts` \"ESSAY is manual\"; guidance in `correct.guidance` (`regrade.test.ts`) |\n| FR-6 | PASS | `edit/QuizSettingsPanel.tsx`; time-limit ≤ window rule in `quiz-validators.test.ts` \"rejects a time limit longer than the window\" |\n| FR-7 | PASS | `edit/QuestionList.tsx` (dnd-kit `useSortable`, Duplicate, Delete), `edit/QuestionEditor.tsx` (per-type editors); e2e adds 4 question types; server reorder tested in `qa-sh10.test.ts` |\n| FR-8 | PASS | `edit/QuizBuilder.tsx` L112 (running points total), L115/187 (Preview as student, `QuizPlayer mode='preview'` skips saves, L259/279) |\n| FR-9 | PASS | `grading.test.ts` \"canPublish\"; `regrade.test.ts` (publish with 0 questions → VALIDATION_ERROR) |\n| FR-10 | PASS | `regrade.test.ts` (edit lock: add/delete/points/essay-correct → CONFLICT; accepted answers editable; regrade keeps manual grades) |\n| FR-11 | PASS | `src/config/course-tabs.ts` L18; `CourseQuizzesView.tsx`; `qa-sh10.test.ts` role-shaped list test |\n| FR-12 | PASS | `take/page.tsx` + `QuizPlayer.tsx` start screen (time limit, attempts, confirm dialog L128); e2e student step |\n| FR-13 | PASS | `grading.test.ts` \"computeDeadline\" (AC-1) + \"seededShuffle\"; `serializers.test.ts` frozen order and seeded option shuffle |\n| FR-14 | PASS | `QuizPlayer.tsx` (RadioGroup/Checkbox/TextField, LinearProgress L332, navigator L336, sticky header L308, red timer under 2 min L319) |\n| FR-15 | PASS | `take/useAutosave.ts` (800 ms debounce, localStorage queue, 5 s retry); status pill labels `QuizPlayer.tsx` L221; e2e reload mid-attempt keeps answers |\n| FR-16 | PASS | `attempts.test.ts` \"autosave within grace succeeds; after deadline + 30 s it is 409 and the attempt is auto-submitted\" |\n| FR-17 | PASS | `regrade.test.ts` (essay → NEEDS_GRADING); `attempts.test.ts` double submit; unanswered count `QuizPlayer.tsx` L301 |\n| FR-18 | PASS | `attempts.test.ts` \"GET auto-submits an expired attempt\" + maintenance auto-submit test |\n| FR-19 | PASS | `attempts.test.ts` \"resume returns the same attempt; concurrent starts produce one attempt\"; e2e reload |\n| FR-20 | PASS | `grading.test.ts` \"resultsVisible\"; `regrade.test.ts` manual release (idempotent); `qa-sh10.test.ts` parent hidden until release |\n| FR-21 | PASS | `serializers.test.ts` (score, percent, correct + explanation only when showCorrectAnswers); `attempts/[attemptId]/page.tsx`; e2e \"student sees the results\" |\n| FR-22 | PASS | `grading.test.ts` \"applyScoringPolicy\" HIGHEST/LATEST/AVERAGE; `attempts.test.ts` getStudentQuizScore |\n| FR-23 | PASS | `grading.test.ts` \"attemptLimit adds extra attempts\"; `attempts.test.ts` attempt limit + accommodation (AC-8) |\n| FR-24 | PASS | `grade/QuizGradingWorkspace.tsx` (By student / By question, step 0.5); `regrade.test.ts` override + over-max → VALIDATION_ERROR; e2e \"teacher grades the essay\" |\n| FR-25 | PASS | `regrade.test.ts` essay graded → GRADED, score 6.50/7.00 |\n| FR-26 | PASS | `analytics.ts`, `QuizAnalytics.tsx` (x-charts BarChart); `qa-sh10.test.ts` summary + histogram |\n| FR-27 | PASS | `qa-sh10.test.ts` per-question % correct, avg points, option distribution, most-chosen wrong, CSV |\n| FR-28 | PASS | `qa-sh10.test.ts` (extra time → 25-min deadline; non-enrolled → NOT_FOUND); `attempts.test.ts` extra attempt |\n| FR-29 | PASS | `src/server/notifications/types.ts` L136 (`defaultEmail: false`, STUDENT); `regrade.test.ts` publish → 1 `quiz.published` notification |\n| FR-30 | PASS | `types.ts` L144 (STUDENT + PARENT); `regrade.test.ts` MANUAL release notifies students + parent once; `attempts.test.ts` AFTER_CLOSE idempotent under concurrent runs |\n| FR-31 | PASS | Route files under `src/app/api/{courses/[id]/quizzes,quizzes,questions}`; `regrade.test.ts` + `qa-sh10.test.ts` (CRUD, delete-only-without-attempts, reorder validation) |\n| FR-32 | PASS | `src/app/api/attempts/**`, `quizzes/[id]/attempts`; `attempts.test.ts` (start/resume, save, submit, owner-only) |\n| FR-33 | PASS | `attempts.test.ts` \"getStudentQuizScore … reports isPractice\" |\n| FR-34 | PASS | `src/server/quiz/access.ts` wraps `course-access.ts`; `qa-sh10.test.ts` parent / outsider / other-teacher checks |\n| FR-35 | PASS | `src/app/api/internal/email/dispatch/route.ts` L9, L40–50; `attempts.test.ts` \"maintenance … idempotent under concurrent runs\" |\n| FR-36 | PASS | `prisma/seed.ts` L455–557 (Fractions Check CLOSED + GRADED attempts; Unit 1 Test AFTER_CLOSE +3 days; Parts of Speech practice, 3 attempts, HIGHEST). Verified by code inspection: the dev DB has no MATH-7A, so this QA run could not execute it (the dev log records an idempotent fixture run) |\n| FR-37 | PASS | No sidebar entry needed per FR-37; the course tab (`course-tabs.ts` L18) plus direct routes cover it |\n| FR-38 | PASS | `qa-sh10.test.ts` asserts AuditLog actions `quiz.accommodation`, `quizAnswer.grade`, `quiz.regrade`, `quiz.release_results` |\n| FR-39 | PASS | `QuestionEditor.tsx` (MarkdownEditor + FileUpload); `QuizGradingWorkspace.tsx` MarkdownView; `files/contexts.ts` `'quiz'` resolver; `quiz-service.ts` `attachPromptFiles` |\n| NFR-1 | PASS | `serializers.test.ts` (no `correct` key); `qa-sh10.test.ts` (no `correct`/`explanation` in student quiz, attempt, or pre-release result JSON) |\n| NFR-2 | PASS | `attempt-service.ts` `saveAnswer` (one read + one upsert); `qa-sh10.test.ts` median of 50 concurrent saves < 50 ms, upsert-only. Not load-tested at 300 users |\n| NFR-3 | PASS | `QuizPlayer.tsx` native MUI Radio/Checkbox; `aria-live=\"assertive\"` L329, announced at 5 and 1 min L286–288; e2e axe scan of `<main>` |\n| NFR-4 | PASS | Grep found no banned imports (Tailwind/Radix/Recharts/notistack/etc.) and no `className` in quiz UI; BarChart from `@mui/x-charts`; the dev log records the mui-mcp lookups |\n| NFR-5 | PASS | Every quiz route handler and page calls `requireUser`/`requireRole` (static check); `qa-sh10.test.ts` + `attempts.test.ts` NOT_FOUND for non-owners and non-managers |\n| NFR-6 | PASS | Handlers use `withHandler` + `parseBody(zod)` + `ok()`; pagination in `listCourseQuizzes`; `CONFLICT` after deadline (`attempts.test.ts`) |\n| NFR-7 | **FAIL** | Code lives in `src/server/quiz/` and reuses `grading-math`, `notify`, `audit`, `csv`, `logger`, MarkdownView and ConfirmDialog, with no new deps. **But `prisma/seed.ts:463` and `:526` add `console.log`** (\"skipping its quizzes\"). Fix: use `logger.info` (already imported at L3) |\n| NFR-8 | **FAIL** | All the required tests exist and pass: grading/deadline/policy/serializer units, autosave-after-deadline / auto-submit / regrade integration, and the 4-step e2e. **But `npm run test` is not green**: 6 failures, all pre-existing and outside SH-10 (Headline 2). lint and typecheck are green |\n| NFR-9 | PASS | Builder flow: add + type picker + per-type editor + publish (`QuizBuilder.tsx`, `QuestionList.tsx`). The e2e builds and publishes a 4-question quiz through the UI. No human timing study was done |\n| NFR-10 | PASS | Out of scope, and none of it is present (grep for lockdown/webcam/question bank in `src` and the schema: no matches) |\n\n## Recommended follow-ups (not blocking feature behaviour)\n1. **NFR-7:** in `prisma/seed.ts` L463 and L526, change `console.log` to `logger.info`.\n2. **NFR-8:** triage the 6 pre-existing failures (carried over from SH-9), or mark them as known so the suite can be green.\n3. **Coverage gaps (low risk):** a unit test for the `useAutosave` offline queue/retry, and an e2e for builder duplicate, drag and preview.\n4. **From the dev log, outside SH-10's scope:** NUL bytes in `renderEmail` previews (`EmailOutbox` insert rejected); the chained-refine `DecimalError` in `validators/assignments.ts`; the app-shell sidebar axe `list` violation.\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01PWKJd5cfBCjZh8ry6kM3jS","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
