ilds and removes its own `e2e-msg-*` users and course. It needs a current `AcademicYear` and at least one `Subject` in the database.\n- **Seed blocks skipped on this dev DB.** The dev DB has no courses, so the course-dependent seed blocks skip themselves with a `logger.warn`. This is the intended behaviour for missing prerequisites.\n- **Stale server on :3000.** The `next-server` on :3000 (13 days old) returns 500s. It was left running. The E2E ran against a fresh dev server on :3100, which has now been stopped.\n- **Rate limiter is per-process (ADR-4).** It only holds on a single instance. This is accepted.\n- **No user-admin form (ADR-11).** `isSafeguardingLead` can be set only through `PATCH /api/users/:id` and the seed.\n","numLines":63,"startLine":1,"totalLines":63}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015MMzgqwc1ppzAboef8SJG9","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
