ent`. `messaging.test.ts` \"FR-30/A11\". `qa-sh13.test.ts` FR-32 (`involvesStudent` is true). |","+| FR-31 | PASS | `insertMessage` updates `lastMessageAt`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"send bumps lastMessageAt\". |","+| FR-32 | PASS | `loadRelations`/`contacts.ts` use `coTeacherIds`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"a co-teacher manages the course\" and \"unrelated teacher 403\". |","+| NFR-1 | PASS | `access.ts` `getParticipation` (404 for non-participants and leavers) and `assertSafeguardingLead` (fresh DB read). `messaging.test.ts` \"non-participants and participants who left get 404\". `safeguarding.test.ts` 403s. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"ex-participant 404\". Live probes: every API returns 401 anonymously, and `/admin/safeguarding` redirects to `/login` (307). |","+| NFR-2 | PASS | `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"NFR-2: an 'after' poll with nothing new returns empty arrays, quickly\" (<100 ms at the service level against local Postgres). Keyset query on `(conversationId, createdAt)`. |","+| NFR-3 | PASS | No user-facing hard delete: `deleteMessage` sets `deletedAt`, and `editMessage` writes a `MessageRevision`. `safeguarding.test.ts` \"deleted body and revisions visible\". See observation O-1. |","+| NFR-4 | PASS | `assertRateLimit` (reuses `src/server/rate-limit.ts`). `messaging.test.ts` \"the 31st message in a minute is 429 RATE_LIMITED\". |","+| NFR-5 | PASS | QA scan: the messaging UI's only non-MUI third-party import is `date-fns`, a utility that renders nothing. No Tailwind, shadcn, Radix or notistack anywhere in `src`. All 57 MUI modules used (`@mui/material/*`, `@mui/icons-material/*`, `@mui/x-data-grid`) are standard documented exports and resolve under `tsc`. QA cannot independently verify that mui-mcp was consulted. `dev-log.md` records the lookups. |","+| NFR-6 | PASS | `src/lib/validators/messaging.ts` and services in `src/server/messaging/`. Thin `withHandler` routes. No `console.log` in messaging code (grep). UTC storage with `formatInSchoolTz` for display. |","+| NFR-7 | PASS | `MessagesLayout.tsx` `useMediaQuery(theme.breakpoints.down(768))` gives a single pane with back navigation. Verified by reading the code. No viewport test exists. |","+| NFR-8 | PASS | E2E `messaging.spec.ts` \"parent → teacher round trip appears in the other open thread within 6 s\", re-run by QA (✓ 25.6 s total). No websocket code (grep). |","+| NFR-9 | PASS | Grep of messaging server and UI code: no websocket, typing, reaction or WebRTC code, and no broadcast feature. No files outside the ownership matrix were changed for this feature. |","+| NFR-10 | **FAIL** | SH-13's own test requirements are met: the contact matrix, notification collapse, quiet-hours deferral and edit revision tests all exist and pass, as do both Playwright scenarios. Lint ✅ and typecheck ✅. **The \"existing suite stays green\" clause fails.** The full run is 505/510, and `lockout.test.ts` does not load. All are pre-existing (see Headline 1). |","+| NFR-11 | PASS | `reviewReport` audits `safeguarding.report.{review,dismiss}`. `updateUser` audits the flag change. `safeguarding.test.ts` \"FR-23/NFR-11\" and \"FR-2… audited\". |"," ","-### 2. Remaining full-suite failures are outside SH-11","+## Headline findings","+","+### 1. Full suite not green. All failures predate SH-13 (NFR-10)"," | Failing test | Status |"," |---|---|","-| `attendance-qa.test.ts` FR-22, FR-10/FR-19 | Pre-existing (SH-9/SH-10 lists) |","-| `auth.test.ts` rate limit | Pre-existing (flaky) |","-| `auth.test.ts` password reset | Contention only: passes when the file is run alone |","-| `auth-forms.test.tsx` ForgotPasswordForm | Pre-existing (fails alone too) |","-| `auth-forms.test.tsx` ChangePasswordForm ×3 | Contention only: pass when the file is run alone |","-| `useToast.test.tsx` auto-hide | Pre-existing |","-| `lockout.test.ts` (file fails to load) | Pre-existing (next-auth ESM) |","+| `attendance-qa.test.ts` FR-22, FR-10/FR-19 | Pre-existing (in the SH-9, SH-10 and SH-11 lists) |","+| `auth.test.ts` \"rate limits after 10 attempts per IP\" (timeout) | Pre-existing, flaky (SH-11 list) |","+| `auth-forms.test.tsx` ForgotPasswordForm focus | Pre-existing (SH-11 list) |","+| `useToast.test.tsx` auto-hide | Pre-existing (SH-11 list) |","+| `lockout.test.ts` (file fails to load, next-auth ESM) | Pre-existing (SH-11 list) |"," ","-Full run: **399/409 pass**. SH-11 changed no auth, attendance or toast code (`git diff --stat`).","+None of these files import messaging code. The SH-11 regression in `qa-sh9.test.ts` passed in this run."," ","-### 3. Environment note (not a defect)","-The dev DB's current academic year (2026-2027) has **no terms**, so both SH-11 Playwright specs crash in `beforeAll` (`terms[0].id`). QA inserted a temporary term, ran both specs (**2/2 pass**), and then deleted the term. No rows referenced it.","+### 2. No SH-13 defects found","+QA found no stubs, `TODO`s or placeholder logic in any of the 67 owned files. All of them exist and are non-empty."," ","+## Observations (non-blocking)","+- **O-1 (NFR-3, low):** `Message.sender` is `onDelete: Cascade`. If a User row were ever hard-deleted, that user's messages and revisions would be deleted with it. No code in `src/` hard-deletes users today (users are archived). Consider `Restrict` if retention must hold against DB-level deletes.","+- **O-2:** `canMessage()` in `contact-rules.ts` is exported but nothing calls it. Every caller uses `canMessageWith` or `messageableIds`. Delete it, or keep it as the documented FR-5 entry point.","+- **O-3:** `unreadCount` (the sidebar badge) includes muted conversations. The PRD does not specify this. Product should confirm the behaviour.","+- **O-4:** FR-16, FR-17, NFR-7 and the safeguarding/quiet-hours UIs have no automated UI tests. They were verified by reading the code. See `coverage-report.md` for suggested tests.","+- **O-5:** The FR-29 seed could not be fully verified on the dev DB because it has 0 courses. Re-seed a DB with courses to confirm the Pat↔Tom, MATH-7A and reported threads.","+"," ## Gates run by QA"," | Check | Result |"," |---|---|","-| `npm run lint` | ✅ no warnings or errors |"," | `npm run typecheck` | ✅ clean (including the QA test files) |","-| `next build` | ✅ |","-| `prisma migrate status` | ✅ up to date (12 migrations). `grading_scale_one_default` index present |","-| SH-11 unit (25) + integration (21) | ✅ 46/46 |","-| SH-11 Playwright (prod build :3100) | ✅ 2/2 |","-| Full `vitest run` | ❌ 399/409 (Headlines 1–2) |","-| Static: banned UI imports / Pro grid features / `console.*` in new code | ✅ none |","+| `npm run lint` | ✅ no warnings or errors |","+| SH-13 unit plus integration (`TEST_DATABASE_URL` = dev DB) | ✅ 90/90 (Dev 69 + QA 21) |","+| E2E `tests/e2e/messaging.spec.ts` (`APP_URL=http://localhost:3100`, fresh `next dev`) | ✅ 2/2. The server was stopped afterwards. |","+| Anonymous probes of 9 messaging/safeguarding endpoints and 1 page | ✅ 401 `UNAUTHENTICATED` / 307 → `/login` |","+| Full `vitest run` | ❌ 505/510 plus 1 file load error, all pre-existing (Headline 1) |","+| Ownership matrix (67 files) | ✅ all present and non-stub |"," ","-## Tests added by QA","-- `tests/integration/gradebook/qa-sh11.test.ts` (7 tests, Postgres). Covers FR-40 weights, FR-15 end to end in both the gradebook and the student view, FR-18 sort, FR-38 + NFR-4 grade.posted once with audit old→new, FR-9 synced comment-only, FR-42/NFR-5 hidden and unreturned exclusion for student and parent, NFR-6 refusals, FR-24 mark-missing due gate, FR-14 letter-only override + audit, and the **NFR-2 perf check (35×80 < 800 ms)**. Self-cleaning; verified 3/3 runs with zero leftovers.","-- `tests/unit/gradebook/validators.test.ts` (4 tests). Covers FR-16 band rules, weight sum, unique category names, the 1,000-character comment cap.","+## QA test files added","+- `tests/integration/messaging/qa-sh13.test.ts`: 12 tests covering FR-6/8/9/10/14/18/21/27/31/32 and NFR-2.","+- `tests/unit/messaging/composer-qa.test.tsx`: 9 tests covering the FR-11 composer, the FR-7 blocked state, and the FR-11/12/21/22 validators."," ","-## Dev completion check","-All 33 tasks in `task-completion-markers.json` were checked. All 77 files in `file-ownership-matrix.json` exist and contain real implementations. No `TODO`/`FIXME`/stub markers were found in the new code.","-","-## Requirement Results","-","-| Requirement | Status | Evidence |","-|---|---|---|","-| FR-1 | PASS | `prisma/migrations/20261111000000_add_gradebook/migration.sql` and `prisma/schema.prisma`. `migrate status` up to date. All integration tests write these models |","-| FR-2 | PASS | `schema.prisma` (Course.gradingScaleId, Assignment/Quiz.categoryId). Category select in `AssignmentForm.tsx:285-288` and `QuizSettingsPanel.tsx:123`. `assertCategoryInCourse` in `gradebook-sync.ts:92` |","-| FR-3 | PASS | `gradebook-sync.test.ts` \"publishing an assignment creates its item in the containing term\". `term-placement.test.ts` |","-| FR-4 | PASS | `gradebook-sync.test.ts` \"FR-4: archive hides, hard delete removes\". Practice/delete quiz test |","-| FR-5 | PASS | `gradebook-sync.test.ts` \"AC-3: return syncs the score; saving without returning does not\" |","-| FR-6 | PASS | `gradebook-sync.test.ts` \"FR-6 / A1: exemption sets excused; removing it re-derives\" |","-| FR-7 | PASS | `gradebook-sync.test.ts` FR-7 IMMEDIATELY / MANUAL / AFTER_CLOSE tests (scaled to maxPoints) |","-| FR-8 | PASS | `backfill.test.ts` \"a second run changes nothing\". `package.json` `gradebook:backfill`. `scripts/gradebook-backfill.ts`. `seed.ts:590` |","-| FR-9 | PASS | `qa-sh11.test.ts` \"FR-9: synced grades accept a comment only\" (score/excused/maxPoints → VALIDATION_ERROR). Manual grades are edited in the same file and in the e2e |","-| FR-10 | PASS | `grade-calc.test.ts` AC-5, hidden-items, strict-due-boundary and nothing-counted cases |","-| FR-11 | PASS | `grade-calc.test.ts` \"AC-2: dropLowest 1\" and \"never drops every counted item\" |","-| FR-12 | PASS | `grade-calc.test.ts` no-categorie