(unit). `loadRelations`, `validateNewConversation`, `canSendIn` (integration) | `canMessage` (has no callers in `src/`, so it is dead code). `messageableIds` (only `students/[id]/layout.tsx` uses it, and no test renders that layout) |","-| `messages.ts` | `toMessageDTO`, `assertRateLimit`, `listMessages` (`after`/`since` and `before` paging, hasMore, empty poll), `insertMessage` (including attachments), `sendMessage`, `editMessage`, `deleteMessage` | — |","-| `conversations.ts` | `listConversations` (tabs, search, preview, unread), `getConversation`, `createConversation`, `markRead`, `setMuted`, `setArchived`, `leave` (all branches), `unreadCount` | — |","-| `access.ts` | `getParticipation`, `isSafeguardingLead`, `assertSafeguardingLead` | `requireSafeguardingLead` and `requirePageSafeguardingLead` are covered only by QA's live probes: anonymous API call → 401, anonymous page → 307 to `/login`. No signed-in non-lead route test exists. The service-level 403 is tested. |","-| `quiet-hours.ts` | `isInQuietHours`, `quietHoursEnd` (wrap-midnight, DST), `getSettings`, `putSettings` | — |","-| `notifications.ts` | `onMessageSent` (collapse, mute, pending email), `onMessageReported` | — |","-| `email.ts` | `processPendingMessageEmails` (send, drop on read, drop when muted, quiet-hours deferral) | Two drop branches have no test: participant left, conversation missing |","-| `contacts.ts` | `listContacts`: STUDENT, PARENT and TEACHER groups, `?q=` filter, DROPPED exclusion | ADMIN branch (Staff/Students/Parents groups) and the TEACHER homeroom branch |","-| `reports.ts` | `reportMessage` (own message 403, duplicate 409, leads notified) | — |","-| `safeguarding.ts` | `listReports`, `getReport`, `reviewReport`, `searchConversations`, `getConversationForSafeguarding` (plus the audit rows) | The `from`/`to` date filters in `searchConversations` |","-| `src/server/files/contexts.ts` → `messageResolver` | participant, ex-participant, lead, non-lead admin, anonymous (QA) | — |","-| `src/server/services/users.ts` (isSafeguardingLead) | `updateUser` ADMIN-only plus audit (Dev safeguarding test) | — |","-| `src/lib/validators/messaging.ts` | send/create/report/settings/list-query schemas (QA) | `reviewReportSchema` and `safeguardingConversationsQuery` are tested only indirectly, through the services |","+### Branches still uncovered in shipped code","+- `audience.ts` `resolveOne`: `ROLE` with a null `refId`, and `GRADE_LEVEL` with `includeTeachers` only. Teacher clauses for courses outside the current year.","+- `audience.ts` `isUserInAudience([])`, the empty-audience early return.","+- `recurrence.ts`: the `MAX_STEPS` guard is never reached. A one-year weekly series yields 53 steps, which QA asserts.","+- `ical.ts` `vevent`: an all-day **series** (DATE-valued `UNTIL`) is not tested."," ","-## API route handlers (`src/app/api/{conversations,messages,messaging,safeguarding,me/messaging-settings}`): 15 files","+## Not built (0% coverage, files missing)"," ","-- These are thin `withHandler` wrappers: guard, then Zod parse, then service. No test calls the handlers directly.","-- QA confirmed on a live dev server that every handler group returns **401 UNAUTHENTICATED** without a session (conversations, messages POST, unread-count, safeguarding/reports, me/messaging-settings).","-- The E2E calls `POST /api/conversations` (403 for student→student) and drives the send and poll routes through the UI.","-- **Gap:** there is no handler-level test of the 403 for a signed-in non-lead calling `/api/safeguarding/*`. The service throws that 403 and the service is tested.","-","-## UI (`src/components/messaging/*`, pages): about 25% unit-tested, the rest is E2E-exercised or untested","-","-| Component | Coverage |","+| Task | Missing files |"," |---|---|","-| `Composer.tsx` | ✅ Unit (QA): Enter / Shift+Enter, blank, counter >4,500, FR-7 blocked state |","-| `MessagesLayout`, `ConversationList`, `MessageThread`, `NewConversationDialog`, `usePolling`, `/messages` pages | E2E only: parent→teacher round trip <6 s, student picker. No unit tests |","-| `ConversationMenu`, `MessagesNavBadge`, `StudentMessageActions`, `RosterTable`, `QuietHoursSection`, `SafeguardingReports`, `SafeguardingConversations`, `/admin/safeguarding` pages, `students/[id]/layout.tsx` | **No automated tests.** Verified only by reading the code. Their server logic is covered. |","+| TASK-8 | `src/server/calendar/calendar-service.ts` |","+| TASK-9 | `src/server/calendar/sources.ts` |","+| TASK-10 | `src/server/calendar/maintenance.ts`. The dispatch route was not modified. |","+| TASK-11–13 | No changes to `timetable-service.ts`, `attendance-service.ts`, attendance validator, register route or page, `RegisterForm.tsx` |","+| TASK-14 | `src/app/api/events/route.ts`, `[id]/route.ts`, `[id]/ics`, `[id]/rsvp`, `[id]/rsvps` |","+| TASK-15 | `src/app/api/calendar/route.ts`, `src/app/api/school-day/route.ts`, `academic-years/[id]/term-breaks/route.ts` |","+| TASK-16 | `me/calendar-feed` (plus `reset`), `calendar/feed/[token]`, `public/events`. `public-routes.ts` was not modified. |","+| TASK-17–22 | `AudienceBuilder.tsx`, `EventEditorDialog.tsx`, `EventDrawer.tsx`, `calendar/page.tsx`, `CalendarView.tsx`, `SourceChips.tsx`, `account/calendar/*`, `admin/academic-years/[id]/*`. `navigation.ts` was not modified. |","+| TASK-23 | No warnings in `AssignmentForm.tsx` or `QuizSettingsPanel.tsx` |","+| TASK-24 | `prisma/seed.ts` has no calendar events |","+| TASK-25–27 | `tests/integration/calendar/{calendar-merge,audience-parity,school-day,events-rsvp,feed-token}.test.ts`, `tests/e2e/calendar.spec.ts` |"," ","-## Seed (`prisma/seed.ts` `seedMessaging`)","-","-There is no test. The current dev DB has **0 courses**, so only the \"Staff room\" thread (4 messages) and Alice's `isSafeguardingLead=true` are present. The Pat↔Tom, MATH-7A and reported student threads were skipped by design (`logger.warn`).","-","-## Biggest coverage gaps (suggested next tests)","-1. A route-level test that a signed-in non-lead ADMIN gets 403 on `/api/safeguarding/*`.","-2. `listContacts` for ADMIN and for homeroom teachers.","-3. A component test for `ConversationMenu` (hide Leave when `canLeave` is false) and for `QuietHoursSection`.","-4. Run the seed against a DB that has courses, to confirm all four threads and the report.","+Across all of PRD-14, about 9 of the 61 files in the ownership matrix are done (TASK-1 to TASK-7, excluding the lock file). By task, coverage of the planned implementation is about 26% (7/27)."]}],"originalFile":"# Coverage Report — SH-13 (PRD-13 Direct Messaging)\n\n- ticketId: SH-13\n- timestamp: 2026-11-09T18:03:21Z\n- method: **function-level mapping, done by hand.** No coverage provider is installed (`@vitest/coverage-v8` is not in `devDependencies`), and QA did not add a dependency. Each exported function or component below was traced to the tests that execute it.\n\n## Test inventory (SH-13)\n\n| File | Author | Tests | Result |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `tests/unit/messaging/contact-rules.test.ts` | Dev | 43 | ✅ 43/43 |\n| `tests/unit/messaging/quiet-hours.test.ts` | Dev | 9 | ✅ 9/9 |\n| `tests/integration/messaging/messaging.test.ts` | Dev | 9 | ✅ 9/9 |\n| `tests/integration/messaging/email.test.ts` | Dev | 4 | ✅ 4/4 |\n| `tests/integration/messaging/safeguarding.test.ts` | Dev | 4 | ✅ 4/4 |\n| `tests/e2e/messaging.spec.ts` | Dev | 2 | ✅ 2/2 (QA re-ran it on a fresh `next dev -p 3100`) |\n| **`tests/integration/messaging/qa-sh13.test.ts`** | **QA (new)** | 12 | ✅ 12/12 |\n| **`tests/unit/messaging/composer-qa.test.tsx`** | **QA (new)** | 9 | ✅ 9/9 |\n| **Total** | | **92** | **✅ 92/92** |\n\nThe integration tests run against the real migrated Postgres. Set `TEST_DATABASE_URL` to the `.env` `DATABASE_URL` to run them.\n\n## Server code (`src/server/messaging/*`): 42 of 46 exported functions executed by tests (≈91%; the other 4 are `canMessage`, `messageableIds`, and the two route/page guards)\n\n| File | Covered | Not covered |\n|---|---|---|\n| `contact-rules.ts` | `canMessageWith`, `checkNewConversation`, `canSendInWith` (unit). `loadRelations`, `validateNewConversation`, `canSendIn` (integration) | `canMessage` (has no callers in `src/`, so it is dead code). `messageableIds` (only `students/[id]/layout.tsx` uses it, and no test renders that layout) |\n| `messages.ts` | `toMessageDTO`, `assertRateLimit`, `listMessages` (`after`/`since` and `before` paging, hasMore, empty poll), `insertMessage` (including attachments), `sendMessage`, `editMessage`, `deleteMessage` | — |\n| `conversations.ts` | `listConversations` (tabs, search, preview, unread), `getConversation`, `createConversation`, `markRead`, `setMuted`, `setArchived`, `leave` (all branches), `unreadCount` | — |\n| `access.ts` | `getParticipation`, `isSafeguardingLead`, `assertSafeguardingLead` | `requireSafeguardingLead` and `requirePageSafeguardingLead` are covered only by QA's live probes: anonymous API call → 401, anonymous page → 307 to `/login`. No signed-in non-lead route test exists. The service-level 403 is tested. |\n| `quiet-hours.ts` | `isInQuietHours`, `quietHoursEnd` (wrap-midnight, DST), `getSettings`, `putSettings` | — |\n| `notifications.ts` | `onMessageSent` (collapse, mute, pending email), `onMessageReported` | — |\n| `email.ts` | `processPendingMessageEmails` (send, drop on read, drop when muted, quiet-hours deferral) | Two drop branches have no test: participant left, conversation missing |\n| `contacts.ts` | `listContacts`: STUDENT, PARENT and TEACHER groups, `?q=` filter, DROPPED exclusion | ADMIN branch (Staff/Students/Parents groups) and the TEACHER homeroom branch |\n| `reports.ts` | `reportMessage` (own message 403, duplicate 409, leads notified) | — |\n| `safeguarding.ts` | `listReports`, `getReport`, `reviewReport`, `searchConversations`, `getConversationForSafeguarding` (plus the audit rows) | The `from`/`to` date filters in `searchConversations` |\n| `src/server/files/contexts.ts` → `messageResolver` | participant, ex-participant, lead, non-lead admin, anonymous (QA) | — |\n| `src/server/services/users.ts` (isSafeguardingLead) | `updateUser` ADMIN-only plus audit (Dev safeguarding test) | — |\n| `src/lib/validators/messaging.ts` | send/create/report/settings/list-query schemas (QA) | `reviewReportSchema` and `safeguardingConversationsQuery` are tested only indirectly, through the services |\n\n## API route handlers (`src/app/api/{conversations,messages,messaging,safeguarding,me/messaging-settings}`): 15 files\n\n- These are thin `withHandler` wrappers: guard, then Zod parse, then service. No test calls the handlers directly.\n- QA confirmed on a live dev server that every handler group returns **401 UNAUTHENTICATED** without a session (conversations, messages POST, unread-count, safeguarding/reports, me/messaging-settings).\n- The E2E calls `POST /api/conversations` (403 for student→student) and drives the send and poll routes through the UI.\n- **Gap:** there is no handler-level test of the 403 for a signed-in non-lead calling `/api/safeguarding/*`. The service throws that 403 and the service is tested.\n\n## UI (`src/components/messaging/*`, pages): about 25% unit-tested, the rest is E2E-exercised or untested\n\n| Component | Coverage |\n|---|---|\n| `Composer.tsx` | ✅ Unit (QA): Enter / Shift+Enter, blank, counter >4,500, FR-7 blocked state |\n| `MessagesLayout`, `ConversationList`, `MessageThread`, `NewConversationDialog`, `usePolling`, `/messages` pages | E2E only: parent→teacher round trip <6 s, student picker. No unit tests |\n| `ConversationMenu`, `MessagesNavBadge`, `StudentMessageActions`, `RosterTable`, `QuietHoursSection`, `SafeguardingReports`, `SafeguardingConversations`, `/admin/safeguarding` pages, `students/[id]/layout.tsx` | **No automated tests.** Verified only by reading the code. Their server logic is covered. |\n\n## Seed (`prisma/seed.ts` `seedMessaging`)\n\nThere is no test. The current dev DB has **0 courses**, so only the \"Staff room\" thread (4 messages) and Alice's `isSafeguardingLead=true` are present. The Pat↔Tom, MATH-7A and reported student threads were skipped by design (`logger.warn`).\n\n## Biggest coverage gaps (suggested next tests)\n1. A route-level test that a signed-in non-lead ADMIN gets 403 on `/api/safeguarding/*`.\n2. `listContacts` for ADMIN and for homeroom teachers.\n3. A component test for `ConversationMenu` (hide Leave when `canLeave` is false) and for `QuietHoursSection`.\n4. Run the seed against a DB that has courses, to confirm all four threads and the report.\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01CsWY8HXwE2chmjuaVeob2A","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
