ForUser` SQL filter including the parent child-filter, dedupe and inactive-user exclusion, `canTargetAudience` on real rows, and the schema constraints and cascades.\n- `tests/unit/calendar/qa-sh14.test.ts` (10 tests): notification type defaults, `expandOccurrences` edge cases, iCal fold boundary, empty feed, DST and non-DST VTIMEZONE, validator boundaries, and the missing FR-5 default.\n- `tests/unit/calendar/ical.test.ts`: one wrong expectation corrected (Headline 3).\n\n## Recommendation\nRe-run the Dev phase for TASK-8 to TASK-27, then run QA again. The foundation from TASK-1 to TASK-7 is solid and tested, and can be built on unchanged. When Dev adds the calendar service, add a case to `tests/unit/calendar/qa-sh14.test.ts` (or Dev's service tests) for the **FR-5 category default**.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":104,"newStart":1,"newLines":114,"lines":["-# QA Report — SH-13 (PRD-13 Direct Messaging)","+# QA Report — SH-14 (PRD-14 School Calendar, Events & Holidays)"," "," ## QA Summary"," ","-- ticketId: SH-13","-- timestamp: 2026-11-09T18:05:00Z","-- overallStatus: PARTIAL","-- requirementsChecked: 43","-- requirementsPassed: 42","-- requirementsFailed: 1","+- ticketId: SH-14","+- timestamp: 2026-11-10T00:49:09Z","+- overallStatus: FAIL","+- requirementsChecked: 49","+- requirementsPassed: 5","+- requirementsFailed: 44"," ","-> This file replaces the stale SH-11 QA report.","+> `requirementsFailed` counts **12 FAIL**, meaning partly built, plus **32 NOT-IMPLEMENTED**, meaning no code exists."," >","-> **All 32 functional requirements pass, and 10 of 11 non-functional requirements pass. All 92 SH-13 tests pass:** 71 by Dev, re-run by QA, plus 21 new QA tests. That covers unit tests, integration tests on real Postgres, and the Playwright E2E, which QA re-ran on a fresh dev server.","->","-> **One failure: NFR-10, \"the existing test suite stays green.\"** The full `vitest run` is **505/510**: 5 tests fail and 1 file does not load. **All six were already failing before SH-13.** They are the same items recorded in the SH-11 QA report, and none of those test files import messaging code. **SH-13 did not cause any regression.** The suite was already red before this ticket.","+> This file replaces the SH-13 QA report."," ","-## Requirement Results","+## Headline findings"," ","-| Requirement | Status | Evidence |","-|---|---|---|","-| FR-1 | PASS | `prisma/schema.prisma` (Conversation, ConversationParticipant, Message with `@@index([conversationId, createdAt])`, MessageAttachment, MessageReport, MessagingSettings, enum ReportStatus; cascades). Migration `20261112000000_add_direct_messaging` is applied. All integration suites run on it. |","-| FR-2 | PASS | `src/lib/validators/users.ts` and `src/server/services/users.ts`. `safeguarding.test.ts` \"FR-2: isSafeguardingLead can only be set on an ADMIN, and the change is audited\". The flag can be edited through `PATCH /api/users/:id` only. No admin user form exists (ADR-11, accepted at intake). |","-| FR-3 | PASS | `messages.ts` `editMessage` (revision written in a transaction). `messaging.test.ts` \"FR-3/FR-15: edit stores a revision…\" |","-| FR-4 | PASS | `PendingMessageEmail` with `@@unique([userId, conversationId])`. `messaging.test.ts` FR-19/FR-20 (one pending row). `email.test.ts` (4 tests). |","-| FR-5 | PASS | `contact-rules.ts` `canMessageWith`/`canMessage`. `contact-rules.test.ts`: 43-case role×role matrix. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"FR-6: parent→parent and student→parent are refused\". |","-| FR-6 | PASS | `validateNewConversation`. `messaging.test.ts` \"student↔student is 403\". `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"nothing is created\", \">25 participants rejected\", \"students in a staff-created group can reply\". E2E \"student → student… returns 403\". |","-| FR-7 | PASS | `canSendIn` and `sendMessage` (`RELATIONSHIP_ENDED`). `messaging.test.ts` \"a dropped student cannot send but the teacher still can\". `composer-qa.test.tsx` checks that the exact message \"You can no longer send messages in this conversation.\" is shown. |","-| FR-8 | PASS | `contacts.ts`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"FR-8: contacts are grouped, labelled…\": My teachers, My child's teachers (child), Students in X, Parents of students in X, School office, `?q=`, DROPPED excluded. |","-| FR-9 | PASS | `listConversations` and `ConversationList.tsx`/`MessagesLayout.tsx`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"FR-31/FR-9\" (sort, \"sender: text\" preview, unread, search by subject/name) and \"FR-14/FR-18\" (Inbox/Archived tabs). |","-| FR-10 | PASS | `MessageThread.tsx`: day groups via `formatInSchoolTz`, FileList, \"(edited)\", `DELETED_TEXT`, IntersectionObserver `?before=`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"older pages load 30 at a time\". `messaging.test.ts` (redacted delete). |","-| FR-11 | PASS | `Composer.tsx`. `composer-qa.test.tsx`: Enter sends, Shift+Enter does not, counter only after 4,500, body 1–5,000, ≤5 files. `qa-sh13.test.ts` FR-27 checks `context: 'message'` file linking. |","-| FR-12 | PASS | `NewConversationDialog.tsx`, fed by `/api/messaging/contacts`. `composer-qa.test.tsx` (subject ≤120, dedup). E2E parent→teacher round trip uses the dialog. |","-| FR-13 | PASS | `THREAD_POLL_MS=5000` (`MessageThread.tsx`), `LIST_POLL_MS=30000` (`ConversationList.tsx`, `MessagesNavBadge.tsx`). `messaging.test.ts` \"after+since poll\". E2E round trip <6 s. |","-| FR-14 | PASS | `conversations.ts` markRead/setMuted/setArchived/leave and `ConversationMenu.tsx`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"read clears unread + notification + pending email; archive moves tabs; mute is per user\" and \"leave rules\". |","-| FR-15 | PASS | `loadOwnEditable` (15-minute window, soft delete only). `messaging.test.ts` \"FR-3/FR-15…15-minute window; soft delete\". |","-| FR-16 | PASS | `src/app/(app)/students/[id]/layout.tsx` and `StudentMessageActions.tsx`: \"Message parents\" for staff, through `messageableIds`; \"Message teacher\" for linked parents. Verified by reading the code only. No automated test (see coverage report). |","-| FR-17 | PASS | `courses/[courseId]/roster/RosterTable.tsx`: checkbox selection plus \"Message selected students\". PARENT gets 404 and STUDENT gets a separate view in `page.tsx`. Verified by reading the code only. No automated test. |","-| FR-18 | PASS | `src/config/navigation.ts` (Messages, ALL_ROLES, badge), `shell.tsx`, `MessagesNavBadge.tsx`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` checks that `unreadCount` drops after read. A live probe of `/api/messaging/unread-count` without a session returns 401. |","-| FR-19 | PASS | `notifications.ts` `onMessageSent` and `types.ts` (`message.received`, COMMUNICATION, email true). `messaging.test.ts` \"three sends leave one unread notification\" and \"muted get no notification\". |","-| FR-20 | PASS | `email.ts` `processPendingMessageEmails`, hooked into the dispatch route. `email.test.ts`: sent when unread, dropped when read or muted, deferred to the end of quiet hours. |","-| FR-21 | PASS | `QuietHoursSection.tsx` on `/account/notifications` and `/api/me/messaging-settings`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"quiet-hours settings round trip…\". `quiet-hours.test.ts` (wrap and DST). |","-| FR-22 | PASS | `reports.ts`, `/api/messages/[id]/report`. `MessageThread.tsx` toast \"Reported — the school will review this.\". `composer-qa.test.tsx` (reason 1–1,000). `messaging.test.ts` \"duplicate OPEN report is 409; own message 403\". |","-| FR-23 | PASS | `safeguarding.ts` listReports (OPEN first)/getReport (±5 context)/reviewReport and `SafeguardingReports.tsx`. `safeguarding.test.ts` \"non-lead admins and teachers get 403\" and \"review needs a note; handled is 409\". |","-| FR-24 | PASS | `searchConversations` and `getConversationForSafeguarding`. `safeguarding.test.ts` \"student conversations only; deleted body and revisions visible\". |","-| FR-25 | PASS | `viewAudit` in `safeguarding.ts`. `safeguarding.test.ts` \"every view audited\" and \"report detail is audited\". |","-| FR-26 | PASS | `onMessageReported` and `types.ts` (`message.reported`, mandatoryInApp, email true, ADMIN). `messaging.test.ts` \"leads are notified\". |","-| FR-27 | PASS | `src/server/files/contexts.ts` `messageResolver`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"FR-27\": participant ✓, lead ✓, non-lead admin ✗, non-participant ✗, anonymous ✗, re-attach refused. |","-| FR-28 | PASS | 15 route files under `src/app/api/{conversations,messages,messaging,safeguarding,me/messaging-settings}` built on `withHandler` and Zod. A live probe of each group without a session returns 401 `UNAUTHENTICATED` in the standard error shape. The services behind them are covered by the integration suites. |","-| FR-29 | PASS | `prisma/seed.ts` `seedMessaging`: Alice is the lead, plus four threads with the specified message counts and one OPEN report, each checked against the contact rules. Dev DB: Alice `isSafeguardingLead=true` and \"Staff room\" (4 msgs) are present. The course-dependent threads are skipped because the dev DB has 0 courses, which is the designed `logger.warn` behaviour. |","-| FR-30 | PASS | `validateNewConversation` → `involvesStudent`. `messaging.test.ts` \"FR-30/A11\". `qa-sh13.test.ts` FR-32 (`involvesStudent` is true). |","-| FR-31 | PASS | `insertMessage` updates `lastMessageAt`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"send bumps lastMessageAt\". |","-| FR-32 | PASS | `loadRelations`/`contacts.ts` use `coTeacherIds`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"a co-teacher manages the course\" and \"unrelated teacher 403\". |","-| NFR-1 | PASS | `access.ts` `getParticipation` (404 for non-participants and leavers) and `assertSafeguardingLead` (fresh DB read). `messaging.test.ts` \"non-participants and participants who left get 404\". `safeguarding.test.ts` 403s. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"ex-participant 404\". Live probes: every API returns 401 anonymously, and `/admin/safeguarding` redirects to `/login` (307). |","-| NFR-2 | PASS | `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"NFR-2: an 'after' poll with nothing new returns empty arrays, quickly\" (<100 ms at the service level against local Postgres). Keyset query on `(conversationId, createdAt)`. |","-| NFR-3 | PASS | No user-facing hard delete: `deleteMessage` sets `deletedAt`, and `editMessage` writes a `MessageRevision`. `safeguarding.test.ts` \"deleted body and revisions visible\". See observation O-1. |","-| NFR-4 | PASS | `assertRateLimit` (reuses `src/server/rate-limit.ts`). `messaging.test.ts` \"the 31st message in a minute is 429 RATE_LIMITED\". |","-| NFR-5 | PASS | QA scan: the messaging UI's only non-MUI third-party import is `date-fns`, a utility that renders nothing. No Tailwind, shadcn, Radix or notistack anywhere in `src`. All 58 MUI modules used (`@mui/material/*`, `@mui/icons-material/*`, `@mui/x-data-grid`) are standard documented exports and resolve under `tsc`. QA cannot independently verify that mui-mcp was consulted. `dev-log.md` records the lookups. |","-| NFR-6 | PASS | `src/lib/validators/messaging.ts` and services in `src/server/messaging/`. Thin `withHandler` routes. No `console.log` in messaging code (grep). UTC storage with `formatInSchoolTz` for display. |","-| NFR-7 | PASS | `MessagesLayout.tsx` `useMediaQuery(theme.breakpoints.down(768))` gives a single pane with back navigation. Verified by reading the code. No viewport test exists. |","-| NFR-8 | PASS | E2E `messaging.spec.ts` \"parent → teacher round trip appears in the other open thread within 6 s\", re-run by QA (✓ 25.6 s total). No websocket code (grep). |","-| NFR-9 | PASS | Grep of messaging server and UI code: no websocket, typing, reaction or WebRTC code, and no broadcast feature. No files outside the ownership matrix were changed for this feature. |","-| NFR-10 | **FAIL** | SH-13's own test requirements are met: the contact matrix, notification collapse, quiet-hours deferral and edit revision tests all exist and pass, as do both Playwright scenarios. Lint ✅ and typecheck ✅. **The \"existing suite stays green\" clause fails.** The full run is 505/510, and `lockout.test.ts` does not load. All are pre-existing (see Headline 1). |","-| NFR-11 | PASS | `reviewReport` audits `safeguarding.report.{review,dismiss}`. `updateUser` audits the flag change. `safeguarding.test.ts` \"FR-23/NFR-11\" and \"FR-2… audited\". |","+### 1. Dev phase incomplete: 7 of 27 tasks shipped (blocking)","+`task-completion-markers.json` lists TASK-1 to TASK-7 only. `dev-rerun-count.json` shows 3 Dev runs, and earlier runs hit the turn limit. TASK-8 to TASK-27 have **no code**:","+- no calendar service","+- no API routes","+- no `/calendar` or `/account/calendar` pages","+- no holiday integration in timetable or attendance","+- no seed data","+- no integration or E2E suites"," ","-## Headline findings","+31 of the 61 ownership-matrix files are missing (see `coverage-report.md`). PRD-14 cannot be used by any role. Every user-facing acceptance criterion (1 to 8) is unmet."," ","-### 1. Full suite not green. All failures predate SH-13 (NFR-10)","-| Failing test | Status |","+### 2. What did ship is real and correct","+The shipped foundation is real code: the scheduler deps, the Prisma models and migration, date helpers, validators, the recurrence expander, the iCal builder, the audience resolver and the notification types. Nothing is a stub: there are no TODOs and no placeholder bodies. All of it passes its tests, including **17 new QA tests**, 7 of them on real Postgres.","+","+### 3. Dev test defect fixed by QA (test-only)","+`tests/unit/calendar/ical.test.ts:11` expected `'…b\\;c…'`. In a JS string, `\\;` is a plain `;`, so the test asserted the **pre-fix** behaviour and failed against the corrected `escapeText`. The RFC 5545 output `\\;` is right. QA changed the expectation to `'…b\\\\;c…'`. **QA changed no product code.**","+","+### 4. Full suite not green, all failures pre-existing (NFR-10)","+| Run | Result |"," |---|---|","-| `attendance-qa.test.ts` FR-22, FR-10/FR-19 | Pre-existing (in the SH-9, SH-10 and SH-11 lists) |","-| `auth.test.ts` \"rate limits after 10 attempts per IP\" (timeout) | Pre-existing, flaky (SH-11 list) |","-| `auth-forms.test.tsx` ForgotPasswordForm focus | Pre-existing (SH-11 list) |","-| `useToast.test.tsx` auto-hide | Pre-existing (SH-11 list) |","-| `lockout.test.ts` (file fails to load, next-auth ESM) | Pre-existing (SH-11 list) |","+| `vitest run` (no DB) | 410 pass, 2 fail, `lockout.test.ts` fails to load. **All three appear in the SH-11/SH-13 baseline:** `auth-forms` ForgotPasswordForm focus, `useToast` auto-hide, `lockout` next-auth ESM. |","+| `vitest run` (`TEST_DATABASE_URL` = dev DB) | 559/565. Baseline failures: `attendance-qa` FR-22 and FR-10/FR-19. Also `qa-sh9` FR-13/FR-42 and `attendance-qa` NFR-1 (perf) failed. **Both pass when re-run in isolation**, so they are flaky under parallel load. None of the failing files imports SH-14 code. |","+| `npm run typecheck` | ✅ clean |","+| `npm run lint` | ✅ no warnings or errors |","+| `prisma migrate status` | ✅ 14 migrations, schema up to date |","+| SH-14 tests (unit + QA integration) | ✅ **64/64** (Dev 47, including the fixed ical test, plus QA 17) |"," ","-None of these files import messaging code. The SH-11 regression in `qa-sh9.test.ts` passed in this run.","+## Requirement Results"," ","-### 2. No SH-13 defects found","-QA found no stubs, `TODO`s or placeholder logic in any of the 67 owned files. All of them exist and are non-empty.","+| Requirement | Status | Evidence |","+|---|---|---|","+| FR-1 | PASS | `package.json`: `@mui/x-scheduler` `9.0.0-beta.15` exact, `node-ical` `0.27.6`, scoped `@mui/x-internals` override. `npm ls` shows 9.17.0 overridden. `src/theme/theme.ts` augmentation passes `npm run typecheck`. |","+| FR-2 | PASS | `prisma/schema.prisma` has 4 enums and 4 models, with `@@id([eventId,userId])`, cascades and `@@index([startAt,endAt])`. Migration `20261113000000_add_calendar` is applied. `tests/integration/calendar/qa-sh14.test.ts` \"TASK-2 schema…\" checks the duplicate RSVP (P2002), the unique token hash and the cascade on event delete. |","+| FR-3 | PASS | `AudienceType` (SCHOOL/STAFF/ROLE/GRADE_LEVEL/SECTION/COURSE) is defined in the schema, with the resolver at `src/server/announcements/audience.ts`. `qa-sh14.test.ts` (integration): COURSE/SECTION/GRADE_LEVEL/SCHOOL/STAFF/ROLE resolve correctly, **and resolver ↔ user-side parity holds for all 10 fixture users**. |","+| FR-4 | FAIL | Partly built. The Zod rules are in `src/lib/validators/calendar.ts`, tested by `validators.test.ts` and `qa-sh14.test.ts` (title ≤150, description ≤5000, end ≥ start, until required and ≤1 year, guests 0–5). `schoolMidnight` exists (`dates.test.ts`). **Nothing stores events yet** (no calendar-service, TASK-8), so all-day midnight/exclusive-end storage is not wired. |","+| FR-5 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `isNoSchool` defaults to `false` in the schema and has no validator default. QA test \"isNoSchool has no schema default\" confirms this. The category-based default belongs in the missing `calendar-service.ts`. |","+| FR-6 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | Only the `ADMIN_ONLY_CATEGORIES` constant exists. Nothing enforces it: no service and no `POST /api/events`. |","+| FR-7 | FAIL | Partly built. `canTargetAudience` is correct: `audience.test.ts` (mocked) and `qa-sh14.test.ts` (real DB: teacher and co-teacher may target their COURSE, homeroom teacher their SECTION, a non-homeroom teacher may not, SCHOOL denied). **No `POST /api/events`**, so the 403 acceptance path does not exist. |","+| FR-8 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `src/app/api/events/[id]/route.ts` and `calendar-service.ts` are missing. |","+| FR-9 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `src/app/(app)/calendar/page.tsx` and `CalendarView.tsx` are missing. |","+| FR-10 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `SourceChips.tsx` and `sources.ts` are missing. Only the label and colour constants exist in the validators. |","+| FR-11 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No calendar page and no `sources.ts`. The resolver's `studentIds` filter exists (`qa-sh14.test.ts`), but no code uses it. |","+| FR-12 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `EventDrawer.tsx` and `api/events/[id]/ics` are missing. |","+| FR-13 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No calendar page and no deadline sources. |","+| FR-14 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `EventEditorDialog.tsx` and `AudienceBuilder.tsx` are missing. |","+| FR-15 | FAIL | Partly built. `expandOccurrences` is correct: `recurrence.test.ts` (weekly, monthly on the 31st, until, DST) and `qa-sh14.test.ts` (in-progress occurrence, empty range, 1-year bound). **No `GET /api/calendar`** returns occurrences. Series edits are not implemented. |","+| FR-16 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `src/server/calendar/calendar-service.ts` (`isSchoolDay`) is missing. |","+| FR-17 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `timetable-service.ts` `getScheduleForDate` is unchanged (`git diff` is empty). |","+| FR-18 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | Attendance service, route, page and `RegisterForm` are unchanged. |","+| FR-19 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `AssignmentForm.tsx` and `QuizSettingsPanel.tsx` are unchanged. |","+| FR-20 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `admin/academic-years/[id]` page and `term-breaks` route are missing. |","+| FR-21 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `api/events/[id]/rsvp` is missing. `rsvpSchema` exists (`validators.test.ts`), but nothing enforces deadlines. |","+| FR-22 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `api/events/[id]/rsvps` (CSV) and the drawer are missing. |","+| FR-23 | FAIL | Partly built. `event.rsvp_reminder` is registered (`qa-sh14.test.ts` unit). `src/server/calendar/maintenance.ts` and the dispatch hook are missing, so nothing sends it. |","+| FR-24 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `account/calendar/page.tsx` and `SubscribeCard.tsx` are missing. |","+| FR-25 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `api/me/calendar-feed` (plus `reset`) is missing. Only the `CalendarFeedToken.tokenHash` column exists. |","+| FR-26 | FAIL | Partly built. The RFC 5545 builder is correct: `ical.test.ts`, parsed by node-ical, covers escaping, folding, VTIMEZONE, RRULE with BYMONTHDAY, VALUE=DATE exclusive end, and URL on deadlines. `qa-sh14.test.ts` adds an empty feed, DST and non-DST VTIMEZONE, and a 75-octet boundary. **Nothing selects feed content** (no `sources.ts`, no feed route). |","+| FR-27 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `api/calendar/feed/[token]/route.ts` is missing. `public-routes.ts` is unchanged. |","+| FR-28 | FAIL | Partly built. `event.created` (email false) and `event.holiday_created` (email true) are registered (`qa-sh14.test.ts`). No create path sends them. |","+| FR-29 | FAIL | Partly built. `event.updated` is registered (`qa-sh14.test.ts`). No PATCH path sends it. |","+| FR-30 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `getPublicEvents` and `api/public/events` are missing. Only `publicEventsQuerySchema` exists. |","+| FR-31 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `getUpcomingEventsForUser` is missing. |","+| FR-32 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `api/calendar/route.ts` is missing. `calendarQuerySchema` (≤100 days) is tested, but nothing serves it. |","+| FR-33 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | All `api/events/**` routes are missing. |","+| FR-34 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `api/school-day/route.ts` is missing. |","+| FR-35 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `src/config/navigation.ts` has no calendar entries. |","+| FR-36 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No edit or delete path exists, so nothing calls `audit()`. |","+| FR-37 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `prisma/seed.ts` has no calendar events (0 matches). |","+| NFR-1 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No calendar UI shipped. `grep` finds no banned imports (FullCalendar, react-datepicker, notistack, tailwind) in `src/`, but Drawer, Dialog and useToast usage cannot be verified without UI. |","+| NFR-2 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No MUI components were used yet, so there are no MCP lookups to verify. |","+| NFR-3 | FAIL | Partly built. DST-week tests pass for expansion (`recurrence.test.ts`), all-day midnight (`dates.test.ts`) and iCal (`ical.test.ts` \"weekly RRULE keeps 15:30 local across DST\"). There is no UI and no feed endpoint to render on the correct dates. |","+| NFR-4 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No month-view endpoint or page to measure. |","+| NFR-5 | FAIL | Partly built. The schema stores only `tokenHash` (unique, checked in `qa-sh14.test.ts`). No 32-byte token generation and no feed scoping exist. |","+| NFR-6 | PASS | `tests/unit/calendar/ical.test.ts` \"buildCalendar parsed by node-ical\" (6 cases) and `qa-sh14.test.ts` empty-feed parse. The generator output is valid per node-ical. |","+| NFR-7 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No route handlers or server pages exist, so there are no `requireUser`/`requireRole` checks to verify. |","+| NFR-8 | FAIL | Partly built. The shipped code follows conventions: cuid IDs, `createdAt`/`updatedAt` on the main models, client-safe Zod validators, services under `src/server/calendar/`, no `console.log`. There are no handlers to check for response shapes or error codes. |","+| NFR-9 | FAIL | Partly built. The shipped code reuses `assertCanManageCourse`, `AppError`, `formatInSchoolTz`/`fromZonedTime` and the `dateOnly` validator, with no duplicate helpers and no renames. The planned reuse of `getScheduleForDate`, `rateLimit`, `notify`, `audit` and the maintenance cron is not built. |","+| NFR-10 | FAIL | Lint ✅, typecheck ✅, SH-14 unit tests ✅ 57/57 (Dev 47 + QA 10). Of the required suites, **integration** (calendar merge, feed token reset, RSVP deadline) and **Playwright** (3 scenarios) do not exist. The full suite is not green (pre-existing failures, Headline 4). |","+| NFR-11 | PASS | No out-of-scope behaviour shipped. `roomId` is stored but unused (schema comment). Recurrence is NONE/WEEKLY/MONTHLY only (`recurrence.ts`). There are no exception or sync models. |","+| NFR-12 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No UI exists for browser support or the 768 px default-view rule. |"," ","-## Observations (non-blocking)","-- **O-1 (NFR-3, low):** `Message.sender` is `onDelete: Cascade`. If a User row were ever hard-deleted, that user's messages and revisions would be deleted with it. No code in `src/` hard-deletes users today (users are archived). Consider `Restrict` if retention must hold against DB-level deletes.","-- **O-2:** `canMessage()` in `contact-rules.ts` is exported but nothing calls it. Every caller uses `canMessageWith` or `messageableIds`. Delete it, or keep it as the documented FR-5 entry point.","-- **O-3:** `unreadCount` (the sidebar badge) includes muted conversations. The PRD does not specify this. Product should confirm the behaviour.","-- **O-4:** FR-16, FR-17, NFR-7 and the safeguarding/quiet-hours UIs have no automated UI tests. They were verified by reading the code. See `coverage-report.md` for suggested tests.","-- **O-5:** The FR-29 seed could not be fully verified on the dev DB because it has 0 courses. Re-seed a DB with courses to confirm the Pat↔Tom, MATH-7A and reported threads.","+## Checks run"," ","-## Gates run by QA"," | Check | Result |"," |---|---|","-| `npm run typecheck` | ✅ clean (including the QA test files) |","-| `npm run lint` | ✅ no warnings or errors |","-| SH-13 unit plus integration (`TEST_DATABASE_URL` = dev DB) | ✅ 90/90 (Dev 69 + QA 21) |","-| E2E `tests/e2e/messaging.spec.ts` (`APP_URL=http://localhost:3100`, fresh `next dev`) | ✅ 2/2. The server was stopped afterwards. |","-| Anonymous probes of 9 messaging/safeguarding endpoints and 1 page | ✅ 401 `UNAUTHENTICATED` / 307 → `/login` |","-| Full `vitest run` | ❌ 505/510 plus 1 file load error, all pre-existing (Headline 1) |","-| Ownership matrix (67 files) | ✅ all present and non-stub |","+| Ownership matrix (61 entries) | TASK-1 to TASK-7: 16/16 present and non-stub (no TODO, FIXME or placeholder). TASK-8 to TASK-27: 31 CREATE files missing, 14 MODIFY files unchanged. |","+| SH-14 tests, `TEST_DATABASE_URL` set | ✅ 64/64 in 7 files |","+| QA fixture cleanup | ✅ 0 `qa-sh14` users left in the DB after the run |","+| Full suite, typecheck, lint | See Headline 4 |"," "," ## QA test files added","-- `tests/integration/messaging/qa-sh13.test.ts`: 12 tests covering FR-6/8/9/10/14/18/21/27/31/32 and NFR-2.","-- `tests/unit/messaging/composer-qa.test.tsx`: 9 tests covering the FR-11 composer, the FR-7 blocked state, and the FR-11/12/21/22 validators.","+- `tests/integration/calendar/qa-sh14.test.ts` (7 tests, real Postgres): audience resolution for every AudienceType, resolver ↔ `isUserInAudience` parity, `audienceWhereForUser` SQL filter including the parent child-filter, dedupe and inactive-user exclusion, `canTargetAudience` on real rows, and the schema constraints and cascades.","+- `tests/unit/calendar/qa-sh14.test.ts` (10 tests): notification type defaults, `expandOccurrences` edge cases, iCal fold boundary, empty feed, DST and non-DST VTIMEZONE, validator boundaries, and the missing FR-5 default.","+- `tests/unit/calendar/ical.test.ts`: one wrong expectation corrected (Headline 3)."," ","-QA changed no product code.","+## Recommendation","+Re-run the Dev phase for TASK-8 to TASK-27, then run QA again. The foundation from TASK-1 to TASK-7 is solid and tested, and can be built on unchanged. When Dev adds the calendar service, add a case to `tests/unit/calendar/qa-sh14.test.ts` (or Dev's service tests) for the **FR-5 category default**."]}],"originalFile":"# QA Report — SH-13 (PRD-13 Direct Messaging)\n\n## QA Summary\n\n- ticketId: SH-13\n- timestamp: 2026-11-09T18:05:00Z\n- overallStatus: PARTIAL\n- requirementsChecked: 43\n- requirementsPassed: 42\n- requirementsFailed: 1\n\n> This file replaces the stale SH-11 QA report.\n>\n> **All 32 functional requirements pass, and 10 of 11 non-functional requirements pass. All 92 SH-13 tests pass:** 71 by Dev, re-run by QA, plus 21 new QA tests. That covers unit tests, integration tests on real Postgres, and the Playwright E2E, which QA re-ran on a fresh dev server.\n>\n> **One failure: NFR-10, \"the existing test suite stays green.\"** The full `vitest run` is **505/510**: 5 tests fail and 1 file does not load. **All six were already failing before SH-13.** They are the same items recorded in the SH-11 QA report, and none of those test files import messaging code. **SH-13 did not cause any regression.** The suite was already red before this ticket.\n\n## Requirement Results\n\n| Requirement | Status | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| FR-1 | PASS | `prisma/schema.prisma` (Conversation, ConversationParticipant, Message with `@@index([conversationId, createdAt])`, MessageAttachment, MessageReport, MessagingSettings, enum ReportStatus; cascades). Migration `20261112000000_add_direct_messaging` is applied. All integration suites run on it. |\n| FR-2 | PASS | `src/lib/validators/users.ts` and `src/server/services/users.ts`. `safeguarding.test.ts` \"FR-2: isSafeguardingLead can only be set on an ADMIN, and the change is audited\". The flag can be edited through `PATCH /api/users/:id` only. No admin user form exists (ADR-11, accepted at intake). |\n| FR-3 | PASS | `messages.ts` `editMessage` (revision written in a transaction). `messaging.test.ts` \"FR-3/FR-15: edit stores a revision…\" |\n| FR-4 | PASS | `PendingMessageEmail` with `@@unique([userId, conversationId])`. `messaging.test.ts` FR-19/FR-20 (one pending row). `email.test.ts` (4 tests). |\n| FR-5 | PASS | `contact-rules.ts` `canMessageWith`/`canMessage`. `contact-rules.test.ts`: 43-case role×role matrix. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"FR-6: parent→parent and student→parent are refused\". |\n| FR-6 | PASS | `validateNewConversation`. `messaging.test.ts` \"student↔student is 403\". `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"nothing is created\", \">25 participants rejected\", \"students in a staff-created group can reply\". E2E \"student → student… returns 403\". |\n| FR-7 | PASS | `canSendIn` and `sendMessage` (`RELATIONSHIP_ENDED`). `messaging.test.ts` \"a dropped student cannot send but the teacher still can\". `composer-qa.test.tsx` checks that the exact message \"You can no longer send messages in this conversation.\" is shown. |\n| FR-8 | PASS | `contacts.ts`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"FR-8: contacts are grouped, labelled…\": My teachers, My child's teachers (child), Students in X, Parents of students in X, School office, `?q=`, DROPPED excluded. |\n| FR-9 | PASS | `listConversations` and `ConversationList.tsx`/`MessagesLayout.tsx`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"FR-31/FR-9\" (sort, \"sender: text\" preview, unread, search by subject/name) and \"FR-14/FR-18\" (Inbox/Archived tabs). |\n| FR-10 | PASS | `MessageThread.tsx`: day groups via `formatInSchoolTz`, FileList, \"(edited)\", `DELETED_TEXT`, IntersectionObserver `?before=`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"older pages load 30 at a time\". `messaging.test.ts` (redacted delete). |\n| FR-11 | PASS | `Composer.tsx`. `composer-qa.test.tsx`: Enter sends, Shift+Enter does not, counter only after 4,500, body 1–5,000, ≤5 files. `qa-sh13.test.ts` FR-27 checks `context: 'message'` file linking. |\n| FR-12 | PASS | `NewConversationDialog.tsx`, fed by `/api/messaging/contacts`. `composer-qa.test.tsx` (subject ≤120, dedup). E2E parent→teacher round trip uses the dialog. |\n| FR-13 | PASS | `THREAD_POLL_MS=5000` (`MessageThread.tsx`), `LIST_POLL_MS=30000` (`ConversationList.tsx`, `MessagesNavBadge.tsx`). `messaging.test.ts` \"after+since poll\". E2E round trip <6 s. |\n| FR-14 | PASS | `conversations.ts` markRead/setMuted/setArchived/leave and `ConversationMenu.tsx`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"read clears unread + notification + pending email; archive moves tabs; mute is per user\" and \"leave rules\". |\n| FR-15 | PASS | `loadOwnEditable` (15-minute window, soft delete only). `messaging.test.ts` \"FR-3/FR-15…15-minute window; soft delete\". |\n| FR-16 | PASS | `src/app/(app)/students/[id]/layout.tsx` and `StudentMessageActions.tsx`: \"Message parents\" for staff, through `messageableIds`; \"Message teacher\" for linked parents. Verified by reading the code only. No automated test (see coverage report). |\n| FR-17 | PASS | `courses/[courseId]/roster/RosterTable.tsx`: checkbox selection plus \"Message selected students\". PARENT gets 404 and STUDENT gets a separate view in `page.tsx`. Verified by reading the code only. No automated test. |\n| FR-18 | PASS | `src/config/navigation.ts` (Messages, ALL_ROLES, badge), `shell.tsx`, `MessagesNavBadge.tsx`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` checks that `unreadCount` drops after read. A live probe of `/api/messaging/unread-count` without a session returns 401. |\n| FR-19 | PASS | `notifications.ts` `onMessageSent` and `types.ts` (`message.received`, COMMUNICATION, email true). `messaging.test.ts` \"three sends leave one unread notification\" and \"muted get no notification\". |\n| FR-20 | PASS | `email.ts` `processPendingMessageEmails`, hooked into the dispatch route. `email.test.ts`: sent when unread, dropped when read or muted, deferred to the end of quiet hours. |\n| FR-21 | PASS | `QuietHoursSection.tsx` on `/account/notifications` and `/api/me/messaging-settings`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"quiet-hours settings round trip…\". `quiet-hours.test.ts` (wrap and DST). |\n| FR-22 | PASS | `reports.ts`, `/api/messages/[id]/report`. `MessageThread.tsx` toast \"Reported — the school will review this.\". `composer-qa.test.tsx` (reason 1–1,000). `messaging.test.ts` \"duplicate OPEN report is 409; own message 403\". |\n| FR-23 | PASS | `safeguarding.ts` listReports (OPEN first)/getReport (±5 context)/reviewReport and `SafeguardingReports.tsx`. `safeguarding.test.ts` \"non-lead admins and teachers get 403\" and \"review needs a note; handled is 409\". |\n| FR-24 | PASS | `searchConversations` and `getConversationForSafeguarding`. `safeguarding.test.ts` \"student conversations only; deleted body and revisions visible\". |\n| FR-25 | PASS | `viewAudit` in `safeguarding.ts`. `safeguarding.test.ts` \"every view audited\" and \"report detail is audited\". |\n| FR-26 | PASS | `onMessageReported` and `types.ts` (`message.reported`, mandatoryInApp, email true, ADMIN). `messaging.test.ts` \"leads are notified\". |\n| FR-27 | PASS | `src/server/files/contexts.ts` `messageResolver`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"FR-27\": participant ✓, lead ✓, non-lead admin ✗, non-participant ✗, anonymous ✗, re-attach refused. |\n| FR-28 | PASS | 15 route files under `src/app/api/{conversations,messages,messaging,safeguarding,me/messaging-settings}` built on `withHandler` and Zod. A live probe of each group without a session returns 401 `UNAUTHENTICATED` in the standard error shape. The services behind them are covered by the integration suites. |\n| FR-29 | PASS | `prisma/seed.ts` `seedMessaging`: Alice is the lead, plus four threads with the specified message counts and one OPEN report, each checked against the contact rules. Dev DB: Alice `isSafeguardingLead=true` and \"Staff room\" (4 msgs) are present. The course-dependent threads are skipped because the dev DB has 0 courses, which is the designed `logger.warn` behaviour. |\n| FR-30 | PASS | `validateNewConversation` → `involvesStudent`. `messaging.test.ts` \"FR-30/A11\". `qa-sh13.test.ts` FR-32 (`involvesStudent` is true). |\n| FR-31 | PASS | `insertMessage` updates `lastMessageAt`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"send bumps lastMessageAt\". |\n| FR-32 | PASS | `loadRelations`/`contacts.ts` use `coTeacherIds`. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"a co-teacher manages the course\" and \"unrelated teacher 403\". |\n| NFR-1 | PASS | `access.ts` `getParticipation` (404 for non-participants and leavers) and `assertSafeguardingLead` (fresh DB read). `messaging.test.ts` \"non-participants and participants who left get 404\". `safeguarding.test.ts` 403s. `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"ex-participant 404\". Live probes: every API returns 401 anonymously, and `/admin/safeguarding` redirects to `/login` (307). |\n| NFR-2 | PASS | `qa-sh13.test.ts` \"NFR-2: an 'after' poll with nothing new returns empty arrays, quickly\" (<100 ms at the service level against local Postgres). Keyset query on `(conversationId, createdAt)`. |\n| NFR-3 | PASS | No user-facing hard delete: `deleteMessage` sets `deletedAt`, and `editMessage` writes a `MessageRevision`. `safeguarding.test.ts` \"deleted body and revisions visible\". See observation O-1. |\n| NFR-4 | PASS | `assertRateLimit` (reuses `src/server/rate-limit.ts`). `messaging.test.ts` \"the 31st message in a minute is 429 RATE_LIMITED\". |\n| NFR-5 | PASS | QA scan: the messaging UI's only non-MUI third-party import is `date-fns`, a utility that renders nothing. No Tailwind, shadcn, Radix or notistack anywhere in `src`. All 58 MUI modules used (`@mui/material/*`, `@mui/icons-material/*`, `@mui/x-data-grid`) are standard documented exports and resolve under `tsc`. QA cannot independently verify that mui-mcp was consulted. `dev-log.md` records the lookups. |\n| NFR-6 | PASS | `src/lib/validators/messaging.ts` and services in `src/server/messaging/`. Thin `withHandler` routes. No `console.log` in messaging code (grep). UTC storage with `formatInSchoolTz` for display. |\n| NFR-7 | PASS | `MessagesLayout.tsx` `useMediaQuery(theme.breakpoints.down(768))` gives a single pane with back navigation. Verified by reading the code. No viewport test exists. |\n| NFR-8 | PASS | E2E `messaging.spec.ts` \"parent → teacher round trip appears in the other open thread within 6 s\", re-run by QA (✓ 25.6 s total). No websocket code (grep). |\n| NFR-9 | PASS | Grep of messaging server and UI code: no websocket, typing, reaction or WebRTC code, and no broadcast feature. No files outside the ownership matrix were changed for this feature. |\n| NFR-10 | **FAIL** | SH-13's own test requirements are met: the contact matrix, notification collapse, quiet-hours deferral and edit revision tests all exist and pass, as do both Playwright scenarios. Lint ✅ and typecheck ✅. **The \"existing suite stays green\" clause fails.** The full run is 505/510, and `lockout.test.ts` does not load. All are pre-existing (see Headline 1). |\n| NFR-11 | PASS | `reviewReport` audits `safeguarding.report.{review,dismiss}`. `updateUser` audits the flag change. `safeguarding.test.ts` \"FR-23/NFR-11\" and \"FR-2… audited\". |\n\n## Headline findings\n\n### 1. Full suite not green. All failures predate SH-13 (NFR-10)\n| Failing test | Status |\n|---|---|\n| `attendance-qa.test.ts` FR-22, FR-10/FR-19 | Pre-existing (in the SH-9, SH-10 and SH-11 lists) |\n| `auth.test.ts` \"rate limits after 10 attempts per IP\" (timeout) | Pre-existing, flaky (SH-11 list) |\n| `auth-forms.test.tsx` ForgotPasswordForm focus | Pre-existing (SH-11 list) |\n| `useToast.test.tsx` auto-hide | Pre-existing (SH-11 list) |\n| `lockout.test.ts` (file fails to load, next-auth ESM) | Pre-existing (SH-11 list) |\n\nNone of these files import messaging code. The SH-11 regression in `qa-sh9.test.ts` passed in this run.\n\n### 2. No SH-13 defects found\nQA found no stubs, `TODO`s or placeholder logic in any of the 67 owned files. All of them exist and are non-empty.\n\n## Observations (non-blocking)\n- **O-1 (NFR-3, low):** `Message.sender` is `onDelete: Cascade`. If a User row were ever hard-deleted, that user's messages and revisions would be deleted with it. No code in `src/` hard-deletes users today (users are archived). Consider `Restrict` if retention must hold against DB-level deletes.\n- **O-2:** `canMessage()` in `contact-rules.ts` is exported but nothing calls it. Every caller uses `canMessageWith` or `messageableIds`. Delete it, or keep it as the documented FR-5 entry point.\n- **O-3:** `unreadCount` (the sidebar badge) includes muted conversations. The PRD does not specify this. Product should confirm the behaviour.\n- **O-4:** FR-16, FR-17, NFR-7 and the safeguarding/quiet-hours UIs have no automated UI tests. They were verified by reading the code. See `coverage-report.md` for suggested tests.\n- **O-5:** The FR-29 seed could not be fully verified on the dev DB because it has 0 courses. Re-seed a DB with courses to confirm the Pat↔Tom, MATH-7A and reported threads.\n\n## Gates run by QA\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `npm run typecheck` | ✅ clean (including the QA test files) |\n| `npm run lint` | ✅ no warnings or errors |\n| SH-13 unit plus integration (`TEST_DATABASE_URL` = dev DB) | ✅ 90/90 (Dev 69 + QA 21) |\n| E2E `tests/e2e/messaging.spec.ts` (`APP_URL=http://localhost:3100`, fresh `next dev`) | ✅ 2/2. The server was stopped afterwards. |\n| Anonymous probes of 9 messaging/safeguarding endpoints and 1 page | ✅ 401 `UNAUTHENTICATED` / 307 → `/login` |\n| Full `vitest run` | ❌ 505/510 plus 1 file load error, all pre-existing (Headline 1) |\n| Ownership matrix (67 files) | ✅ all present and non-stub |\n\n## QA test files added\n- `tests/integration/messaging/qa-sh13.test.ts`: 12 tests covering FR-6/8/9/10/14/18/21/27/31/32 and NFR-2.\n- `tests/unit/messaging/composer-qa.test.tsx`: 9 tests covering the FR-11 composer, the FR-7 blocked state, and the FR-11/12/21/22 validators.\n\nQA changed no product code.\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01A94u71t88fP3xT4Yw48evV","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
